(3380152, 470869, 57421, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast between color and background. However, seems a bit oversharpened and the face is a little hidden.</td>', 'Nice contrast between color and background. However, seems a bit oversharpened and the face is a little hidden.', '2007-02-19 04:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
