(3380223, 471229, 65025, '<td valign="top">I love how the sign kinda has to do with the guy....he kinda parked his a$$ there.  Great. 8</td>', 'I love how the sign kinda has to do with the guy....he kinda parked his a$$ there.  Great. 8', '2007-02-19 05:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
