(3380744, 471364, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the guy playing the pipes.  I''d either up the saturation of color, or do it in black and white and up the contrast.  AS it is, it seems a tad washed out. I understand with the weather, but think it would be more impactful that way.</td>', 'I like the guy playing the pipes.  I''d either up the saturation of color, or do it in black and white and up the contrast.  AS it is, it seems a tad washed out. I understand with the weather, but think it would be more impactful that way.', '2007-02-19 09:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
