(3380820, 470722, 55956, '<td valign="top">the most famous kiss that I remember come from robert doisneau (the kiss to the hotel de ville)</td>', 'the most famous kiss that I remember come from robert doisneau (the kiss to the hotel de ville)', '2007-02-19 09:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3380821, 471233, 27605, '<td valign="top">Nice!  Great sense of motion, and the shallow dof and relatively sharp focus on the trumpeter is just right imo.  B/W seems a tad flat, although the darks show fine detail and the highlights for the most part aren''t blown except on the brass instruments.  If mine I would probably have cropped more vertically, losing the busy-ness at the right edge, and especially that paper plate (I think?) that the woman is using to shield her eyes... that element is pretty distracting to me.  Congrats on a great photo!</td>', 'Nice!  Great sense of motion, and the shallow dof and relatively sharp focus on the trumpeter is just right imo.  B/W seems a tad flat, although the darks show fine detail and the highlights for the most part aren''t blown except on the brass instruments.  If mine I would probably have cropped more vertically, losing the busy-ness at the right edge, and especially that paper plate (I think?) that the woman is using to shield her eyes... that element is pretty distracting to me.  Congrats on a great photo!', '2007-02-19 09:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3380826, 471314, 27605, '<td valign="top">Exposure, focus, and dof are all well executed.  Somewhat of a mundane subject IMO but a well-done photo nonetheless.</td>', 'Exposure, focus, and dof are all well executed.  Somewhat of a mundane subject IMO but a well-done photo nonetheless.', '2007-02-19 09:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3380835, 471294, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nicely titled and fairly well composed.  Starbucks? sneakers and communism - but after all, it was always about China rather than communism.  Hence the reason Russians called the Chinese ''radish communists'' - red on the outside and white on the inside.</td>', 'Nicely titled and fairly well composed.  Starbucks? sneakers and communism - but after all, it was always about China rather than communism.  Hence the reason Russians called the Chinese ''radish communists'' - red on the outside and white on the inside.', '2007-02-19 09:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3380839, 471419, 27605, '<td valign="top">Night shot, nice!  So much to see in this photo, I like all of the activity, and the difficult exposure is well executed.  I wish the primary subjects'' poses were more interesting, but the little girl in the background is a nice element.  7 <br/> <br/>PS, Detroit, eh?  <br/>//www.planet99.com/detroit/restaurants/9633.html</td>', 'Night shot, nice!  So much to see in this photo, I like all of the activity, and the difficult exposure is well executed.  I wish the primary subjects'' poses were more interesting, but the little girl in the background is a nice element.  7  PS, Detroit, eh?  //www.planet99.com/detroit/restaurants/9633.html', '2007-02-19 09:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3380841, 471481, 27605, '<td valign="top">Good job on the post processing; the sepia was a good choice IMO.  I agree that street photos don''t necessarily have to include people, however that said I still feel that in this case the choice of subject matter is a bit bland.  No offense intended, just an honest comment.  6</td>', 'Good job on the post processing; the sepia was a good choice IMO.  I agree that street photos don''t necessarily have to include people, however that said I still feel that in this case the choice of subject matter is a bit bland.  No offense intended, just an honest comment.  6', '2007-02-19 09:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3380845, 471467, 26669, '<td valign="top">i dont think the desat helps here.</td>', 'i dont think the desat helps here.', '2007-02-19 09:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3380851, 470597, 27605, '<td valign="top">Ok now, no points deducted for agreeing with Nick &lt;g&gt;!  Honest critique, however:  I would like this better if there were more interaction between the people in the photo.  True enough that it''s a slice of life shot however... your photo does indeed communicate that!  (5)</td>', 'Ok now, no points deducted for agreeing with Nick <g>!  Honest critique, however:  I would like this better if there were more interaction between the people in the photo.  True enough that it''s a slice of life shot however... your photo does indeed communicate that!  (5)', '2007-02-19 09:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3380863, 470489, 27605, '<td valign="top">Oooh, brutal title!  I wonder what she''s like.  Oh, and the photo itself is quite effective.  Some might criticize the fact that she''s walking off the page, so to speak, and suggest more room on the left for her to "walk into".  If you get such comments, I disagree with them.  I think that her position in the frame lends a sense of tension that I think you intended.  ...As if the photo communicates that most of her life is behind her.  Nice work.</td>', 'Oooh, brutal title!  I wonder what she''s like.  Oh, and the photo itself is quite effective.  Some might criticize the fact that she''s walking off the page, so to speak, and suggest more room on the left for her to "walk into".  If you get such comments, I disagree with them.  I think that her position in the frame lends a sense of tension that I think you intended.  ...As if the photo communicates that most of her life is behind her.  Nice work.', '2007-02-19 09:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3380872, 470979, 21714, '<td valign="top">Great observation. I love this shot.</td>', 'Great observation. I love this shot.', '2007-02-19 10:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3380877, 471480, 27605, '<td valign="top">I like the high contrast and the "frozen in time" effect achieved by the fast shutter.  The backlighting is a mixed bag IMO; works well with the gulls, the ornamental grass behind the guy, but also results in less detail in his face than I would like.  (6)</td>', 'I like the high contrast and the "frozen in time" effect achieved by the fast shutter.  The backlighting is a mixed bag IMO; works well with the gulls, the ornamental grass behind the guy, but also results in less detail in his face than I would like.  (6)', '2007-02-19 10:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3380897, 470986, 26669, '<td valign="top">not sharp enough for me, marking down 1 point.</td>', 'not sharp enough for me, marking down 1 point.', '2007-02-19 10:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3380901, 469671, 26669, '<td valign="top">i like the thinking but it does not work for me.</td>', 'i like the thinking but it does not work for me.', '2007-02-19 10:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3380910, 467690, 15711, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  I particularly like the "Don''t Walk" sign.  Great focus on the man.  I like the sepia toning as well.</td>', 'I really like this.  I particularly like the "Don''t Walk" sign.  Great focus on the man.  I like the sepia toning as well.', '2007-02-19 10:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3380920, 470317, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is the best one I''ve seen yet.  It has all of the elements to really make you "feel" the street: movement, a human subject and that bicycle really sends it over the top for me.  BRAVO 10</td>', 'This is the best one I''ve seen yet.  It has all of the elements to really make you "feel" the street: movement, a human subject and that bicycle really sends it over the top for me.  BRAVO 10', '2007-02-19 10:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3380925, 471514, 15711, '<td valign="top">To me, street photography needs the element of the urban hustle and bustle.  Yes, this is a street but it just looks like a snapshot in the snow. If a guy were walking across the street with the wind blowing his coat, THEN it''d really have the impact I''m searching for in this challenge.</td>', 'To me, street photography needs the element of the urban hustle and bustle.  Yes, this is a street but it just looks like a snapshot in the snow. If a guy were walking across the street with the wind blowing his coat, THEN it''d really have the impact I''m searching for in this challenge.', '2007-02-19 10:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3380933, 470979, 15711, '<td valign="top">WONDERFUL. This has that urban/human combination that I think is essential in street photography.  Great tones.  The juxtaposition between the two men is really symbolic: tall, short; young, old; head of hair, bald. The list goes on and on.  Bravo.</td>', 'WONDERFUL. This has that urban/human combination that I think is essential in street photography.  Great tones.  The juxtaposition between the two men is really symbolic: tall, short; young, old; head of hair, bald. The list goes on and on.  Bravo.', '2007-02-19 10:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3380936, 470700, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the element of human/urban. I think that is essential for the impact to work in street photography.  Good job.  The lighting on  his face and DOF is great.</td>', 'I like the element of human/urban. I think that is essential for the impact to work in street photography.  Good job.  The lighting on  his face and DOF is great.', '2007-02-19 10:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3380941, 471237, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  This has all of the elements to make for some POW in the shot: emotion, movement and the human mixed with the urban.  The dog''s expression sends it over the edge for me.  Bravo.</td>', 'Very nice.  This has all of the elements to make for some POW in the shot: emotion, movement and the human mixed with the urban.  The dog''s expression sends it over the edge for me.  Bravo.', '2007-02-19 10:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3380942, 470584, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting.  His profile is wonderful.  If the birds weren''t there, it would lose some of the impact.  Great balance between them and him. I love it.</td>', 'I love the lighting.  His profile is wonderful.  If the birds weren''t there, it would lose some of the impact.  Great balance between them and him. I love it.', '2007-02-19 10:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3380944, 471503, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love this, but it is inside, not on the street.  The tones and locale are great but not for street photography.</td>', 'I love this, but it is inside, not on the street.  The tones and locale are great but not for street photography.', '2007-02-19 10:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3380946, 471259, 25166, '<td valign="top">This is what the challenge is all about. Love it, but wish that tree wasn''t in the foreground</td>', 'This is what the challenge is all about. Love it, but wish that tree wasn''t in the foreground', '2007-02-19 10:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3380948, 470751, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the HDR but would really get more of the street photography sense if there were the human element, along with the hustle and bustle of the urban setting.</td>', 'I love the HDR but would really get more of the street photography sense if there were the human element, along with the hustle and bustle of the urban setting.', '2007-02-19 10:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3380951, 470559, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think this is missing the human element necessary to make street photography work.  The colors are awesome but there needs to be somebody walking past, to illustrate the hustle and bustle of street life.</td>', 'I think this is missing the human element necessary to make street photography work.  The colors are awesome but there needs to be somebody walking past, to illustrate the hustle and bustle of street life.', '2007-02-19 10:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3380954, 470888, 15711, '<td valign="top">If it weren''t for the name street in the title, I wouldn''t have that feel at all.  He could be inside.  I''d pan back and have more of the movement of the city street going on around him, to illustrate that he is actually in an urban setting.</td>', 'If it weren''t for the name street in the title, I wouldn''t have that feel at all.  He could be inside.  I''d pan back and have more of the movement of the city street going on around him, to illustrate that he is actually in an urban setting.', '2007-02-19 10:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3380955, 471066, 15711, '<td valign="top">YES! Love the juxtaposition between the woman and the billboard. Young, old; big, small; 3-d, 1-d.... on and on.  Nice!!!</td>', 'YES! Love the juxtaposition between the woman and the billboard. Young, old; big, small; 3-d, 1-d.... on and on.  Nice!!!', '2007-02-19 10:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3380965, 470830, 21714, '<td valign="top">I like how the guy fits into the tree, like the continents.</td>', 'I like how the guy fits into the tree, like the continents.', '2007-02-19 10:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3380969, 471204, 65083, '<td valign="top">great feel</td>', 'great feel', '2007-02-19 10:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
