(3380980, 468975, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think this has wonderful colors and I love the bike, but I''m missing the human element.  I''d love to see someone bustling by, to really give the sense of the street, if that makes sense.</td>', 'I think this has wonderful colors and I love the bike, but I''m missing the human element.  I''d love to see someone bustling by, to really give the sense of the street, if that makes sense.', '2007-02-19 10:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
