(3380986, 470725, 65083, '<td valign="top">noticed the coke can cool</td>', 'noticed the coke can cool', '2007-02-19 10:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3380987, 471418, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think street photography screams for the human element.  Yes, it''s a street, but for the subject title to really work, you need the sense of movement that the urban setting brings, so I am missing someone bustling by, or even sitting on that bench by the entryway.</td>', 'I think street photography screams for the human element.  Yes, it''s a street, but for the subject title to really work, you need the sense of movement that the urban setting brings, so I am missing someone bustling by, or even sitting on that bench by the entryway.', '2007-02-19 10:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3380988, 470948, 15711, '<td valign="top">I totally dig this. GREAT post editing.</td>', 'I totally dig this. GREAT post editing.', '2007-02-19 10:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3380989, 471350, 65083, '<td valign="top">cool picture for small town america</td>', 'cool picture for small town america', '2007-02-19 10:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3380990, 469370, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the juxtaposition between her and the sign with the three people walking the other way.  Nice colors.</td>', 'I like the juxtaposition between her and the sign with the three people walking the other way.  Nice colors.', '2007-02-19 10:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3380994, 471160, 65083, '<td valign="top">cool picture</td>', 'cool picture', '2007-02-19 10:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3380997, 469979, 15711, '<td valign="top">Cool how the people match the mosaic mural!!</td>', 'Cool how the people match the mosaic mural!!', '2007-02-19 10:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3380999, 469369, 15711, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  I love the high contrast and movement of the woman walking away.  Nice work.</td>', 'Excellent.  I love the high contrast and movement of the woman walking away.  Nice work.', '2007-02-19 10:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381002, 468708, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the setting but I''m missing the human element.  I think it''s essential in impactful street photography.</td>', 'I love the setting but I''m missing the human element.  I think it''s essential in impactful street photography.', '2007-02-19 10:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381005, 470416, 15711, '<td valign="top">What makes this closeup work as a street photograph, is that we can see the hint of the sidewalk and the building behind her. This is really good!!!</td>', 'What makes this closeup work as a street photograph, is that we can see the hint of the sidewalk and the building behind her. This is really good!!!', '2007-02-19 10:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381007, 471204, 21714, '<td valign="top">Interesting faces and looks like they are wearing new clothes too.</td>', 'Interesting faces and looks like they are wearing new clothes too.', '2007-02-19 10:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381009, 471424, 15711, '<td valign="top">If it were me, I''d crop out part of the area on the right with the moving trucks, and concentrate on the guys in the street. You definitely have the idea.</td>', 'If it were me, I''d crop out part of the area on the right with the moving trucks, and concentrate on the guys in the street. You definitely have the idea.', '2007-02-19 10:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381012, 470725, 21714, '<td valign="top">Brilliant! Now this is a fine composition. I love it when I see things I would never have imagined.</td>', 'Brilliant! Now this is a fine composition. I love it when I see things I would never have imagined.', '2007-02-19 10:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381017, 470460, 15711, '<td valign="top">YES!! Love the sense of movement and the contrast.  The mix of human/urban is what MAKES street photography.</td>', 'YES!! Love the sense of movement and the contrast.  The mix of human/urban is what MAKES street photography.', '2007-02-19 10:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381018, 470053, 29293, '<td valign="top">i wish the ball was in the frame</td>', 'i wish the ball was in the frame', '2007-02-19 10:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381020, 471391, 29293, '<td valign="top">i love to shoot from the hip, nicely done</td>', 'i love to shoot from the hip, nicely done', '2007-02-19 10:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381021, 470257, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the Billy Holiday mural.  Great sense of movement. She''s looking to the past, he''s moving toward the future.  Maybe I''m getting way too symbolic but I truly love this.  WAy to go.</td>', 'Love the Billy Holiday mural.  Great sense of movement. She''s looking to the past, he''s moving toward the future.  Maybe I''m getting way too symbolic but I truly love this.  WAy to go.', '2007-02-19 10:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381023, 471028, 15711, '<td valign="top">Wonderful.  The pigeons really make the shot. Lovely work.</td>', 'Wonderful.  The pigeons really make the shot. Lovely work.', '2007-02-19 10:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381029, 470869, 15711, '<td valign="top">Superb use of neg. space.  The orange of her outfit gives it the POP I love. Great shot.</td>', 'Superb use of neg. space.  The orange of her outfit gives it the POP I love. Great shot.', '2007-02-19 10:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381030, 471111, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love that the dog and her hair are the same color.  Wonderful division by the pole.  Nice stuff. 8</td>', 'I love that the dog and her hair are the same color.  Wonderful division by the pole.  Nice stuff. 8', '2007-02-19 10:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381033, 469787, 29293, '<td valign="top">nice light</td>', 'nice light', '2007-02-19 10:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381035, 471096, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love all of the hustle and bustle of all of the things behind him, then the car driving away plus his foot in motion.  Really suits the challenge!!</td>', 'I love all of the hustle and bustle of all of the things behind him, then the car driving away plus his foot in motion.  Really suits the challenge!!', '2007-02-19 10:46:28.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3381036, 471294, 15711, '<td valign="top">The cars'' reflection really makes the "street" aspect of the challenge work.  nice PP.</td>', 'The cars'' reflection really makes the "street" aspect of the challenge work.  nice PP.', '2007-02-19 10:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381037, 470195, 59029, '<td valign="top">I like the way this was shot through a screen of some sort, lends interest and makes it look like a painting. 8</td>', 'I like the way this was shot through a screen of some sort, lends interest and makes it look like a painting. 8', '2007-02-19 10:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381038, 470725, 15711, '<td valign="top">That coke can is GREAT. This is a superb image.  Very artful. 9</td>', 'That coke can is GREAT. This is a superb image.  Very artful. 9', '2007-02-19 10:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381039, 470317, 21714, '<td valign="top">Makes me think about the photograph and makes me think about what he''s thinking. I don''t think there would be a better way to capture this.<br/> <br/>I do think it doesn''t need the sort of sharpening, but let''s not get technical here.<br/> <br/>It''s a brilliant image.</td>', 'Makes me think about the photograph and makes me think about what he''s thinking. I don''t think there would be a better way to capture this. I do think it doesn''t need the sort of sharpening, but let''s not get technical here. It''s a brilliant image.', '2007-02-19 10:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381042, 470473, 15711, '<td valign="top">Terrific night shot.  The movement of the people makes it for me in combination with the complementary blue/gold tones.  NICE.</td>', 'Terrific night shot.  The movement of the people makes it for me in combination with the complementary blue/gold tones.  NICE.', '2007-02-19 10:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381044, 471523, 66348, '<td valign="top">Great shot, love the snow and the expression on his face. Well captured.</td>', 'Great shot, love the snow and the expression on his face. Well captured.', '2007-02-19 10:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381046, 470920, 15711, '<td valign="top">Fantasatic.  Love the movment and the city lights.  Great for the challenge. 8</td>', 'Fantasatic.  Love the movment and the city lights.  Great for the challenge. 8', '2007-02-19 10:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381050, 470751, 23484, '<td valign="top">I love the processing in this shot.  Really neat.</td>', 'I love the processing in this shot.  Really neat.', '2007-02-19 10:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381052, 470161, 66348, '<td valign="top">Great shot, are you sure they are breaking, this is how contruction usually goes, I would know. hahah, great shot, sharpness, clarity and composition.</td>', 'Great shot, are you sure they are breaking, this is how contruction usually goes, I would know. hahah, great shot, sharpness, clarity and composition.', '2007-02-19 10:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
