(3381225, 470475, 27605, '<td valign="top">Hope you don''t think I''m heartless, but I don''t believe a word of it!  In fact I''m curious about the sign that is behind the first one... it seems to say something about "creative... aid"!  Now that I believe!<br/> <br/>As for the photo itself, it is really nicely executed.  The subject is nicely separated from the background, and the b/w converstion looks great.  A few blown highlights noted along the wheel and mudflap, but just nit-picking.  Nice work.</td>', 'Hope you don''t think I''m heartless, but I don''t believe a word of it!  In fact I''m curious about the sign that is behind the first one... it seems to say something about "creative... aid"!  Now that I believe! As for the photo itself, it is really nicely executed.  The subject is nicely separated from the background, and the b/w converstion looks great.  A few blown highlights noted along the wheel and mudflap, but just nit-picking.  Nice work.', '2007-02-19 11:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
