(3381262, 471237, 27605, '<td valign="top">Oh wow, this is great work.  The exposure and the b/w conversion are stellar.  The interaction of the subjects is fabulous.  I don''t agree with the inclusion of that much wall on the right side of the photo and think it would be better to crop it just behind the post, but that is a nit-pick.  Even so, I''m one of your 10s and predict I''ll have a lot of company there.  Congrats on an outstanding shot.</td>', 'Oh wow, this is great work.  The exposure and the b/w conversion are stellar.  The interaction of the subjects is fabulous.  I don''t agree with the inclusion of that much wall on the right side of the photo and think it would be better to crop it just behind the post, but that is a nit-pick.  Even so, I''m one of your 10s and predict I''ll have a lot of company there.  Congrats on an outstanding shot.', '2007-02-19 11:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
