(3381277, 471014, 27605, '<td valign="top">Poor pup!  I think this opportunity had great potential, and I like much of what you''ve done.  However I think there is way too much sky included; I would crop it down to the point of the roof on the left side behind the old pickup myself.  Hope the little dog learned his lesson and stays safe!</td>', 'Poor pup!  I think this opportunity had great potential, and I like much of what you''ve done.  However I think there is way too much sky included; I would crop it down to the point of the roof on the left side behind the old pickup myself.  Hope the little dog learned his lesson and stays safe!', '2007-02-19 11:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
