(3381398, 470725, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is good!  That enormous briefcase give it the flare for the unique, and the splash of red with the coke can.  Brilliant :)</td>', 'This is good!  That enormous briefcase give it the flare for the unique, and the splash of red with the coke can.  Brilliant :)', '2007-02-19 12:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
