(3381407, 470489, 24454, '<td valign="top">What a sad title, but unfortunately, it''s probably true.  I like your capture with that old graffiti wall in the background  .</td>', 'What a sad title, but unfortunately, it''s probably true.  I like your capture with that old graffiti wall in the background  .', '2007-02-19 12:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381409, 470527, 64446, '<td valign="top">Great expression. I like the B&amp;W here. I''d have take out the right side with the card labels, etc.<br/>Image is a bit grainy for my taste: maybe a result of too much USM or cropping too much.</td>', 'Great expression. I like the B&W here. I''d have take out the right side with the card labels, etc.Image is a bit grainy for my taste: maybe a result of too much USM or cropping too much.', '2007-02-19 12:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381413, 470966, 24454, '<td valign="top">I really love this one.   I love the minimalist effect of this perspective.  The composition is perfect with the writing on the floor.  Beautiful!</td>', 'I really love this one.   I love the minimalist effect of this perspective.  The composition is perfect with the writing on the floor.  Beautiful!', '2007-02-19 12:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381417, 471216, 64446, '<td valign="top">Nice pastel tones. If you could just get rid of that mike!</td>', 'Nice pastel tones. If you could just get rid of that mike!', '2007-02-19 12:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381421, 470833, 24454, '<td valign="top">That is nice street photography.  The total oblivion to a photographer being around is priceless.   The unusual character adds the photojournalistic element to it too.   Not that that hair do is unusual, mind you. .but  :)</td>', 'That is nice street photography.  The total oblivion to a photographer being around is priceless.   The unusual character adds the photojournalistic element to it too.   Not that that hair do is unusual, mind you. .but  :)', '2007-02-19 12:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381423, 471496, 56502, '<td valign="top">I would like it better without the black bars.</td>', 'I would like it better without the black bars.', '2007-02-19 12:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381425, 471378, 64446, '<td valign="top">There is a lot going on in this image and it is just too distracting for me.</td>', 'There is a lot going on in this image and it is just too distracting for me.', '2007-02-19 12:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381427, 471134, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is what I picture street photography to look like,  I think I might have tried to crop out the dominating foreground bush, but I really love it anyway.  This is my favorite one so far.</td>', 'This is what I picture street photography to look like,  I think I might have tried to crop out the dominating foreground bush, but I really love it anyway.  This is my favorite one so far.', '2007-02-19 12:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381434, 471028, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is great.  The guy walking away makes this more dramatic in my opinion.  I love the old old architecture around him, and the pigeons also add the perfect "street photography" touch.  This is my new favorite one so far :)</td>', 'This is great.  The guy walking away makes this more dramatic in my opinion.  I love the old old architecture around him, and the pigeons also add the perfect "street photography" touch.  This is my new favorite one so far :)', '2007-02-19 12:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381438, 470943, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh this is awesome!   Street Photography at its best!  What a beautiful capture!  This one has got to be one of the top picks!</td>', 'Oh this is awesome!   Street Photography at its best!  What a beautiful capture!  This one has got to be one of the top picks!', '2007-02-19 12:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381441, 470700, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is great!  This is "my" kind of street photography.  I love the composition of him being "right there" in the foreground while still showing his urban surroundings.  One of my most favorites so far.</td>', 'This is great!  This is "my" kind of street photography.  I love the composition of him being "right there" in the foreground while still showing his urban surroundings.  One of my most favorites so far.', '2007-02-19 12:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381448, 470405, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the expression of the guy on the right!! If I could change anything, I''d like to include his feet, as he''s in the forefront.</td>', 'I love the expression of the guy on the right!! If I could change anything, I''d like to include his feet, as he''s in the forefront.', '2007-02-19 12:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381450, 470940, 15711, '<td valign="top">What makes this work is the out of focus street and pedestrian walking behind.  Wonderful portrait!</td>', 'What makes this work is the out of focus street and pedestrian walking behind.  Wonderful portrait!', '2007-02-19 12:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381451, 470497, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the opposition of the older woman with the cane and the carefree smiling girls.  Love the sense of meovement. Good contrast.</td>', 'I love the opposition of the older woman with the cane and the carefree smiling girls.  Love the sense of meovement. Good contrast.', '2007-02-19 12:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381454, 471439, 15711, '<td valign="top">The composition is perfect with the boy walking toward the other two as a "balance."  I like the frame as well.</td>', 'The composition is perfect with the boy walking toward the other two as a "balance."  I like the frame as well.', '2007-02-19 12:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381455, 470352, 49109, '<td valign="top">good capture, but could be much sharper. fram doesn''t add</td>', 'good capture, but could be much sharper. fram doesn''t add', '2007-02-19 12:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381457, 470843, 15711, '<td valign="top">Perfect example of street photography. There is the subtle interplay of the two unrelated characters, the street, and the overall tone.  I like it.</td>', 'Perfect example of street photography. There is the subtle interplay of the two unrelated characters, the street, and the overall tone.  I like it.', '2007-02-19 12:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381459, 471066, 49109, '<td valign="top">excellent! 10. fav.</td>', 'excellent! 10. fav.', '2007-02-19 12:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381462, 468361, 49109, '<td valign="top">crop is too tight at bottom IMO. otherwise well done, nice tones and POV</td>', 'crop is too tight at bottom IMO. otherwise well done, nice tones and POV', '2007-02-19 12:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381463, 470489, 71914, '<td valign="top">Would''ve been better in black and white.  Title is not so great.</td>', 'Would''ve been better in black and white.  Title is not so great.', '2007-02-19 12:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
