(3381723, 470312, 47470, '<td valign="top">If you are putting everything in black and white except for one thing, it might work a bit better if the color were more vibrant.  It does succeed in making the ship more noticeable though.</td>', 'If you are putting everything in black and white except for one thing, it might work a bit better if the color were more vibrant.  It does succeed in making the ship more noticeable though.', '2007-02-19 13:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
