(3381800, 471015, 29748, '<td valign="top">great idea, but focus is too soft.</td>', 'great idea, but focus is too soft.', '2007-02-19 14:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381801, 470538, 27605, '<td valign="top">Well what I love about your photo, I *really* love, and that is the title and it''s inspiration (the graffiti).  It fits the couple so well, their loosly held hands are the icing on the cake.  As for the exposure itself, it looks like it was taken right around noon, and I think that made for a difficult exposure.  I''m not crazy about the washed-out sky &amp; etc.  I also think I would like this better if cropped so that more of the right side of the photo was left out.  Moving the window around on my monitor, it seems that this emphasizes the graffiti to greater advantage.  6</td>', 'Well what I love about your photo, I *really* love, and that is the title and it''s inspiration (the graffiti).  It fits the couple so well, their loosly held hands are the icing on the cake.  As for the exposure itself, it looks like it was taken right around noon, and I think that made for a difficult exposure.  I''m not crazy about the washed-out sky & etc.  I also think I would like this better if cropped so that more of the right side of the photo was left out.  Moving the window around on my monitor, it seems that this emphasizes the graffiti to greater advantage.  6', '2007-02-19 14:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381803, 471363, 29748, '<td valign="top">cool</td>', 'cool', '2007-02-19 14:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381804, 469962, 29748, '<td valign="top">different</td>', 'different', '2007-02-19 14:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381807, 471493, 29748, '<td valign="top">great timing</td>', 'great timing', '2007-02-19 14:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381808, 470779, 47470, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color.</td>', 'Beautiful color.', '2007-02-19 14:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381809, 470940, 27605, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp, and well exposed and processed.  Still it seems to have a bit of a portrait feel IMO.  I also find the sign in the top left corner to be a little distracting.</td>', 'Nice and sharp, and well exposed and processed.  Still it seems to have a bit of a portrait feel IMO.  I also find the sign in the top left corner to be a little distracting.', '2007-02-19 14:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381811, 471111, 27605, '<td valign="top">You took a potential liablity (the vertical pole that divides the frame) and made it work for you, at least that''s the way I see it.  Interesting shot.</td>', 'You took a potential liablity (the vertical pole that divides the frame) and made it work for you, at least that''s the way I see it.  Interesting shot.', '2007-02-19 14:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381813, 471275, 56502, '<td valign="top">Fitting caption!</td>', 'Fitting caption!', '2007-02-19 14:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381814, 470625, 47470, '<td valign="top">There are a bunch of pictures in this competition that are titled "Lost, but this is the only one that caught my eye.  Wonderful tonality, framing, and subject.  A very nice capture of a moment.</td>', 'There are a bunch of pictures in this competition that are titled "Lost, but this is the only one that caught my eye.  Wonderful tonality, framing, and subject.  A very nice capture of a moment.', '2007-02-19 14:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381820, 471447, 47470, '<td valign="top">Bellissimo.  Dov''e''?</td>', 'Bellissimo.  Dov''e''?', '2007-02-19 14:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381821, 467724, 27605, '<td valign="top">He does seem sort of lost, doesn''t he?  At first glance this seems a boring composition to me, but that look on his face does give it more.  Seems to have a bit of a blue cast, too.</td>', 'He does seem sort of lost, doesn''t he?  At first glance this seems a boring composition to me, but that look on his face does give it more.  Seems to have a bit of a blue cast, too.', '2007-02-19 14:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381825, 467728, 27605, '<td valign="top">The selective desat adds interest in this photo.</td>', 'The selective desat adds interest in this photo.', '2007-02-19 14:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381835, 471328, 27605, '<td valign="top">My take is that this photo suffers from the subject being a little too small and turned away from the camera.  Nice job on the exposure and b/w conversion, however, it has great tonal range.</td>', 'My take is that this photo suffers from the subject being a little too small and turned away from the camera.  Nice job on the exposure and b/w conversion, however, it has great tonal range.', '2007-02-19 14:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381840, 468872, 27605, '<td valign="top">Well I think this is an -interesting- shot, but it seems to lean toward portraiture. The exposure is good, and the focus also.  Seems a bit small, too.</td>', 'Well I think this is an -interesting- shot, but it seems to lean toward portraiture. The exposure is good, and the focus also.  Seems a bit small, too.', '2007-02-19 14:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381846, 470843, 29748, '<td valign="top">wow, great capture</td>', 'wow, great capture', '2007-02-19 14:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381847, 471385, 27605, '<td valign="top">This places highly on the cuteness scale!  The b/w processing seems a bit washed out to me however.</td>', 'This places highly on the cuteness scale!  The b/w processing seems a bit washed out to me however.', '2007-02-19 14:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381857, 470265, 47470, '<td valign="top">All of the hand clutter the frame a bit too much.  As for keeping only some color, I think keeping only the color of the smoke would have worked best (assuming that the cigarette stands out more with only one hand).  The color in the smoke is very pretty.</td>', 'All of the hand clutter the frame a bit too much.  As for keeping only some color, I think keeping only the color of the smoke would have worked best (assuming that the cigarette stands out more with only one hand).  The color in the smoke is very pretty.', '2007-02-19 14:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381862, 467690, 27605, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp shot, and good post processing.  I like the context you''ve provided in this shot; the scale of the subject to his surroundings does give the sense of ''being there''.  On the critical side, there is a voyueristic feeling, too.  Although I feel the photo draws ME in, I don''t get the feeling that you the photographer were involved in the time &amp; place that I think a good street photo should provide.  (Hope that isn''t too confusing, but feel free to PM if it is).  6</td>', 'Nice crisp shot, and good post processing.  I like the context you''ve provided in this shot; the scale of the subject to his surroundings does give the sense of ''being there''.  On the critical side, there is a voyueristic feeling, too.  Although I feel the photo draws ME in, I don''t get the feeling that you the photographer were involved in the time & place that I think a good street photo should provide.  (Hope that isn''t too confusing, but feel free to PM if it is).  6', '2007-02-19 14:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3381864, 471364, 27605, '<td valign="top">Interesting <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-02-26 09:30:53.</i></td>', 'Interesting ', '2007-02-19 14:35:21.000000', '2007-02-26 09:30:53.000000', 1),
