(3381893, 470842, 47721, '<td valign="top">I dont know if I''m seeing right but it looks to me that there is a funny cut around the top left subject (looks like a black back pack) ... everything around is blur but the very sharp cut line...  other than that, I wonder how you got the light  only on the main subject (the lady with the phone)... JMHO</td>', 'I dont know if I''m seeing right but it looks to me that there is a funny cut around the top left subject (looks like a black back pack) ... everything around is blur but the very sharp cut line...  other than that, I wonder how you got the light  only on the main subject (the lady with the phone)... JMHO', '2007-02-19 14:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
