(3381952, 470722, 30861, '<td valign="top">The famous V-J Day image was shot in Times Square by Alfred Eisenstaedt, not Cartier-Bresson: <br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//homepage.mac.com/sbooneaz/iblog/C1416780514/E20050814230342/Media/Vj_day_kiss.jpg'', strrpos(''//homepage.mac.com/sbooneaz/iblog/C1416780514/E20050814230342/Media/Vj_day_kiss.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//homepage.mac.com/sbooneaz/iblog/C1416780514/E20050814230342/Media/Vj_day_kiss.jpg"/> <br/> <br/>Not that it matters to the quality of the image, mind you, just a footnote for ya :-)</td>', 'The famous V-J Day image was shot in Times Square by Alfred Eisenstaedt, not Cartier-Bresson:    Not that it matters to the quality of the image, mind you, just a footnote for ya :-)', '2007-02-19 15:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
