(3382930, 471152, 45475, '<td valign="top">My favourite for the challenge. Wonderfully muted colour. Great that you isolate the main subjects with a subtle blur. Nothing is overdone, and the PoV is level with the action. Nice work.</td>', 'My favourite for the challenge. Wonderfully muted colour. Great that you isolate the main subjects with a subtle blur. Nothing is overdone, and the PoV is level with the action. Nice work.', '2007-02-19 20:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
