(3382936, 471403, 45475, '<td valign="top">Fantastic perspective. Has a bit of a drunken lean to it, but a truly impressive b&amp;w nonetheless.</td>', 'Fantastic perspective. Has a bit of a drunken lean to it, but a truly impressive b&w nonetheless.', '2007-02-19 20:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
