(3383039, 471259, 40718, '<td valign="top">One would immediately ask why the tree in the middle of the composition?  Since Henri''s dead, I guess we''ll never know.  I did give it a 7 before I realized what I was looking at. ;)</td>', 'One would immediately ask why the tree in the middle of the composition?  Since Henri''s dead, I guess we''ll never know.  I did give it a 7 before I realized what I was looking at. ;)', '2007-02-19 20:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
