(3383111, 468490, 65107, '<td valign="top">interesting repitition of pattern focuses on the lone man but just as detail is lost in the shadows the photo doesn''t tell if the man is lonely or just alone.</td>', 'interesting repitition of pattern focuses on the lone man but just as detail is lost in the shadows the photo doesn''t tell if the man is lonely or just alone.', '2007-02-19 20:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3383114, 471510, 35804, '<td valign="top">So intriguing how the figures on the left seem to be "emerging" from the deep abyss of a shadow...and how great is the pampered little dog in a stroller. Beautiful stark light and shadow play. The punches of red scattered throughout really make the image, I like this a lot.</td>', 'So intriguing how the figures on the left seem to be "emerging" from the deep abyss of a shadow...and how great is the pampered little dog in a stroller. Beautiful stark light and shadow play. The punches of red scattered throughout really make the image, I like this a lot.', '2007-02-19 20:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3383115, 471151, 62187, '<td valign="top">Well...I like it...I''m going to venture a guess and take it that this gentleman is ''homeless''. I deal with the ''domicile challenged'' people on an almost daily basis - this guy looks like quite a character. I''m wondering? did you get him to pose for the shot or was it spur-of-the-moment? If posed - the Taco Bell cup (imho) would have been best out of the shot. If not posed - then, I guess a tighter crop might (?) have been better - but probably not. I think you''ve probably edited it the best possible. Great job!</td>', 'Well...I like it...I''m going to venture a guess and take it that this gentleman is ''homeless''. I deal with the ''domicile challenged'' people on an almost daily basis - this guy looks like quite a character. I''m wondering? did you get him to pose for the shot or was it spur-of-the-moment? If posed - the Taco Bell cup (imho) would have been best out of the shot. If not posed - then, I guess a tighter crop might (?) have been better - but probably not. I think you''ve probably edited it the best possible. Great job!', '2007-02-19 20:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3383118, 468289, 70514, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why, but I find it interesting that there are shoes for sale behind her, and she has to wear the special velcro shoes.  Don''t know if this was intended...but it adds interest, for me, at least.</td>', 'I don''t know why, but I find it interesting that there are shoes for sale behind her, and she has to wear the special velcro shoes.  Don''t know if this was intended...but it adds interest, for me, at least.', '2007-02-19 20:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3383119, 471074, 74059, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I really want to hear what they''re whispering about.</td>', 'Nice.  I really want to hear what they''re whispering about.', '2007-02-19 20:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3383120, 470751, 31829, '<td valign="top">Photomatix gone bad.</td>', 'Photomatix gone bad.', '2007-02-19 20:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
