(3383376, 471380, 36006, '<td valign="top">HI LUX huh.<br/> <br/>I am not convinced that this is a street photograph. Even if the street was in Beirut, or Bahgdad, or even near a junk yard.<br/> <br/>All I know is that this is an ovbiously unused green truck surrounded by broken rock.<br/> <br/>Comp needs help, color interesting, great texture, light is ok to being just flat, no eye movement, whites need help, blacks too deep, over all I hope you can do much better.<br/> <br/>Keep going, try again.</td>', 'HI LUX huh. I am not convinced that this is a street photograph. Even if the street was in Beirut, or Bahgdad, or even near a junk yard. All I know is that this is an ovbiously unused green truck surrounded by broken rock. Comp needs help, color interesting, great texture, light is ok to being just flat, no eye movement, whites need help, blacks too deep, over all I hope you can do much better. Keep going, try again.', '2007-02-19 22:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
