(3383455, 470967, 25095, '<td valign="top">just what I was hoping for in a street photo challenge...I wonder what monster cable has done...well other than being outrageouly over priced.  I wonder if he as a monster cable plugged into his guitar lol.<br/> <br/>I like that you are able to distinguish a subject but also tell a story, had you zoomed in too tight (like a few have done) you would have lost all the valuable information thats there.  You left plenty of room for the subject and the views eyes to wonder yet still get pulled back to the main area.  I also like that you didn''t just stand way back and shoot the whole event.  Well done.</td>', 'just what I was hoping for in a street photo challenge...I wonder what monster cable has done...well other than being outrageouly over priced.  I wonder if he as a monster cable plugged into his guitar lol. I like that you are able to distinguish a subject but also tell a story, had you zoomed in too tight (like a few have done) you would have lost all the valuable information thats there.  You left plenty of room for the subject and the views eyes to wonder yet still get pulled back to the main area.  I also like that you didn''t just stand way back and shoot the whole event.  Well done.', '2007-02-19 22:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
