(3383516, 471498, 25095, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of my valet parking days, we word the exact same colors and would huddle around on cold days looking like a gang or something.  We used to joke about being high  priced car thiefs cause we''d all fly out of the van and jump into already running cars (expensive things too) and take off to the parking lot, I''m sure we got more than one crazy look.<br/> <br/>I like the colors here, very nice image that keeps your eye on the subject but also lets you look around without getting lost.</td>', 'This reminds me of my valet parking days, we word the exact same colors and would huddle around on cold days looking like a gang or something.  We used to joke about being high  priced car thiefs cause we''d all fly out of the van and jump into already running cars (expensive things too) and take off to the parking lot, I''m sure we got more than one crazy look. I like the colors here, very nice image that keeps your eye on the subject but also lets you look around without getting lost.', '2007-02-19 23:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
