(3383730, 471160, 45475, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture. The men don''t seem to be relating with one another, yet, they appear comfortable in company. Makes one wonder. Are they family? Two brothers out for a stroll in the sunshine with their father perhaps? Friends enjoying a brief moment of reminiscence? Just marvellous. Elegantly converted to b&amp;w too.</td>', 'Wonderful capture. The men don''t seem to be relating with one another, yet, they appear comfortable in company. Makes one wonder. Are they family? Two brothers out for a stroll in the sunshine with their father perhaps? Friends enjoying a brief moment of reminiscence? Just marvellous. Elegantly converted to b&w too.', '2007-02-20 00:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3383736, 470841, 45475, '<td valign="top">A great find! One of the more unusual captures in this challenge. Well spotted :)</td>', 'A great find! One of the more unusual captures in this challenge. Well spotted :)', '2007-02-20 00:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
