(3383745, 471158, 45475, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. I can''t find the right words to adequately express how much I adore this image. Yes, the backlight is overblown. Yes, there''s a big smudge of movement blur in the foreground. But you know what? Those are exactly the elements here that absolutely make it for me.</td>', 'Gorgeous. I can''t find the right words to adequately express how much I adore this image. Yes, the backlight is overblown. Yes, there''s a big smudge of movement blur in the foreground. But you know what? Those are exactly the elements here that absolutely make it for me.', '2007-02-20 00:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3383748, 470717, 53094, '<td valign="top">This is my personal favorite in this challenge.</td>', 'This is my personal favorite in this challenge.', '2007-02-20 00:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
