(3383752, 471151, 47316, '<td valign="top">Wow this shot really stands out. The editing is great. Great subject as well. <br/>Not sure I really like the angle of this though and I think I''d  prefer to see the cars cropped out.</td>', 'Wow this shot really stands out. The editing is great. Great subject as well. Not sure I really like the angle of this though and I think I''d  prefer to see the cars cropped out.', '2007-02-20 00:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3383759, 471259, 811, '<td valign="top">hmmmmm</td>', 'hmmmmm', '2007-02-20 00:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3383801, 470429, 71583, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is amazing. I really like the moment you captured. The composition draws your eye immediately to the woman in the middle; and then the little girl on the left is priceless. My only criticism would be that its a tad dark, but thats not a big deal. Great job!</td>', 'Wow, this is amazing. I really like the moment you captured. The composition draws your eye immediately to the woman in the middle; and then the little girl on the left is priceless. My only criticism would be that its a tad dark, but thats not a big deal. Great job!', '2007-02-20 01:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3383802, 471007, 71583, '<td valign="top">Wow, great work. I love the line of white squares on the right side of the picture. The symmetrical chairs are also a nice touch. If it were a little brighter it''d be really striking, maybe bring out the people in the cafe a little more. and really make the chairs stand out.<br/>But wonderful capture!</td>', 'Wow, great work. I love the line of white squares on the right side of the picture. The symmetrical chairs are also a nice touch. If it were a little brighter it''d be really striking, maybe bring out the people in the cafe a little more. and really make the chairs stand out.But wonderful capture!', '2007-02-20 01:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3383803, 467632, 71583, '<td valign="top">Wow. Amazing midtones and contrast and moment. just wow.</td>', 'Wow. Amazing midtones and contrast and moment. just wow.', '2007-02-20 01:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3383804, 470676, 71583, '<td valign="top">How adorable! The depth of field is perfect, as are the colors and contrast. Wonderful work.</td>', 'How adorable! The depth of field is perfect, as are the colors and contrast. Wonderful work.', '2007-02-20 01:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3383807, 471204, 71583, '<td valign="top">Wow. this is great. I love the expression you caught and the mood of the day is really captured in the lighting and colors. Wonderful.</td>', 'Wow. this is great. I love the expression you caught and the mood of the day is really captured in the lighting and colors. Wonderful.', '2007-02-20 01:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3383810, 469415, 71583, '<td valign="top">Wonderful perspective lines, it really makes for wonderful compositions (especially the trail behind her). My only complaint that as a b&amp;w it might be a little brighter, but its still great!</td>', 'Wonderful perspective lines, it really makes for wonderful compositions (especially the trail behind her). My only complaint that as a b&w it might be a little brighter, but its still great!', '2007-02-20 01:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3383812, 471277, 71583, '<td valign="top">Wow. I really like this. Amazing moment, amazing composition - its just pulls you in. :).</td>', 'Wow. I really like this. Amazing moment, amazing composition - its just pulls you in. :).', '2007-02-20 01:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3383815, 470923, 71583, '<td valign="top">Aw, how adorable. Great moment to capture on the street. The composition to the right really gives you a sense of where they are. Nice work.</td>', 'Aw, how adorable. Great moment to capture on the street. The composition to the right really gives you a sense of where they are. Nice work.', '2007-02-20 01:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3383817, 471062, 71583, '<td valign="top">Wow. his position really seems to capture the mood of the whole picture. I love all of the street signs. My only complaint is the door and sidewalk are bleached out, but besides that the composition is amazing. Keep it up :).</td>', 'Wow. his position really seems to capture the mood of the whole picture. I love all of the street signs. My only complaint is the door and sidewalk are bleached out, but besides that the composition is amazing. Keep it up :).', '2007-02-20 01:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3383820, 471426, 71583, '<td valign="top">The colors capture the mood of this photograph - I really like the desaturation. The depth of field is delightful, if only he were a little more in focus. <br/>I love his ears.</td>', 'The colors capture the mood of this photograph - I really like the desaturation. The depth of field is delightful, if only he were a little more in focus. I love his ears.', '2007-02-20 01:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
