(3383920, 471439, 65886, '<td valign="top">very good shot, very clever and touching.</td>', 'very good shot, very clever and touching.', '2007-02-20 03:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3383921, 471496, 65886, '<td valign="top">excellent composition and dof!</td>', 'excellent composition and dof!', '2007-02-20 03:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3383953, 471237, 45631, '<td valign="top">I dont have much knowledge on street photography but my thoughts on you shot are as follows:  I like this shot as it''s not just a shot of a destitute man.  Having the people give money (I think) to him shows that society still cares and I love the dog in the pcit as well. This is a lovely shot. 10</td>', 'I dont have much knowledge on street photography but my thoughts on you shot are as follows:  I like this shot as it''s not just a shot of a destitute man.  Having the people give money (I think) to him shows that society still cares and I love the dog in the pcit as well. This is a lovely shot. 10', '2007-02-20 03:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3383969, 470842, 45631, '<td valign="top">I dont have much knowledge on street photography but my thoughts on you shot are as follows:  I like this shot as it shows how absorbed we get in our own affairs even when in pbulic.  I love the expression on her face (wonder what she is talking about?).  10</td>', 'I dont have much knowledge on street photography but my thoughts on you shot are as follows:  I like this shot as it shows how absorbed we get in our own affairs even when in pbulic.  I love the expression on her face (wonder what she is talking about?).  10', '2007-02-20 03:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3383971, 470943, 45631, '<td valign="top">I dont have much knowledge on street photography but my thoughts on you shot are as follows:  This is a brilliant shot.  Love the background of this picture that tones in so well with three mates.  Great shot.  10</td>', 'I dont have much knowledge on street photography but my thoughts on you shot are as follows:  This is a brilliant shot.  Love the background of this picture that tones in so well with three mates.  Great shot.  10', '2007-02-20 03:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3383976, 471385, 45631, '<td valign="top">I dont have much knowledge on street photography but my thoughts on you shot are as follows:  This shot is great.  Love the reflection in th ewindow and the look of interest on his fact as well as the pointing finger.  Must remind us all of when we were a kid and saw something we liked in a shop window.  10</td>', 'I dont have much knowledge on street photography but my thoughts on you shot are as follows:  This shot is great.  Love the reflection in th ewindow and the look of interest on his fact as well as the pointing finger.  Must remind us all of when we were a kid and saw something we liked in a shop window.  10', '2007-02-20 03:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3383987, 471465, 45631, '<td valign="top">I dont have much knowledge on street photography but my thoughts on you shot are as follows:  This is a very different photo as it shows the hustle and bustle of a faces crowd - something about it attracts me to look at it.  10</td>', 'I dont have much knowledge on street photography but my thoughts on you shot are as follows:  This is a very different photo as it shows the hustle and bustle of a faces crowd - something about it attracts me to look at it.  10', '2007-02-20 03:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3383998, 471103, 45631, '<td valign="top">I dont have much knowledge on street photography but my thoughts on you shot are as follows:  I like this capture.  Pity she saw you and looked at the camera.  I would have preferred her not to be looking but what can you do when she has already spotted you?  I also like the reflections from the street also being in the window.  Nice Shot. 10</td>', 'I dont have much knowledge on street photography but my thoughts on you shot are as follows:  I like this capture.  Pity she saw you and looked at the camera.  I would have preferred her not to be looking but what can you do when she has already spotted you?  I also like the reflections from the street also being in the window.  Nice Shot. 10', '2007-02-20 03:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384012, 471066, 45631, '<td valign="top">I dont have much knowledge on street photography but my thoughts on you shot are as follows:  This is a great shot.  I find it hard to believe this is from one capture - is this a poster of some kind behind the lady?  10</td>', 'I dont have much knowledge on street photography but my thoughts on you shot are as follows:  This is a great shot.  I find it hard to believe this is from one capture - is this a poster of some kind behind the lady?  10', '2007-02-20 03:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384015, 471435, 45631, '<td valign="top">I dont have much knowledge on street photography but my thoughts on you shot are as follows:  I love this shot.  Just a normal family outing.  Catching a bite to eat.  Love it.  10</td>', 'I dont have much knowledge on street photography but my thoughts on you shot are as follows:  I love this shot.  Just a normal family outing.  Catching a bite to eat.  Love it.  10', '2007-02-20 03:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
