(3384022, 468577, 65886, '<td valign="top">:) ...and when the night comes the bats come to the place and exchange their hostages. and then they go to a local pub, take off their masks, hugs their hostages and celebrate another successful Let''s Play Batman day. and no one of them knows about the ... - and we will never know either</td>', ':) ...and when the night comes the bats come to the place and exchange their hostages. and then they go to a local pub, take off their masks, hugs their hostages and celebrate another successful Let''s Play Batman day. and no one of them knows about the ... - and we will never know either', '2007-02-20 03:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384023, 471350, 45631, '<td valign="top">I dont have much knowledge on street photography but my thoughts on you shot are as follows:  This is brilliant.  Very different from the other shots but I really love it.  Look at that little dog making sure they are ok as well.  Excellent.  10 from me.</td>', 'I dont have much knowledge on street photography but my thoughts on you shot are as follows:  This is brilliant.  Very different from the other shots but I really love it.  Look at that little dog making sure they are ok as well.  Excellent.  10 from me.', '2007-02-20 03:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
