(3384148, 469370, 57378, '<td valign="top">Love the idea - Just think the composition needs a bit of work - The woman is too centered and the lack of her foot is a little distracting. This I think could have worked really well if a person was in the area of the doorway walking with a bit more movement. Maybe a tighter crop off the top would also keep us focused on the subject matter - Great idea though.</td>', 'Love the idea - Just think the composition needs a bit of work - The woman is too centered and the lack of her foot is a little distracting. This I think could have worked really well if a person was in the area of the doorway walking with a bit more movement. Maybe a tighter crop off the top would also keep us focused on the subject matter - Great idea though.', '2007-02-20 04:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384149, 471439, 45631, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  Love the way the children are all in focus but the crowd is not.  10</td>', 'Great capture.  Love the way the children are all in focus but the crowd is not.  10', '2007-02-20 04:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
