(3384378, 471510, 27605, '<td valign="top">I like all that is going on in this photo:  the person in the red jacket entering the green door seems key to the title.  ...and the dog in the stroller?!  The old gent on the left appears to be defying gravity!  On the negative side, the distortion of the building (it seems to be leaning backwards) and the extreme dark v. light contrast detract from the photo IMO.  7</td>', 'I like all that is going on in this photo:  the person in the red jacket entering the green door seems key to the title.  ...and the dog in the stroller?!  The old gent on the left appears to be defying gravity!  On the negative side, the distortion of the building (it seems to be leaning backwards) and the extreme dark v. light contrast detract from the photo IMO.  7', '2007-02-20 07:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
