(3384550, 470594, 66597, '<td valign="top">Great optical illusion here!</td>', 'Great optical illusion here!', '2007-02-20 09:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384561, 470497, 66597, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between the three young girls and the older woman. I''m not fond of the title, though - it makes something poignant seem too obvious. In other words, I think this photo is strong enough to stand on its own without a title instructing the viewer what to see. Great capture.</td>', 'I like the contrast between the three young girls and the older woman. I''m not fond of the title, though - it makes something poignant seem too obvious. In other words, I think this photo is strong enough to stand on its own without a title instructing the viewer what to see. Great capture.', '2007-02-20 09:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384564, 471523, 66597, '<td valign="top">I like the title you chose - it simply states a fact and lets the viewer make his own interpretation.</td>', 'I like the title you chose - it simply states a fact and lets the viewer make his own interpretation.', '2007-02-20 09:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384588, 471466, 66597, '<td valign="top">I really like the expression you captured here. So much happiness!</td>', 'I really like the expression you captured here. So much happiness!', '2007-02-20 09:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384598, 470834, 27605, '<td valign="top">A bit removed from the action to me.  Good technicals though.  5</td>', 'A bit removed from the action to me.  Good technicals though.  5', '2007-02-20 09:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384601, 471129, 27605, '<td valign="top">I don''t mind that the escalators are out of focus, but the foreground elements ditract IMO.  Still like it; 6.</td>', 'I don''t mind that the escalators are out of focus, but the foreground elements ditract IMO.  Still like it; 6.', '2007-02-20 09:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384615, 470943, 27605, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  You captured a candid moment that really communicates their friendship, it seems to me.  This gets an 8 from me!<br/> <br/>By way of discussion, though, I notice so many entries taken from this point of view.  How cool it would be if they were walking towards the camera and to see their faces.  This challenge has made me appreciate how difficult street photography really is.  FWIW.</td>', 'Very nice!  You captured a candid moment that really communicates their friendship, it seems to me.  This gets an 8 from me! By way of discussion, though, I notice so many entries taken from this point of view.  How cool it would be if they were walking towards the camera and to see their faces.  This challenge has made me appreciate how difficult street photography really is.  FWIW.', '2007-02-20 09:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384632, 471337, 3724, '<td valign="top">Enjoy this frontal pov.</td>', 'Enjoy this frontal pov.', '2007-02-20 09:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384641, 470609, 6888, '<td valign="top">a little blurry</td>', 'a little blurry', '2007-02-20 09:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384642, 471106, 6888, '<td valign="top">blown out sky, but nice photojournalistic shot</td>', 'blown out sky, but nice photojournalistic shot', '2007-02-20 09:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384643, 470963, 34763, '<td valign="top">Excellent, I could see this as a movie trailer ad.</td>', 'Excellent, I could see this as a movie trailer ad.', '2007-02-20 09:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384645, 471467, 6888, '<td valign="top">interesting perspective...well done</td>', 'interesting perspective...well done', '2007-02-20 09:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384650, 468711, 6888, '<td valign="top">nice contrast of the men in suits ignoring the panhandler</td>', 'nice contrast of the men in suits ignoring the panhandler', '2007-02-20 09:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384653, 471447, 6888, '<td valign="top">very nice, maybe consider cropping out the sky completely</td>', 'very nice, maybe consider cropping out the sky completely', '2007-02-20 09:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384654, 470617, 34763, '<td valign="top">Been there ... done that, well done</td>', 'Been there ... done that, well done', '2007-02-20 09:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384655, 471497, 6888, '<td valign="top">nice composition, nice dof</td>', 'nice composition, nice dof', '2007-02-20 09:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384656, 470254, 6888, '<td valign="top">nice photojournalistic feel to this shot</td>', 'nice photojournalistic feel to this shot', '2007-02-20 09:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384658, 471381, 6888, '<td valign="top">nice portrait but feels too posed</td>', 'nice portrait but feels too posed', '2007-02-20 09:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384659, 469207, 6888, '<td valign="top">very nice, what a great background</td>', 'very nice, what a great background', '2007-02-20 09:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384662, 470584, 34763, '<td valign="top">He''s really dressed up, even gloss on his shoes. Well done getting him and the pigeons all looking the same direction. Perfect.</td>', 'He''s really dressed up, even gloss on his shoes. Well done getting him and the pigeons all looking the same direction. Perfect.', '2007-02-20 09:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384663, 470176, 6888, '<td valign="top">nice shot, shadows and light work well</td>', 'nice shot, shadows and light work well', '2007-02-20 09:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384665, 471454, 22748, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting in this image and the was that the faces of the two men stand out because of the way they are lit. Great image, except perhaps that the man closest to the camera feels just slightly camera-shake-blurred (the rest of the image is far enough out of focus due to DOF that you can''t see any blur).</td>', 'I really like the lighting in this image and the was that the faces of the two men stand out because of the way they are lit. Great image, except perhaps that the man closest to the camera feels just slightly camera-shake-blurred (the rest of the image is far enough out of focus due to DOF that you can''t see any blur).', '2007-02-20 09:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384666, 471260, 6888, '<td valign="top">very nice candid shot</td>', 'very nice candid shot', '2007-02-20 09:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384668, 470869, 34763, '<td valign="top">very well done</td>', 'very well done', '2007-02-20 09:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384669, 471449, 6888, '<td valign="top">the package on the porch kind of draws me away from the dorr but overall a nice shot</td>', 'the package on the porch kind of draws me away from the dorr but overall a nice shot', '2007-02-20 09:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384672, 470533, 6888, '<td valign="top">could maybe have worked better cropping mom out completely</td>', 'could maybe have worked better cropping mom out completely', '2007-02-20 09:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384676, 471454, 58728, '<td valign="top">I love the dof in this shot.  Awesome.</td>', 'I love the dof in this shot.  Awesome.', '2007-02-20 09:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384678, 470916, 3724, '<td valign="top">perfect x composition</td>', 'perfect x composition', '2007-02-20 09:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384680, 468197, 58728, '<td valign="top">The colors are awesome. I love the girl...she looks like she''s hurrying to get where she needs to go.  Great comp.</td>', 'The colors are awesome. I love the girl...she looks like she''s hurrying to get where she needs to go.  Great comp.', '2007-02-20 09:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384681, 471337, 58728, '<td valign="top">I love the perspective.  And the movement is great.</td>', 'I love the perspective.  And the movement is great.', '2007-02-20 09:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384683, 470317, 58728, '<td valign="top">One of my faves of the challenge.  The movement is awesome!!!  I love that the hands and face are the only things in focus.  B&amp;W works really well. LOVE IT! 10.</td>', 'One of my faves of the challenge.  The movement is awesome!!!  I love that the hands and face are the only things in focus.  B&W works really well. LOVE IT! 10.', '2007-02-20 09:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384685, 470625, 58728, '<td valign="top">Awww...such an emotional shot.  I want to help the poor little guy find his mommy.  This is beautifully done.  10.</td>', 'Awww...such an emotional shot.  I want to help the poor little guy find his mommy.  This is beautifully done.  10.', '2007-02-20 09:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384687, 470830, 58728, '<td valign="top">Love it.  I don''t even know what specifically i truly love...it''s the whole picture.  It speaks to me.  You know when you end up loving a photo but can''t pinpoint the reason?  The entire scene is just fantastic.  10.</td>', 'Love it.  I don''t even know what specifically i truly love...it''s the whole picture.  It speaks to me.  You know when you end up loving a photo but can''t pinpoint the reason?  The entire scene is just fantastic.  10.', '2007-02-20 09:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384688, 471066, 58728, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  I love the lighting, and the composition.</td>', 'Excellent.  I love the lighting, and the composition.', '2007-02-20 09:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384694, 470979, 58728, '<td valign="top">Great title for a fantastic picture.  I love the slight sepia tone, the composition is excellent....  Everything about this shot works.  10.</td>', 'Great title for a fantastic picture.  I love the slight sepia tone, the composition is excellent....  Everything about this shot works.  10.', '2007-02-20 09:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384698, 469369, 58728, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot.  The dof works so well..having the girl out of focus.  It looks rainy and dreary...which works with her walking away from the scene.  10.  LOVE IT.</td>', 'Excellent shot.  The dof works so well..having the girl out of focus.  It looks rainy and dreary...which works with her walking away from the scene.  10.  LOVE IT.', '2007-02-20 09:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384700, 471152, 58728, '<td valign="top">This has a dreamlike quality to it. It''s very cute...a great capture.  10.</td>', 'This has a dreamlike quality to it. It''s very cute...a great capture.  10.', '2007-02-20 09:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384701, 471403, 58728, '<td valign="top">Very moving.</td>', 'Very moving.', '2007-02-20 09:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384746, 470527, 67671, '<td valign="top">Looks over sharpened, otherwise a good shot.</td>', 'Looks over sharpened, otherwise a good shot.', '2007-02-20 10:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384753, 471129, 67671, '<td valign="top">I feel this would have been better if the escelator were sharp, rather than the chain.</td>', 'I feel this would have been better if the escelator were sharp, rather than the chain.', '2007-02-20 10:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384764, 470943, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great line and tone. Tells a story. 8</td>', 'Great line and tone. Tells a story. 8', '2007-02-20 10:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384765, 471426, 15711, '<td valign="top">Something about this I really like. The slight desat of the red tones works great. 7</td>', 'Something about this I really like. The slight desat of the red tones works great. 7', '2007-02-20 10:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384766, 471317, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice line and composition. The pop of color makes the thumbnail stand out.  Bikes are one of my fav. "props" in an image. 7</td>', 'Nice line and composition. The pop of color makes the thumbnail stand out.  Bikes are one of my fav. "props" in an image. 7', '2007-02-20 10:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384767, 471521, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the division of color with the guy in the middle pulling some with him. I also like that he''s running.</td>', 'I like the division of color with the guy in the middle pulling some with him. I also like that he''s running.', '2007-02-20 10:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384769, 469757, 67671, '<td valign="top">looks deserted, would have been better with some passers by in the shot.</td>', 'looks deserted, would have been better with some passers by in the shot.', '2007-02-20 10:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384771, 471052, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  The title is perfect. I love the movement of the people and the stationary sense of the parked car and buildings.  Nicely done.  The composition and contrast are spot on. Bumping up.</td>', 'Great idea.  The title is perfect. I love the movement of the people and the stationary sense of the parked car and buildings.  Nicely done.  The composition and contrast are spot on. Bumping up.', '2007-02-20 10:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384777, 471384, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the pop of the aqua light in the background.  Wonderful sense of movement.</td>', 'I like the pop of the aqua light in the background.  Wonderful sense of movement.', '2007-02-20 10:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384779, 471204, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like their serious yet pleasant expressions. I like the focus being sharp on the both of them.  Nice hats!!</td>', 'I like their serious yet pleasant expressions. I like the focus being sharp on the both of them.  Nice hats!!', '2007-02-20 10:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384783, 471337, 15711, '<td valign="top">Wonderful almost distorted sense of it. Love the movement. Makes me think of an older time with the sepia duotone.  GOOD stuff.</td>', 'Wonderful almost distorted sense of it. Love the movement. Makes me think of an older time with the sepia duotone.  GOOD stuff.', '2007-02-20 10:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384786, 470979, 41047, '<td valign="top">i like this, each character with his own story.. they indeed make an odd couple, well captured.</td>', 'i like this, each character with his own story.. they indeed make an odd couple, well captured.', '2007-02-20 10:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384788, 470963, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the high key approach with the pop of shadowy tones in the eyes.  Nice crop. I like the hint of grain as well.  Good composition!! 7</td>', 'I like the high key approach with the pop of shadowy tones in the eyes.  Nice crop. I like the hint of grain as well.  Good composition!! 7', '2007-02-20 10:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384793, 471152, 15711, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  The colors are great.  I think it would be great in BW as well - neutralizing all of the color and concentrating on tonal variation and texture of the scene. 7</td>', 'I really like this.  The colors are great.  I think it would be great in BW as well - neutralizing all of the color and concentrating on tonal variation and texture of the scene. 7', '2007-02-20 10:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384794, 471151, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great focus and tone. I like the tilt of the street in the background.</td>', 'Great focus and tone. I like the tilt of the street in the background.', '2007-02-20 10:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384796, 471509, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great line.  I like the high/low contrast. The movement of the man walking really makes the shot for me.</td>', 'Great line.  I like the high/low contrast. The movement of the man walking really makes the shot for me.', '2007-02-20 10:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384801, 470963, 326, '<td valign="top">A very nice portrait! Well done.</td>', 'A very nice portrait! Well done.', '2007-02-20 10:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384806, 471128, 326, '<td valign="top">Not sure what he is doing? But still a COOL picture!</td>', 'Not sure what he is doing? But still a COOL picture!', '2007-02-20 10:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384811, 471493, 326, '<td valign="top">OMG This is so funny! Love the handicap sticker...lol</td>', 'OMG This is so funny! Love the handicap sticker...lol', '2007-02-20 10:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384812, 471143, 326, '<td valign="top">EXCELLENT!! Looks vintage!</td>', 'EXCELLENT!! Looks vintage!', '2007-02-20 10:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384815, 471134, 326, '<td valign="top">NICE WORK!!!</td>', 'NICE WORK!!!', '2007-02-20 10:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384817, 470695, 326, '<td valign="top">Interesting... I like it!</td>', 'Interesting... I like it!', '2007-02-20 10:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384821, 470647, 326, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait works well in black &amp; white.</td>', 'Nice portrait works well in black & white.', '2007-02-20 10:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384824, 468577, 326, '<td valign="top">Now thats cool!!</td>', 'Now thats cool!!', '2007-02-20 10:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384831, 469974, 326, '<td valign="top">OK, This is so lovely!! Beautiful work!</td>', 'OK, This is so lovely!! Beautiful work!', '2007-02-20 10:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384838, 470966, 39664, '<td valign="top">Powerful!</td>', 'Powerful!', '2007-02-20 10:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384839, 470257, 326, '<td valign="top">Very nice! Nice sepia tone.</td>', 'Very nice! Nice sepia tone.', '2007-02-20 10:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384840, 470317, 326, '<td valign="top">Excellent work!</td>', 'Excellent work!', '2007-02-20 10:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384845, 469369, 326, '<td valign="top">AWESOME WORK!! Love this!</td>', 'AWESOME WORK!! Love this!', '2007-02-20 10:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384862, 471161, 39664, '<td valign="top">The use of B&amp;W makes this shot appear flat because your whites are too harsh (note the paper in his pocket....so bright my eyes keep being drawn to it.) and the sky has no depth to it at all, just a flat gray square dominating your upper left corner.  The heavy black framing binds it all in and I feel is too much border for this shot.</td>', 'The use of B&W makes this shot appear flat because your whites are too harsh (note the paper in his pocket....so bright my eyes keep being drawn to it.) and the sky has no depth to it at all, just a flat gray square dominating your upper left corner.  The heavy black framing binds it all in and I feel is too much border for this shot.', '2007-02-20 10:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384871, 471419, 39664, '<td valign="top">Oh, where are the PETA people with their spray paint???  :)  OH, there''s more than mink coat here!  There in lies the problem with this shot....too much to take in.  Very busy and the tree with the lights appears to be coming out of Ms Mink #1''s head.  It''s all about positioning.</td>', 'Oh, where are the PETA people with their spray paint???  :)  OH, there''s more than mink coat here!  There in lies the problem with this shot....too much to take in.  Very busy and the tree with the lights appears to be coming out of Ms Mink #1''s head.  It''s all about positioning.', '2007-02-20 10:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384887, 471294, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very interesting processing. <br/> <br/>Bumping this from a 6 to a 7. Something about it is just really cool.</td>', 'Very interesting processing.  Bumping this from a 6 to a 7. Something about it is just really cool.', '2007-02-20 11:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384895, 471066, 62812, '<td valign="top">excellent<br/>8</td>', 'excellent8', '2007-02-20 11:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384900, 471076, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and very nice processing.  I like the way the colors are feathered in.</td>', 'Nice shot and very nice processing.  I like the way the colors are feathered in.', '2007-02-20 11:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384905, 471419, 23484, '<td valign="top">I think this would be a nice shot but the focus just seems a little off.</td>', 'I think this would be a nice shot but the focus just seems a little off.', '2007-02-20 11:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384907, 470916, 62812, '<td valign="top">is that the south bank?<br/>I used to work in the festival hall above</td>', 'is that the south bank?I used to work in the festival hall above', '2007-02-20 11:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384923, 471510, 62812, '<td valign="top">The best so far!<br/>Really like this<br/>Gripping narrative.<br/>first class decisive street photograph with you the invisible witness<br/>9<br/>having seen the rest<br/>thi is the best<br/>10</td>', 'The best so far!Really like thisGripping narrative.first class decisive street photograph with you the invisible witness9having seen the restthi is the best10', '2007-02-20 11:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384926, 470979, 62812, '<td valign="top">LOVE this!<br/>Defines street photography in my eye with the photographer as the invisible witness and strong narrative.<br/>Well done<br/>gorgeous tonal values as well 9</td>', 'LOVE this!Defines street photography in my eye with the photographer as the invisible witness and strong narrative.Well donegorgeous tonal values as well 9', '2007-02-20 11:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384927, 469369, 62812, '<td valign="top">Great tonal range - perfect in black and white. <br/>Too many pictures here have just been converted to b/w regardless of they suitability in monochrome or not.<br/>gre8t!</td>', 'Great tonal range - perfect in black and white. Too many pictures here have just been converted to b/w regardless of they suitability in monochrome or not.gre8t!', '2007-02-20 11:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384928, 471260, 34134, '<td valign="top">Perfect title. Like the composition.</td>', 'Perfect title. Like the composition.', '2007-02-20 11:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384935, 469757, 39664, '<td valign="top">OK, brrrrr!  I guess a guy''s gotta do what a guy''s gotta do but damn, that looks cold! <br/> <br/>This shot would be so much more effective if you would have braved a closer shot and an interesting angle.  With the snowfalling all around (a bonus, IMHO) a tighter view of the street musician would be oh so much more intriquing.</td>', 'OK, brrrrr!  I guess a guy''s gotta do what a guy''s gotta do but damn, that looks cold!  This shot would be so much more effective if you would have braved a closer shot and an interesting angle.  With the snowfalling all around (a bonus, IMHO) a tighter view of the street musician would be oh so much more intriquing.', '2007-02-20 11:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384937, 471119, 27605, '<td valign="top">What I notice is how TINY she is!  Having the veggies in the b/g lends a sense of scale.  The shot itself seems a litte soft IMO.</td>', 'What I notice is how TINY she is!  Having the veggies in the b/g lends a sense of scale.  The shot itself seems a litte soft IMO.', '2007-02-20 11:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384944, 470831, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, great contrast.</td>', 'Very nice shot, great contrast.', '2007-02-20 11:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384945, 471198, 70661, '<td valign="top">Great colors, good feeling.</td>', 'Great colors, good feeling.', '2007-02-20 11:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384947, 468197, 70661, '<td valign="top">Great capture, love the colors.</td>', 'Great capture, love the colors.', '2007-02-20 11:24:57.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3384949, 471330, 27605, '<td valign="top">If it''s afternoon, then he''s laying "feet north" &lt;G&gt;  Excellent technicals, however I think the snooze factor carries the photo.</td>', 'If it''s afternoon, then he''s laying "feet north" <G>  Excellent technicals, however I think the snooze factor carries the photo.', '2007-02-20 11:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384950, 471382, 34134, '<td valign="top">Good capture. Appears to be greatly oversharpened.</td>', 'Good capture. Appears to be greatly oversharpened.', '2007-02-20 11:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384951, 471337, 70661, '<td valign="top">GREAT CAPTURE! Love the blank expressions on all their faces.</td>', 'GREAT CAPTURE! Love the blank expressions on all their faces.', '2007-02-20 11:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384952, 471015, 39664, '<td valign="top">He looks exhausted to me.  I assume the smiling guy in the b/g and those around him (the police) aren''t the subject of the title.  It would be nice if your subject were more in focus.</td>', 'He looks exhausted to me.  I assume the smiling guy in the b/g and those around him (the police) aren''t the subject of the title.  It would be nice if your subject were more in focus.', '2007-02-20 11:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384953, 470948, 70661, '<td valign="top">I like this alot. Love the "grunge &amp; grain".</td>', 'I like this alot. Love the "grunge & grain".', '2007-02-20 11:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384959, 471389, 27605, '<td valign="top">B/w conversion looks a little flat to me.  The woman looks bored; I think that there is more interest generated by the people in the background of the photo.</td>', 'B/w conversion looks a little flat to me.  The woman looks bored; I think that there is more interest generated by the people in the background of the photo.', '2007-02-20 11:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384965, 471522, 34134, '<td valign="top">NOw there''s something you don''t see everyday! Good capture. Definite interest point!</td>', 'NOw there''s something you don''t see everyday! Good capture. Definite interest point!', '2007-02-20 11:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384970, 470625, 39664, '<td valign="top">Oh my goodness!  Cool gritty feel here and this shot definitely evokes an emotion to me....I want to scoop him up and tell him all will be ok. Wonderful, powerful shot!</td>', 'Oh my goodness!  Cool gritty feel here and this shot definitely evokes an emotion to me....I want to scoop him up and tell him all will be ok. Wonderful, powerful shot!', '2007-02-20 11:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384971, 470647, 34134, '<td valign="top">Great shot!! Love the expression. And you lived!</td>', 'Great shot!! Love the expression. And you lived!', '2007-02-20 11:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3384977, 471369, 27605, '<td valign="top">There are several things I like about this photo.  The strong lines - both horizontal and vertical - create an interesting composition.  I like the placement of the women in the frame, and especially the look on the face of the one with the umbrella (distant though she is).  I''m curious about the lighting, though, it looks like it might have been done with on-camera flash...?  The whiteness of the fence does detract just a bit.  7</td>', 'There are several things I like about this photo.  The strong lines - both horizontal and vertical - create an interesting composition.  I like the placement of the women in the frame, and especially the look on the face of the one with the umbrella (distant though she is).  I''m curious about the lighting, though, it looks like it might have been done with on-camera flash...?  The whiteness of the fence does detract just a bit.  7', '2007-02-20 11:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
