(3386225, 471439, 6888, '<td valign="top">the thick border really takes away from the picture, which is a shame becasue this is a great shot</td>', 'the thick border really takes away from the picture, which is a shame becasue this is a great shot', '2007-02-20 17:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386234, 469671, 6888, '<td valign="top">not very interesting</td>', 'not very interesting', '2007-02-20 17:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386238, 471066, 35287, '<td valign="top">How did you manage to find such a large woman?  Excellent photograph - very well done!</td>', 'How did you manage to find such a large woman?  Excellent photograph - very well done!', '2007-02-20 17:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386239, 471129, 6888, '<td valign="top">maybe a longer exposure blurring the riders up &amp; down rather than focusing on the chain would have worked better</td>', 'maybe a longer exposure blurring the riders up & down rather than focusing on the chain would have worked better', '2007-02-20 17:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386247, 471324, 6888, '<td valign="top">not a very interesting photo</td>', 'not a very interesting photo', '2007-02-20 17:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386296, 471346, 73452, '<td valign="top">Wish it was cropped differently, without the buildings in the bottom frame,  but then you would loose the beautiful colors of the sunset.  Overall a beautiful sunset.</td>', 'Wish it was cropped differently, without the buildings in the bottom frame,  but then you would loose the beautiful colors of the sunset.  Overall a beautiful sunset.', '2007-02-20 17:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386304, 468825, 73452, '<td valign="top">love it.  Its full of life and motion.</td>', 'love it.  Its full of life and motion.', '2007-02-20 17:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386316, 470368, 73452, '<td valign="top">Im a little confused about the title.   And this isnt really a street...</td>', 'Im a little confused about the title.   And this isnt really a street...', '2007-02-20 17:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386319, 471394, 73452, '<td valign="top">LOVE this photo!  Great capture and love the title.  And im glad you put a border on it, makes the photo more complete.</td>', 'LOVE this photo!  Great capture and love the title.  And im glad you put a border on it, makes the photo more complete.', '2007-02-20 17:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386323, 471454, 42100, '<td valign="top">Great photo...the use of DOF is killer.  The composition is good and the color tones even better.  Looks like everyone is having a real good time.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Great photo...the use of DOF is killer.  The composition is good and the color tones even better.  Looks like everyone is having a real good time.  Nicely done!', '2007-02-20 17:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386324, 470940, 73452, '<td valign="top">Lovely picture, but i wish there wasent a kid (or person) in the background.  Maybe its just me.  But its still great.</td>', 'Lovely picture, but i wish there wasent a kid (or person) in the background.  Maybe its just me.  But its still great.', '2007-02-20 17:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386328, 471506, 73452, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  But its a little off topic for the contest..</td>', 'Nice colors.  But its a little off topic for the contest..', '2007-02-20 17:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386340, 471407, 73452, '<td valign="top">The man is out of focus, he should be in focus, not the SUV, IMHO.</td>', 'The man is out of focus, he should be in focus, not the SUV, IMHO.', '2007-02-20 17:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386364, 470632, 73452, '<td valign="top">Is the snow supposed to be in color?  Im really not in love with your selective coloring for a few reasons: 1.  It looks almost like the people in color were just put in there.  2.  I dont really get what this picture is supposed to convey?  And i dont get the connection to the Title is.  Maybe im just having a mind space or something.</td>', 'Is the snow supposed to be in color?  Im really not in love with your selective coloring for a few reasons: 1.  It looks almost like the people in color were just put in there.  2.  I dont really get what this picture is supposed to convey?  And i dont get the connection to the Title is.  Maybe im just having a mind space or something.', '2007-02-20 17:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386369, 470948, 73452, '<td valign="top">love this photo.  i could easily see it top voted.</td>', 'love this photo.  i could easily see it top voted.', '2007-02-20 17:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386375, 471294, 73452, '<td valign="top">love the lighting and the whole photo.  but if you had photoshop you should have burned out the sign in the bottom corner of the glass, IMHO.</td>', 'love the lighting and the whole photo.  but if you had photoshop you should have burned out the sign in the bottom corner of the glass, IMHO.', '2007-02-20 17:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386379, 470834, 32221, '<td valign="top">looks like there was a lot going on here, I would have liked to see a bit more detail. Next time have a go at getting a bit closer. It''s not that scary once you get started! If your not too happy pointing your camera at strangers try shooting from the hip. Good luck!</td>', 'looks like there was a lot going on here, I would have liked to see a bit more detail. Next time have a go at getting a bit closer. It''s not that scary once you get started! If your not too happy pointing your camera at strangers try shooting from the hip. Good luck!', '2007-02-20 17:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386381, 471521, 73452, '<td valign="top">Love it! The colors are awsome and pop right out!</td>', 'Love it! The colors are awsome and pop right out!', '2007-02-20 17:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386384, 470963, 32221, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait</td>', 'Nice portrait', '2007-02-20 17:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386388, 471214, 73452, '<td valign="top">If i could vote, i would give this a 10!  wonderfull photo, love how some people are fully attentioned, and others are just passing by.</td>', 'If i could vote, i would give this a 10!  wonderfull photo, love how some people are fully attentioned, and others are just passing by.', '2007-02-20 17:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386391, 471468, 73452, '<td valign="top">love it.  No question about it.</td>', 'love it.  No question about it.', '2007-02-20 18:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386401, 469415, 73452, '<td valign="top">10!  wish i could vote!  This is an awsome photo.</td>', '10!  wish i could vote!  This is an awsome photo.', '2007-02-20 18:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386410, 471095, 73452, '<td valign="top">wished the Right side of the photo was cropped off a litlle more, but it good.</td>', 'wished the Right side of the photo was cropped off a litlle more, but it good.', '2007-02-20 18:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386411, 471493, 73452, '<td valign="top">I dont like this photo, its boring.</td>', 'I dont like this photo, its boring.', '2007-02-20 18:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386415, 471100, 73452, '<td valign="top">Love this photo, embraces the character of this man well, cradling his guitar as if it were his last few moments..great..</td>', 'Love this photo, embraces the character of this man well, cradling his guitar as if it were his last few moments..great..', '2007-02-20 18:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386420, 471403, 32221, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The wide angle works great.  I guess perhaps in an ideal world the person could have been a little closer.</td>', 'Very nice. The wide angle works great.  I guess perhaps in an ideal world the person could have been a little closer.', '2007-02-20 18:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386421, 468708, 73452, '<td valign="top">is it sad because noones on it? Little confused.</td>', 'is it sad because noones on it? Little confused.', '2007-02-20 18:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386427, 471128, 32221, '<td valign="top">Cool!</td>', 'Cool!', '2007-02-20 18:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386430, 471125, 73452, '<td valign="top">would have liked it in B&amp;W</td>', 'would have liked it in B&W', '2007-02-20 18:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386431, 470986, 32221, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture</td>', 'Very nice capture', '2007-02-20 18:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386436, 470869, 73452, '<td valign="top">GREAT photo, i love it.</td>', 'GREAT photo, i love it.', '2007-02-20 18:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386437, 470747, 73452, '<td valign="top">great color</td>', 'great color', '2007-02-20 18:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386449, 470312, 73452, '<td valign="top">would have liked if there were only 1 man/or women and if the boat was a different color.  other then that i love this photo.</td>', 'would have liked if there were only 1 man/or women and if the boat was a different color.  other then that i love this photo.', '2007-02-20 18:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386457, 469671, 73452, '<td valign="top">its ok...</td>', 'its ok...', '2007-02-20 18:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386462, 470910, 73452, '<td valign="top">CUTE!  love it.. title fits nicely with the photo.</td>', 'CUTE!  love it.. title fits nicely with the photo.', '2007-02-20 18:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386467, 471492, 73452, '<td valign="top">I dont like the giant box  bush in front of the bench.</td>', 'I dont like the giant box  bush in front of the bench.', '2007-02-20 18:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386473, 471439, 42100, '<td valign="top">I''m probably alone in this feeling...but I''m thinking the title is not working for this photo.  That''s funny in itself because normally I don''t pay much attention to titles.  ''Unfair'' suggests a more negative storyline, but I really see a much more positive and upbeat one.  Yes he''s in the chair, but I''m seeing him hanging with his friends having a good time and definitely not letting a disability ruin his life.  Maybe I''m being too sunny, I don''t know.  Oh, did I mention...very good photograph!</td>', 'I''m probably alone in this feeling...but I''m thinking the title is not working for this photo.  That''s funny in itself because normally I don''t pay much attention to titles.  ''Unfair'' suggests a more negative storyline, but I really see a much more positive and upbeat one.  Yes he''s in the chair, but I''m seeing him hanging with his friends having a good time and definitely not letting a disability ruin his life.  Maybe I''m being too sunny, I don''t know.  Oh, did I mention...very good photograph!', '2007-02-20 18:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386484, 468975, 25166, '<td valign="top">The colours and shapes here are fantastic. Very bold. Very nice. 7</td>', 'The colours and shapes here are fantastic. Very bold. Very nice. 7', '2007-02-20 18:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386521, 470943, 54431, '<td valign="top">I love this shot! You did a great job of capturing the bond of friendship between these boys. 10</td>', 'I love this shot! You did a great job of capturing the bond of friendship between these boys. 10', '2007-02-20 18:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386526, 471101, 50695, '<td valign="top">looks like clumsy vignetting. great moment, though.</td>', 'looks like clumsy vignetting. great moment, though.', '2007-02-20 18:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386543, 470869, 25166, '<td valign="top">Cool!</td>', 'Cool!', '2007-02-20 18:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386557, 470841, 25166, '<td valign="top">Is that a dude?</td>', 'Is that a dude?', '2007-02-20 18:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386562, 471522, 25166, '<td valign="top">Skydive gone wrong?</td>', 'Skydive gone wrong?', '2007-02-20 18:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386570, 471151, 25166, '<td valign="top">He''s a looker aint he? Great picture of an interesting subject. 7<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-04-03 18:55:43.</i></td>', 'He''s a looker aint he? Great picture of an interesting subject. 7', '2007-02-20 18:54:21.000000', '2007-04-03 19:55:43.000000', 1),
(3386572, 470830, 25166, '<td valign="top">Why not? 6</td>', 'Why not? 6', '2007-02-20 18:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386624, 470779, 48890, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the tribute bit, but, to me, it looks like you''ve ruined a good photograph. :(</td>', 'I appreciate the tribute bit, but, to me, it looks like you''ve ruined a good photograph. :(', '2007-02-20 19:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386627, 468975, 49773, '<td valign="top">If only Mondrian could see this. Great find.</td>', 'If only Mondrian could see this. Great find.', '2007-02-20 19:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386634, 471247, 48890, '<td valign="top">This moment had potential.  You photographed it straight up front, which, usually, creates a boring composition with lots of lines parallel to the frame edges.</td>', 'This moment had potential.  You photographed it straight up front, which, usually, creates a boring composition with lots of lines parallel to the frame edges.', '2007-02-20 19:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386642, 468197, 48890, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I like the phase of the woman''s movement, and I like the arches of the walkway.  If there was someone exiting through one of the other arches, the shot would be completely surreal.<br/> <br/>The sign on the top is too dominating.  It would be better to cut part of it off when composing.  Even more so because of the bright empty space above the arches. 7</td>', 'Interesting.  I like the phase of the woman''s movement, and I like the arches of the walkway.  If there was someone exiting through one of the other arches, the shot would be completely surreal. The sign on the top is too dominating.  It would be better to cut part of it off when composing.  Even more so because of the bright empty space above the arches. 7', '2007-02-20 19:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386646, 471482, 48890, '<td valign="top">A very timid shot.  If you waited for the man to approach closer, the shot would look deeper and more involving.</td>', 'A very timid shot.  If you waited for the man to approach closer, the shot would look deeper and more involving.', '2007-02-20 19:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386651, 470625, 48890, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  I think you''ve over-processed.</td>', 'Great composition.  I think you''ve over-processed.', '2007-02-20 19:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386655, 471261, 48890, '<td valign="top">I wish the photographer were braver. :)</td>', 'I wish the photographer were braver. :)', '2007-02-20 19:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386659, 471306, 73601, '<td valign="top">creative name, good shot</td>', 'creative name, good shot', '2007-02-20 19:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386661, 470597, 48890, '<td valign="top">To me this looks boring, sorry.</td>', 'To me this looks boring, sorry.', '2007-02-20 19:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386665, 468975, 48890, '<td valign="top">I wish there were something of interest in the foreground.  The background is nice, but isn''t enough to make this photograph interesting.</td>', 'I wish there were something of interest in the foreground.  The background is nice, but isn''t enough to make this photograph interesting.', '2007-02-20 19:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386668, 471477, 48890, '<td valign="top">I don''t see a street shot here, it''s just a portrait of a mother with a child.  Could very well have been family album material.</td>', 'I don''t see a street shot here, it''s just a portrait of a mother with a child.  Could very well have been family album material.', '2007-02-20 19:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386680, 471129, 48890, '<td valign="top">The diagonals are yummy, and the hanging chain in the foreground is nice.  It just doesn''t come together for me, sorry.</td>', 'The diagonals are yummy, and the hanging chain in the foreground is nice.  It just doesn''t come together for me, sorry.', '2007-02-20 19:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386690, 470153, 48890, '<td valign="top">A nice phase of movement, and the silhouette.  Don''t like the squarish format for such a dynamic shot.  I''d go for a tighter shot, with the figure completely against the snow bank.</td>', 'A nice phase of movement, and the silhouette.  Don''t like the squarish format for such a dynamic shot.  I''d go for a tighter shot, with the figure completely against the snow bank.', '2007-02-20 19:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386698, 470416, 48890, '<td valign="top">A portrait, not street photography.  As a portrait, this is nice, even if overprocessed.</td>', 'A portrait, not street photography.  As a portrait, this is nice, even if overprocessed.', '2007-02-20 19:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386712, 469314, 48890, '<td valign="top">No, doesn''t work even as a reportage shot, sorry.</td>', 'No, doesn''t work even as a reportage shot, sorry.', '2007-02-20 19:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386719, 469981, 48890, '<td valign="top">This falls apart into three pictures, each one of which could be a nice street shot.  The two backlit people on the left, the sitting guy in the middle, and the group on teh right.  There is nothing tying them together, compositionally.</td>', 'This falls apart into three pictures, each one of which could be a nice street shot.  The two backlit people on the left, the sitting guy in the middle, and the group on teh right.  There is nothing tying them together, compositionally.', '2007-02-20 19:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386726, 468000, 48890, '<td valign="top">More effort went into postprocessing than in composing this shot.</td>', 'More effort went into postprocessing than in composing this shot.', '2007-02-20 19:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386729, 471128, 48890, '<td valign="top">A great moment, ruined by overprocessing.</td>', 'A great moment, ruined by overprocessing.', '2007-02-20 19:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386738, 471028, 48890, '<td valign="top">A nice picture.  Pretentious title. 7</td>', 'A nice picture.  Pretentious title. 7', '2007-02-20 19:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386740, 470993, 48890, '<td valign="top">I am wishing for more of the environment in the picture.</td>', 'I am wishing for more of the environment in the picture.', '2007-02-20 19:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386744, 470695, 48890, '<td valign="top">Nice, very photographic. 8</td>', 'Nice, very photographic. 8', '2007-02-20 19:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3386746, 470405, 48890, '<td valign="top">A rather boring story; overcontrasted.</td>', 'A rather boring story; overcontrasted.', '2007-02-20 19:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
