(3388574, 470831, 68546, '<td valign="top">really like the composition on this one. I think the girl needs to be a bit closer or sharper, she''s not quite a strong enough element in the shot in my opinion. Still really like the shot though, good work</td>', 'really like the composition on this one. I think the girl needs to be a bit closer or sharper, she''s not quite a strong enough element in the shot in my opinion. Still really like the shot though, good work', '2007-02-21 08:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3388579, 470965, 68546, '<td valign="top">great shot, i think it could benefit from a bit more contrast? still excellent</td>', 'great shot, i think it could benefit from a bit more contrast? still excellent', '2007-02-21 08:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3388586, 470632, 68546, '<td valign="top">very good! some strange postprocessing though? - 8</td>', 'very good! some strange postprocessing though? - 8', '2007-02-21 08:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3388591, 470700, 27605, '<td valign="top">Columbus GA?  Fabulous photo in it''s own right, but it has a bit of a portraiture feel IMO.  A strong 7 from me; good luck.</td>', 'Columbus GA?  Fabulous photo in it''s own right, but it has a bit of a portraiture feel IMO.  A strong 7 from me; good luck.', '2007-02-21 08:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3388593, 471514, 68546, '<td valign="top">fantastic, great mist and composition - 8</td>', 'fantastic, great mist and composition - 8', '2007-02-21 08:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3388602, 471214, 27605, '<td valign="top">Nice, nice!  Those crazy words "Bik Bok" add a lot to this, and yet I am glad you didn''t use that for your title.  I think the blur suits this image very well.  Happy to see faces, too, and not only the backs of heads.  IMO the post processing is a little flat, but I do like the image.  8</td>', 'Nice, nice!  Those crazy words "Bik Bok" add a lot to this, and yet I am glad you didn''t use that for your title.  I think the blur suits this image very well.  Happy to see faces, too, and not only the backs of heads.  IMO the post processing is a little flat, but I do like the image.  8', '2007-02-21 08:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3388834, 471103, 27605, '<td valign="top">Your title give me the impression that you are concerned that some voters won''t consider this "street photography".  I agree with you that it certainly is! however I would have think another title would have been better.  I don''t consider titles in voting anyway, I just mention it for what it''s worth (not much:)<br/> <br/>Now for the photo:  wow, really excellent grab.  I love that she ''caught'' you and that you captured the moment.  The large window frame gives context and clarity to what I''m seeing, and nicely adds to the composition in it''s own right.  The hanging hearts hint at Valentines (of course we know because of the challenge date); the reflections in the window aren''t distracting at all and indeed add to the feel of this being a street scene.  I think you could use a wee bit more contrast, probably via dodge/burn, but this is such a minor nit-pick.  One of my top picks; best of luck.</td>', 'Your title give me the impression that you are concerned that some voters won''t consider this "street photography".  I agree with you that it certainly is! however I would have think another title would have been better.  I don''t consider titles in voting anyway, I just mention it for what it''s worth (not much:) Now for the photo:  wow, really excellent grab.  I love that she ''caught'' you and that you captured the moment.  The large window frame gives context and clarity to what I''m seeing, and nicely adds to the composition in it''s own right.  The hanging hearts hint at Valentines (of course we know because of the challenge date); the reflections in the window aren''t distracting at all and indeed add to the feel of this being a street scene.  I think you could use a wee bit more contrast, probably via dodge/burn, but this is such a minor nit-pick.  One of my top picks; best of luck.', '2007-02-21 09:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3388838, 470411, 27605, '<td valign="top">Now that seems dangerous!  I would give odds that he fell at least once.  Very nice grab, by the way.</td>', 'Now that seems dangerous!  I would give odds that he fell at least once.  Very nice grab, by the way.', '2007-02-21 09:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3388866, 471443, 27605, '<td valign="top">Very well composed!  At first glance my gut reaction was "snapshot" but that impression quickly was gone.  I especially like the geometric elements of the photo, and of course also the placement of the subject in the frame.  The light and shadow is perfect.  8</td>', 'Very well composed!  At first glance my gut reaction was "snapshot" but that impression quickly was gone.  I especially like the geometric elements of the photo, and of course also the placement of the subject in the frame.  The light and shadow is perfect.  8', '2007-02-21 10:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3388923, 470153, 27605, '<td valign="top">I like your composition.  However on my monitor at least I see no detail in her clothing... do you agree?  6 Bump &gt; 7</td>', 'I like your composition.  However on my monitor at least I see no detail in her clothing... do you agree?  6 Bump > 7', '2007-02-21 10:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3388945, 468577, 6888, '<td valign="top">not really very interesting</td>', 'not really very interesting', '2007-02-21 10:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3388953, 469981, 6888, '<td valign="top">odd aspect and not overly interesting</td>', 'odd aspect and not overly interesting', '2007-02-21 10:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3388965, 470834, 6888, '<td valign="top">too busy &amp; not very interesting</td>', 'too busy & not very interesting', '2007-02-21 10:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3388971, 471167, 6888, '<td valign="top">not very interesting</td>', 'not very interesting', '2007-02-21 10:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3389041, 471256, 31443, '<td valign="top">Nice and colorful!</td>', 'Nice and colorful!', '2007-02-21 10:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3389241, 470368, 18738, '<td valign="top">Shot taken a second too soon.composition just isn''t as strong with the man and woman almost merging.</td>', 'Shot taken a second too soon.composition just isn''t as strong with the man and woman almost merging.', '2007-02-21 11:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3389245, 470837, 18738, '<td valign="top">Mesmerising</td>', 'Mesmerising', '2007-02-21 11:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3389269, 471078, 18738, '<td valign="top">brave of you.</td>', 'brave of you.', '2007-02-21 11:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3389279, 470497, 18738, '<td valign="top">Old people miserable and alone; young people happy and sociable?</td>', 'Old people miserable and alone; young people happy and sociable?', '2007-02-21 11:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3389309, 468787, 18738, '<td valign="top">processed to oblibvion. Excessive smoothing AND selective desat?<br/> <br/>If I gave points for courage you''d be sorted.</td>', 'processed to oblibvion. Excessive smoothing AND selective desat? If I gave points for courage you''d be sorted.', '2007-02-21 11:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3389319, 471106, 18738, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, this is a very static image for me. That centred subject and the</td>', 'I''m sorry, this is a very static image for me. That centred subject and the', '2007-02-21 11:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3389329, 470843, 18738, '<td valign="top">I wonder whose this could be? That strained look of studied indifference is brilliant. Clearly not a Londoner.</td>', 'I wonder whose this could be? That strained look of studied indifference is brilliant. Clearly not a Londoner.', '2007-02-21 11:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3389342, 470700, 48890, '<td valign="top">//theonlinephotographer.blogspot.com/2006/03/photographing-homeless-banned.html</td>', '//theonlinephotographer.blogspot.com/2006/03/photographing-homeless-banned.html', '2007-02-21 11:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3389351, 468000, 18738, '<td valign="top">high contrast, fine detail, low res. It just can''t help looking a little messy.</td>', 'high contrast, fine detail, low res. It just can''t help looking a little messy.', '2007-02-21 11:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3389353, 470725, 27605, '<td valign="top">That is one BIG portfolio she''s carrying.  Great photo, 8.  Good luck!</td>', 'That is one BIG portfolio she''s carrying.  Great photo, 8.  Good luck!', '2007-02-21 11:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3389359, 470489, 48890, '<td valign="top">What a silly title!</td>', 'What a silly title!', '2007-02-21 11:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3389361, 470475, 48890, '<td valign="top">//theonlinephotographer.blogspot.com/2006/03/photographing-homeless-banned.html</td>', '//theonlinephotographer.blogspot.com/2006/03/photographing-homeless-banned.html', '2007-02-21 11:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3389372, 471510, 18738, '<td valign="top">Fantastic. But I want to see this bigger, a lot bigger, and the fact that you wasted some of the space on a border, especially with all those small subjects, is a little odd.</td>', 'Fantastic. But I want to see this bigger, a lot bigger, and the fact that you wasted some of the space on a border, especially with all those small subjects, is a little odd.', '2007-02-21 11:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3389373, 471493, 48890, '<td valign="top">Only in America.<br/>p.s. Do you *have* to spell it out in the title?</td>', 'Only in America.p.s. Do you *have* to spell it out in the title?', '2007-02-21 11:46:45.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3389401, 471233, 48890, '<td valign="top">I like this one.  A tiny bit more contrast and a non-square format would be better, IMO.</td>', 'I like this one.  A tiny bit more contrast and a non-square format would be better, IMO.', '2007-02-21 11:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3389403, 471152, 18738, '<td valign="top">Especially as you can''t see her face, the photo, for me, seems to rest on the shape of the figures. The statue and the girl posing. I can''t help thinking it would be stronger in black and white.</td>', 'Especially as you can''t see her face, the photo, for me, seems to rest on the shape of the figures. The statue and the girl posing. I can''t help thinking it would be stronger in black and white.', '2007-02-21 11:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3389410, 471259, 48890, '<td valign="top">:)  Nice picture.</td>', ':)  Nice picture.', '2007-02-21 11:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3389414, 470460, 48890, '<td valign="top">Nice panning here.</td>', 'Nice panning here.', '2007-02-21 11:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3389416, 470663, 48890, '<td valign="top">A nice portrait.  Where''s the street?</td>', 'A nice portrait.  Where''s the street?', '2007-02-21 11:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3389422, 471498, 18738, '<td valign="top">nice. Not sure how much you boosted the saturation but I think you overdid it a little. especially from looking at the artifacts in the bottom right corner. The background is neutral, the image would still have been strong with more muted colours.</td>', 'nice. Not sure how much you boosted the saturation but I think you overdid it a little. especially from looking at the artifacts in the bottom right corner. The background is neutral, the image would still have been strong with more muted colours.', '2007-02-21 11:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3389425, 470963, 48890, '<td valign="top">A great *portrait*.</td>', 'A great *portrait*.', '2007-02-21 11:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3389436, 467632, 48890, '<td valign="top">I wish I could understand what the man was doing.  Visually, a very pleasant shot, love the light here.  I think you went overboard with PP.</td>', 'I wish I could understand what the man was doing.  Visually, a very pleasant shot, love the light here.  I think you went overboard with PP.', '2007-02-21 12:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3389457, 471483, 48890, '<td valign="top">Great moment.  A step afterwards would be better, to separate the guy from the post.</td>', 'Great moment.  A step afterwards would be better, to separate the guy from the post.', '2007-02-21 12:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3389471, 470559, 48890, '<td valign="top">Pretty.</td>', 'Pretty.', '2007-02-21 12:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3389600, 470834, 71392, '<td valign="top">Lacks sharpness</td>', 'Lacks sharpness', '2007-02-21 12:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3389789, 471356, 74242, '<td valign="top">Catching up old times !?! I like this. :-)</td>', 'Catching up old times !?! I like this. :-)', '2007-02-21 12:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3389872, 471007, 13688, '<td valign="top">the strung lights is very interesting to me.  though, your main subjects have trouble holding my attention</td>', 'the strung lights is very interesting to me.  though, your main subjects have trouble holding my attention', '2007-02-21 13:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3389897, 469287, 13688, '<td valign="top">i''m curious why you chose this angle over all of the other almost infinite number of possiblilities you had.  other than the title this really doesn''t speak to me about the specific location or potentially streets in general.</td>', 'i''m curious why you chose this angle over all of the other almost infinite number of possiblilities you had.  other than the title this really doesn''t speak to me about the specific location or potentially streets in general.', '2007-02-21 13:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3389906, 470920, 13688, '<td valign="top">i really don''t like to comment on borders but i''d like to have seen this with a beige one that doesn''t grab so much attention.  your smoothing of the noise has left the details a bit too fuzzy.  i have trouble connecting with your characters.</td>', 'i really don''t like to comment on borders but i''d like to have seen this with a beige one that doesn''t grab so much attention.  your smoothing of the noise has left the details a bit too fuzzy.  i have trouble connecting with your characters.', '2007-02-21 13:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3389924, 471151, 13688, '<td valign="top">interesting character.  like the processing, eventhough the taco bell cup seems to have been taken to an abnormal hue.  the cars grab a bit more attention than they should.</td>', 'interesting character.  like the processing, eventhough the taco bell cup seems to have been taken to an abnormal hue.  the cars grab a bit more attention than they should.', '2007-02-21 13:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3389940, 471067, 13688, '<td valign="top">very interesting location.  the protagonist digging through her purse seems an odd choice of subject though.  would have liked to see a passerby in the same location going the other way...kind of leaning into the frame.</td>', 'very interesting location.  the protagonist digging through her purse seems an odd choice of subject though.  would have liked to see a passerby in the same location going the other way...kind of leaning into the frame.', '2007-02-21 13:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3389964, 468708, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice moodiness, but this really doesn''t have a ton to hold this viewers interest.  i think if you cloned out all of the street lights leaving only the one on the bridge, i might be getting more on board with this image.</td>', 'nice moodiness, but this really doesn''t have a ton to hold this viewers interest.  i think if you cloned out all of the street lights leaving only the one on the bridge, i might be getting more on board with this image.', '2007-02-21 13:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3389969, 470489, 68256, '<td valign="top">I really don''t like your title.  I''m giving you an 8 because I like the photo, but that title is just, well, just...words escape me.  I would like it even better with some more space in front of her.  I also like the slight blur of her front foot indicating motion.</td>', 'I really don''t like your title.  I''m giving you an 8 because I like the photo, but that title is just, well, just...words escape me.  I would like it even better with some more space in front of her.  I also like the slight blur of her front foot indicating motion.', '2007-02-21 13:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3389979, 470416, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice portrait.  like how the eye is led off to the top right.  the branch then hanging down becomes a distraction for me.  processing has a very street feeling for me, not sure about the choice of subject for this challenge.</td>', 'nice portrait.  like how the eye is led off to the top right.  the branch then hanging down becomes a distraction for me.  processing has a very street feeling for me, not sure about the choice of subject for this challenge.', '2007-02-21 13:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3389995, 470195, 34134, '<td valign="top">Back for bumping up and comment: This is very cool. Really captures a mood. Like the texture (although you are probably getting killed for it!) Like the muted tones. It tells a story. I''d be very pleased to have taken this shot! 9</td>', 'Back for bumping up and comment: This is very cool. Really captures a mood. Like the texture (although you are probably getting killed for it!) Like the muted tones. It tells a story. I''d be very pleased to have taken this shot! 9', '2007-02-21 13:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3389998, 471139, 13688, '<td valign="top">since graffi seems completely atypical of venice, i wish you found a way to juxtapose some of the more common venitian themes with this wall.  obviously that would of required stepping back and loosing some details, but it would remove the strong need of your title to make this shot intriguing at all.</td>', 'since graffi seems completely atypical of venice, i wish you found a way to juxtapose some of the more common venitian themes with this wall.  obviously that would of required stepping back and loosing some details, but it would remove the strong need of your title to make this shot intriguing at all.', '2007-02-21 13:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3390018, 471277, 68256, '<td valign="top">I hope you don''t get to many low votes because of no street.  To me this is pretty classic and is well composed.  8</td>', 'I hope you don''t get to many low votes because of no street.  To me this is pretty classic and is well composed.  8', '2007-02-21 13:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3390029, 471481, 68256, '<td valign="top">I love the tones.  To me this is definately street photography style and is a good shot overall.  Maybe you won''t get to many low votes because a human isn''t in it. 7</td>', 'I love the tones.  To me this is definately street photography style and is a good shot overall.  Maybe you won''t get to many low votes because a human isn''t in it. 7', '2007-02-21 13:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3390045, 468783, 74242, '<td valign="top">Cool !</td>', 'Cool !', '2007-02-21 13:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3390060, 471166, 327, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.</td>', 'Nicely done.', '2007-02-21 13:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3390066, 470831, 27605, '<td valign="top">In my opinion the subject is just too blurry.  I expect that was intentional, and sometimes I do like the effect, but here it doesn''t work for me.  Hope you will find this comment to be helpful.</td>', 'In my opinion the subject is just too blurry.  I expect that was intentional, and sometimes I do like the effect, but here it doesn''t work for me.  Hope you will find this comment to be helpful.', '2007-02-21 13:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3390077, 471317, 327, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, good mix of color and action.</td>', 'Nicely done, good mix of color and action.', '2007-02-21 13:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3390095, 468197, 327, '<td valign="top">Great capture of colors!! Like it, nice job.</td>', 'Great capture of colors!! Like it, nice job.', '2007-02-21 13:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3390105, 470986, 70674, '<td valign="top">I love the little kid caching you taking the picture at the last second.</td>', 'I love the little kid caching you taking the picture at the last second.', '2007-02-21 14:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3390246, 470722, 13688, '<td valign="top">more like a tribute to Eisenstaedt or Jorgensen.  Though no one really seems to be caring perhaps that''s what you feel is Cartier-Bresson like about it.  i''m just not feeling a connection with the couple and there isn''t a dog looking up at them to make it funny.</td>', 'more like a tribute to Eisenstaedt or Jorgensen.  Though no one really seems to be caring perhaps that''s what you feel is Cartier-Bresson like about it.  i''m just not feeling a connection with the couple and there isn''t a dog looking up at them to make it funny.', '2007-02-21 14:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3390378, 471498, 30049, '<td valign="top">Is this for real?!  If yes, what a catch.  If not, what a fine job of PP.  :D  Did you do some manual blurring on the rails and snowpile in the lower left?  Looks fuzzy over there...just an observation.  One other minor thing that sticks out are the lamp globes - one is white, the other yellow.<br/> <br/>Overall, a job very well done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Is this for real?!  If yes, what a catch.  If not, what a fine job of PP.  :D  Did you do some manual blurring on the rails and snowpile in the lower left?  Looks fuzzy over there...just an observation.  One other minor thing that sticks out are the lamp globes - one is white, the other yellow. Overall, a job very well done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-02-21 15:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3390379, 471158, 30049, '<td valign="top">Creative use of lens flare?  Very cool result however you obtained it.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Creative use of lens flare?  Very cool result however you obtained it.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-02-21 15:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3390400, 471344, 39664, '<td valign="top">In the spirit of street photography, this just isn''t it.  Thank you for not taking a photo of the graffiti straight on and making it flat.  You weren''t the only person that took the challenge title too literally and did not review the rich history of the genre.</td>', 'In the spirit of street photography, this just isn''t it.  Thank you for not taking a photo of the graffiti straight on and making it flat.  You weren''t the only person that took the challenge title too literally and did not review the rich history of the genre.', '2007-02-21 15:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3390417, 468000, 58634, '<td valign="top">I love this shot and the contrast.</td>', 'I love this shot and the contrast.', '2007-02-21 15:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3390427, 469314, 58634, '<td valign="top">Peta?<br/>Good shot.</td>', 'Peta?Good shot.', '2007-02-21 15:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3390428, 470698, 74534, '<td valign="top">All subjects having their backs to the camera make this image a lot less interesting than it could have been, good idea otherwise! (5)</td>', 'All subjects having their backs to the camera make this image a lot less interesting than it could have been, good idea otherwise! (5)', '2007-02-21 15:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3390441, 471152, 42254, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and catchy subject.  A shallower depth of field and a closer crop would have made the subjects stand out from the background clutter.</td>', 'Nice shot and catchy subject.  A shallower depth of field and a closer crop would have made the subjects stand out from the background clutter.', '2007-02-21 15:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3390456, 471180, 19708, '<td valign="top">This is excellent on so many levels!<br/>The perceived interaction between mannequins and the man couldn''t be better.<br/>Your black &amp; white tones achieved in this compliment the shot very well.<br/>One of the few that I''m adding into my favorites and hope to see this do very well!</td>', 'This is excellent on so many levels!The perceived interaction between mannequins and the man couldn''t be better.Your black & white tones achieved in this compliment the shot very well.One of the few that I''m adding into my favorites and hope to see this do very well!', '2007-02-21 15:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3390467, 470871, 19708, '<td valign="top">lol @ the title, and enjoy the story here.<br/>More questions on this, but will wait until after to see what this was about.</td>', 'lol @ the title, and enjoy the story here.More questions on this, but will wait until after to see what this was about.', '2007-02-21 15:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3390483, 469974, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nice job framing what looks to be a mannequin in the window.<br/>This point of view and overall composition is very good, as are the tones you used in the post-processing. I''m not sure the extent of the pp was in best interests and hope your score isn''t getting hit because of it.<br/>I''d really like to see this processed in a more conventional manner, as it really is a very good shot.</td>', 'Nice job framing what looks to be a mannequin in the window.This point of view and overall composition is very good, as are the tones you used in the post-processing. I''m not sure the extent of the pp was in best interests and hope your score isn''t getting hit because of it.I''d really like to see this processed in a more conventional manner, as it really is a very good shot.', '2007-02-21 15:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3390518, 471097, 19708, '<td valign="top">This is a precious shot, and I really like the crop / angles here.<br/>The expression here is pure joy.<br/>I hope the voters are being kind, as this is really more of a candid, and has very little to reflect a street scene. Best of luck, and be proud of this one.</td>', 'This is a precious shot, and I really like the crop / angles here.The expression here is pure joy.I hope the voters are being kind, as this is really more of a candid, and has very little to reflect a street scene. Best of luck, and be proud of this one.', '2007-02-21 15:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3390570, 470609, 68256, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and it does meet the challenge, but I can''t get over the overall lack of focus. Looks like camera shake?</td>', 'I like the composition and it does meet the challenge, but I can''t get over the overall lack of focus. Looks like camera shake?', '2007-02-21 16:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3390592, 468825, 74560, '<td valign="top">great shot</td>', 'great shot', '2007-02-21 16:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
