(3390803, 471378, 67258, '<td valign="top">I feel that this would have benefitted from a shallower depth of field (hard at night, I know - and I am not sure whether I could have done it) in order to let the horse and carriage stand out, as the background is very busy.  On first pass I failed to notice the resting driver who, at the end of the day, is the ''subject''!  I would like to see the photo more titly framed, perhaps cropped so that just half the carriage and half the horse are included.</td>', 'I feel that this would have benefitted from a shallower depth of field (hard at night, I know - and I am not sure whether I could have done it) in order to let the horse and carriage stand out, as the background is very busy.  On first pass I failed to notice the resting driver who, at the end of the day, is the ''subject''!  I would like to see the photo more titly framed, perhaps cropped so that just half the carriage and half the horse are included.', '2007-02-21 17:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
