(3390827, 471286, 67258, '<td valign="top">There is seriously a shop called ''Forplay''?!  <br/>I am afraid that there isn''t enough definition in this photograph for it to work for me.  The subject is surely the man standing in the left corner, and yet this is the area where focus is softest.  The photo also has a washed out feel - a little judicious burning would help give a little more contrast.  On a positive note, the inclusion of the police car helps provide a sense of story to the photo.</td>', 'There is seriously a shop called ''Forplay''?!  I am afraid that there isn''t enough definition in this photograph for it to work for me.  The subject is surely the man standing in the left corner, and yet this is the area where focus is softest.  The photo also has a washed out feel - a little judicious burning would help give a little more contrast.  On a positive note, the inclusion of the police car helps provide a sense of story to the photo.', '2007-02-21 17:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
