(3390852, 470922, 67258, '<td valign="top">A much wider perspective, taking more of the scene would help this in terms of the challenge.  As it is, the photo doesn''t say to me ''street'' or similar environment - it could have been taken in a cloakroom for all I know!  That said, it is a pleasing portrait of the little girl and you have captured her eyes and smile very nicely.</td>', 'A much wider perspective, taking more of the scene would help this in terms of the challenge.  As it is, the photo doesn''t say to me ''street'' or similar environment - it could have been taken in a cloakroom for all I know!  That said, it is a pleasing portrait of the little girl and you have captured her eyes and smile very nicely.', '2007-02-21 17:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3390878, 469671, 67258, '<td valign="top">Certainly out of the box thinking, but to carry the photo off it needs to be technically sound.  The exposure here is quite badly of, with the reflected sunlight blowing the highlights.  An interesting perspective though, and I hope you didn''t risk getting runover when lying down in the middle of the road!</td>', 'Certainly out of the box thinking, but to carry the photo off it needs to be technically sound.  The exposure here is quite badly of, with the reflected sunlight blowing the highlights.  An interesting perspective though, and I hope you didn''t risk getting runover when lying down in the middle of the road!', '2007-02-21 17:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3390896, 470725, 41337, '<td valign="top">An interesting shot and well framed. I like the editing but would have preferred to see some detail kept in the portfolio case.</td>', 'An interesting shot and well framed. I like the editing but would have preferred to see some detail kept in the portfolio case.', '2007-02-21 17:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3390908, 471327, 67258, '<td valign="top">It looks as though the light was very harsh here, and I do find myself squinting when viewing the bright whites of the shirts!  I think a more interesting photograph, in terms of ''street photography'' might have been taken by standing forward and to the left of your original position, so that you could capture at least one of the performers, but also the expressions of the spectators - this would weave more of a narrative in to the composition.</td>', 'It looks as though the light was very harsh here, and I do find myself squinting when viewing the bright whites of the shirts!  I think a more interesting photograph, in terms of ''street photography'' might have been taken by standing forward and to the left of your original position, so that you could capture at least one of the performers, but also the expressions of the spectators - this would weave more of a narrative in to the composition.', '2007-02-21 17:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3390915, 470868, 41337, '<td valign="top">I love this!</td>', 'I love this!', '2007-02-21 17:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3390965, 470312, 67258, '<td valign="top">The composition of this is pleasingly balanced, but somehow the picture doesn''t really connect with me.  I wonder I might be better a little less tightly framed?</td>', 'The composition of this is pleasingly balanced, but somehow the picture doesn''t really connect with me.  I wonder I might be better a little less tightly framed?', '2007-02-21 17:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3390974, 471363, 67258, '<td valign="top">On first pass through, I dismissed this photo as a straight shot of a graffiti daubed wall, but on revewing I see I was quite wrong.  The angles of the different parts of the building make for an interesting composition, although it is a shme that they are not a little more accenuated.  I wonder if a little burning of the inverted C might help draw attention to it?</td>', 'On first pass through, I dismissed this photo as a straight shot of a graffiti daubed wall, but on revewing I see I was quite wrong.  The angles of the different parts of the building make for an interesting composition, although it is a shme that they are not a little more accenuated.  I wonder if a little burning of the inverted C might help draw attention to it?', '2007-02-21 17:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3390975, 470368, 67258, '<td valign="top">Umm, why woud he be writing about mills?</td>', 'Umm, why woud he be writing about mills?', '2007-02-21 17:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3390981, 471481, 67258, '<td valign="top">An iviting entrance without people, balloons without a party - gives an almost eerie feel.  That said, I would prefer the shot more if you had captured someone, or better still a couple coming out of the building.</td>', 'An iviting entrance without people, balloons without a party - gives an almost eerie feel.  That said, I would prefer the shot more if you had captured someone, or better still a couple coming out of the building.', '2007-02-21 17:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391011, 468787, 34938, '<td valign="top">...the processing here and the background and the composition is really messy. I take it you used Neat Image and that puts a soft romantic glow around a gritty subject...it just doesn''t work for me...sorry mate :-(</td>', '...the processing here and the background and the composition is really messy. I take it you used Neat Image and that puts a soft romantic glow around a gritty subject...it just doesn''t work for me...sorry mate :-(', '2007-02-21 18:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
