(3391584, 471214, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  The expressions on the crowd, particularly the girl on the left, really make this a nice image.</td>', 'Nice capture.  The expressions on the crowd, particularly the girl on the left, really make this a nice image.', '2007-02-21 20:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391590, 470058, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice eye ... I like how both of your subjects, as well as the singer on the poster in the background, are all looking off to the left.  Adds an air of mystery to the occasion.</td>', 'Nice eye ... I like how both of your subjects, as well as the singer on the poster in the background, are all looking off to the left.  Adds an air of mystery to the occasion.', '2007-02-21 20:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391594, 469369, 2158, '<td valign="top">Great one.  I like the different approach you have used by making the bench the centre of attention.  The title enhances the image too.</td>', 'Great one.  I like the different approach you have used by making the bench the centre of attention.  The title enhances the image too.', '2007-02-21 20:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391597, 471485, 70270, '<td valign="top">What a great street scene; the guitar man is fabulous, and putting him in the middle of the street scene really makes this picture as it gives context to the image, much more than a close up on him alone would have done.  The barely hidden guy in the background slyly watching him walk by is priceless.</td>', 'What a great street scene; the guitar man is fabulous, and putting him in the middle of the street scene really makes this picture as it gives context to the image, much more than a close up on him alone would have done.  The barely hidden guy in the background slyly watching him walk by is priceless.', '2007-02-21 20:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391601, 470195, 70270, '<td valign="top">Great stolen moment. The movement of her hand, the expressions on their faces, the half drunk beer all draw the viewer into this image. I like the processing on this one, too.</td>', 'Great stolen moment. The movement of her hand, the expressions on their faces, the half drunk beer all draw the viewer into this image. I like the processing on this one, too.', '2007-02-21 20:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391636, 469979, 70270, '<td valign="top">This is one of those rare shots where the back of the head shot actually works,  since the point is the complementary colors in the people and the mural.  Nice found moment.</td>', 'This is one of those rare shots where the back of the head shot actually works,  since the point is the complementary colors in the people and the mural.  Nice found moment.', '2007-02-21 20:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391638, 471207, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and subject.  Who are these gentlemen and where are they going?  Background isn''t the greatest (tho I like the brick street), but in street photography you don''t always get to pick your spot!</td>', 'Nice composition and subject.  Who are these gentlemen and where are they going?  Background isn''t the greatest (tho I like the brick street), but in street photography you don''t always get to pick your spot!', '2007-02-21 20:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391641, 470312, 70270, '<td valign="top">The body language on your subjects make this image.  They are both slumped a bit, watching the ocean, close but not touching.  What are they thinking as they look out at the waves and watch the ship steam by?  Nice use of desat too.</td>', 'The body language on your subjects make this image.  They are both slumped a bit, watching the ocean, close but not touching.  What are they thinking as they look out at the waves and watch the ship steam by?  Nice use of desat too.', '2007-02-21 20:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391747, 470538, 13688, '<td valign="top">perhaps there is more to this than i''m catching on, but your main subject doesn''t seem nearly as interesting as the guy on the beach staring oddly at the bizarre objects.  so i''m wondering why the perspective wasn''t flipped and the message itself wasn''t more completely visible.</td>', 'perhaps there is more to this than i''m catching on, but your main subject doesn''t seem nearly as interesting as the guy on the beach staring oddly at the bizarre objects.  so i''m wondering why the perspective wasn''t flipped and the message itself wasn''t more completely visible.', '2007-02-21 21:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391756, 471498, 13688, '<td valign="top">so i realize it''s asking for a bit much, but for this to really work for me i need a stronger dichotomy.  Like another group of workers wearing red.  all in all, still a good grab</td>', 'so i realize it''s asking for a bit much, but for this to really work for me i need a stronger dichotomy.  Like another group of workers wearing red.  all in all, still a good grab', '2007-02-21 21:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391804, 468000, 24991, '<td valign="top">Did you shoot this with an IR converted camera?  The sky looks IR but the trees don''t, so I''m confused.  Either way, it''s a great shot, well done.</td>', 'Did you shoot this with an IR converted camera?  The sky looks IR but the trees don''t, so I''m confused.  Either way, it''s a great shot, well done.', '2007-02-21 21:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391805, 471520, 13688, '<td valign="top">snow is grey instead of white.  entire photo is rather flat.  street photography for me challenges the viewer.  sorry, but this photo doesn''t hold my interest.</td>', 'snow is grey instead of white.  entire photo is rather flat.  street photography for me challenges the viewer.  sorry, but this photo doesn''t hold my interest.', '2007-02-21 21:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391813, 470475, 37444, '<td valign="top">Everything about this shot is perfect! 10</td>', 'Everything about this shot is perfect! 10', '2007-02-21 21:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391814, 471207, 37444, '<td valign="top">This made me laugh - 9</td>', 'This made me laugh - 9', '2007-02-21 21:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391816, 470651, 37444, '<td valign="top">cool capture - 9</td>', 'cool capture - 9', '2007-02-21 21:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391817, 471166, 13688, '<td valign="top">i understand the concept of interest in the mundane, but there has to be some oddity to hold the viewer.  why did you choose this subject over any other you shot that day?</td>', 'i understand the concept of interest in the mundane, but there has to be some oddity to hold the viewer.  why did you choose this subject over any other you shot that day?', '2007-02-21 21:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391818, 471158, 37444, '<td valign="top">love what you did with this - 9</td>', 'love what you did with this - 9', '2007-02-21 21:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391819, 470594, 37444, '<td valign="top">this made me laugh - 8</td>', 'this made me laugh - 8', '2007-02-21 21:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391821, 470489, 37444, '<td valign="top">this one is so sad - 10</td>', 'this one is so sad - 10', '2007-02-21 21:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391823, 470700, 37444, '<td valign="top">fantastic B&amp;W - 10</td>', 'fantastic B&W - 10', '2007-02-21 21:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391827, 471522, 37444, '<td valign="top">LOL - 8</td>', 'LOL - 8', '2007-02-21 22:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391829, 471403, 37444, '<td valign="top">fantastic comp - 9</td>', 'fantastic comp - 9', '2007-02-21 22:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391830, 467728, 13688, '<td valign="top">whites seem a bit hot.  seems like an everyday street corner...not sure i understand your intent.</td>', 'whites seem a bit hot.  seems like an everyday street corner...not sure i understand your intent.', '2007-02-21 22:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391833, 470632, 37444, '<td valign="top">interesting group :) - 8</td>', 'interesting group :) - 8', '2007-02-21 22:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391835, 468975, 37444, '<td valign="top">Mmm, love those colors! - 9</td>', 'Mmm, love those colors! - 9', '2007-02-21 22:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391838, 471100, 37444, '<td valign="top">what a great face! - 9</td>', 'what a great face! - 9', '2007-02-21 22:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391839, 468711, 13688, '<td valign="top">details are a bit lost in the heavy processing.  nice to at least see a photo with some kind of message.  your composition seems very random to me, as the passing cars with distracting headlamps just happen to be there and you said oh well, rather than hanging around for another go.</td>', 'details are a bit lost in the heavy processing.  nice to at least see a photo with some kind of message.  your composition seems very random to me, as the passing cars with distracting headlamps just happen to be there and you said oh well, rather than hanging around for another go.', '2007-02-21 22:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391840, 471447, 37444, '<td valign="top">love the architecture - 9</td>', 'love the architecture - 9', '2007-02-21 22:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391844, 471160, 37444, '<td valign="top">this is great - 9</td>', 'this is great - 9', '2007-02-21 22:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391848, 471215, 37444, '<td valign="top">Hackettstown - in Jersey? I don''t get the title, but I like the shot - 8</td>', 'Hackettstown - in Jersey? I don''t get the title, but I like the shot - 8', '2007-02-21 22:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391851, 470584, 13688, '<td valign="top">i find it funny how even the pigeons have turned their back on jack marvin...poor jack.  dark areas seem a bit overprocessed as you tried to salvage the details</td>', 'i find it funny how even the pigeons have turned their back on jack marvin...poor jack.  dark areas seem a bit overprocessed as you tried to salvage the details', '2007-02-21 22:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391856, 471256, 37444, '<td valign="top">what a lovely portrait - 10</td>', 'what a lovely portrait - 10', '2007-02-21 22:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391858, 471323, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice find.  i thought street photography was supposed to make you chuckle...this is one of the few i''ve seen that does.</td>', 'nice find.  i thought street photography was supposed to make you chuckle...this is one of the few i''ve seen that does.', '2007-02-21 22:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391863, 471180, 37444, '<td valign="top">great comp and idea - 10</td>', 'great comp and idea - 10', '2007-02-21 22:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391864, 470584, 37444, '<td valign="top">great portrait - 10</td>', 'great portrait - 10', '2007-02-21 22:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391869, 471256, 13688, '<td valign="top">i understand that this was taken in the street...but it completely focuses on the woman.  street photography to me needs to have at least 2 elements to juxtapose against each other.  nice job bringing back her face from the shadow.</td>', 'i understand that this was taken in the street...but it completely focuses on the woman.  street photography to me needs to have at least 2 elements to juxtapose against each other.  nice job bringing back her face from the shadow.', '2007-02-21 22:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391870, 469974, 37444, '<td valign="top">lovely post processing - 10</td>', 'lovely post processing - 10', '2007-02-21 22:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391874, 470647, 37444, '<td valign="top">cool portrait - 9</td>', 'cool portrait - 9', '2007-02-21 22:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391875, 471216, 37444, '<td valign="top">love the color in this - 9</td>', 'love the color in this - 9', '2007-02-21 22:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391876, 470317, 37444, '<td valign="top">nice effect - 9</td>', 'nice effect - 9', '2007-02-21 22:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391881, 471516, 37444, '<td valign="top">great photo - 10</td>', 'great photo - 10', '2007-02-21 22:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391882, 469962, 13688, '<td valign="top">i like you''ve captured him looking up from his book...like he''s about ready to pounce  on an elderly woman trying to sneak in the back door to fill her perscription</td>', 'i like you''ve captured him looking up from his book...like he''s about ready to pounce  on an elderly woman trying to sneak in the back door to fill her perscription', '2007-02-21 22:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391887, 470698, 13688, '<td valign="top">this isn''t as interesting to me as someone coming from the other direction, peering around the corner, afraid for his life to continue.  perhaps you were waiting for the better pic, but it didn''t come?</td>', 'this isn''t as interesting to me as someone coming from the other direction, peering around the corner, afraid for his life to continue.  perhaps you were waiting for the better pic, but it didn''t come?', '2007-02-21 22:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391888, 470842, 37444, '<td valign="top">great capture - 9</td>', 'great capture - 9', '2007-02-21 22:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391893, 470725, 37444, '<td valign="top">great capture - `10</td>', 'great capture - `10', '2007-02-21 22:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391894, 471028, 37444, '<td valign="top">yes it is - 10</td>', 'yes it is - 10', '2007-02-21 22:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391895, 471134, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice photo.  like how the basket and roof tilt with her.  grass in front is kind of distracting.</td>', 'nice photo.  like how the basket and roof tilt with her.  grass in front is kind of distracting.', '2007-02-21 22:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391899, 470153, 37444, '<td valign="top">great everything - 10</td>', 'great everything - 10', '2007-02-21 22:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391903, 470625, 37444, '<td valign="top">this is timeless - 10</td>', 'this is timeless - 10', '2007-02-21 22:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391904, 470963, 37444, '<td valign="top">nice portrait - 9</td>', 'nice portrait - 9', '2007-02-21 22:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391905, 471101, 37444, '<td valign="top">awww - 10</td>', 'awww - 10', '2007-02-21 22:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391908, 470969, 37444, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot - 9</td>', 'I really like this shot - 9', '2007-02-21 22:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391910, 471237, 37444, '<td valign="top">you have captured wonderful emotion here - 10</td>', 'you have captured wonderful emotion here - 10', '2007-02-21 22:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391914, 471521, 37444, '<td valign="top">love that wall - 8</td>', 'love that wall - 8', '2007-02-21 22:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391915, 470869, 37444, '<td valign="top">just perfect - 10</td>', 'just perfect - 10', '2007-02-21 22:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391943, 471143, 13688, '<td valign="top">i like this.  the dichotomy of the 2 forms is very appealing to me.</td>', 'i like this.  the dichotomy of the 2 forms is very appealing to me.', '2007-02-21 22:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391958, 471470, 13688, '<td valign="top">with everything going on in chinatown...the paper fireworks erupting, faces lighting up, people pushing around each other and vendors hocking their wares, this seems a strange choice of subject for this challenge.</td>', 'with everything going on in chinatown...the paper fireworks erupting, faces lighting up, people pushing around each other and vendors hocking their wares, this seems a strange choice of subject for this challenge.', '2007-02-21 22:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391969, 471337, 13688, '<td valign="top">cool shot.  wish you had waited for them to get a bit closer to you, so we could become more attached to them individually.</td>', 'cool shot.  wish you had waited for them to get a bit closer to you, so we could become more attached to them individually.', '2007-02-21 22:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3392017, 471403, 13688, '<td valign="top">cool lighting.  composition reminds me of the kertesz shot with the guy carrying the wrapped painting.  totally different vibe here, but very interesting.</td>', 'cool lighting.  composition reminds me of the kertesz shot with the guy carrying the wrapped painting.  totally different vibe here, but very interesting.', '2007-02-21 22:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3392025, 471454, 13688, '<td valign="top">feel good shot in a gritty kind of way.  nice lighting.</td>', 'feel good shot in a gritty kind of way.  nice lighting.', '2007-02-21 22:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3392031, 471218, 13688, '<td valign="top">you''ve captured well his distaste for being photographed</td>', 'you''ve captured well his distaste for being photographed', '2007-02-21 23:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3392051, 471328, 13688, '<td valign="top">perhaps you should concentrate on taking pictures stationary before you through driving a vehicle into the mix ;)  seems like you were just too late or too early on this one.  exposure could use some work as well.</td>', 'perhaps you should concentrate on taking pictures stationary before you through driving a vehicle into the mix ;)  seems like you were just too late or too early on this one.  exposure could use some work as well.', '2007-02-21 23:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3392058, 470257, 13688, '<td valign="top">interesting.  including the pole makes the composition seem unconsidered to me.</td>', 'interesting.  including the pole makes the composition seem unconsidered to me.', '2007-02-21 23:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3392060, 471204, 33947, '<td valign="top">Great expressions, and such wonderful detail, sharpness and contrast. Nice capture. 10</td>', 'Great expressions, and such wonderful detail, sharpness and contrast. Nice capture. 10', '2007-02-21 23:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3392061, 471240, 4767, '<td valign="top">interesting processing - would love to see the original image.</td>', 'interesting processing - would love to see the original image.', '2007-02-21 23:10:04.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3392066, 471317, 33947, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shadows, light and vivid color. Almost looks surreal. Love it. 10</td>', 'Wonderful shadows, light and vivid color. Almost looks surreal. Love it. 10', '2007-02-21 23:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3392069, 471447, 33947, '<td valign="top">Like the lighting and mood of this. Nice composition. 10</td>', 'Like the lighting and mood of this. Nice composition. 10', '2007-02-21 23:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3392072, 470779, 13688, '<td valign="top">i don''t equate norman rockwell with street photography, but i do like the processing on this.  the water bottle, though rather prevalent, doesn''t seem to have a useful place in the image</td>', 'i don''t equate norman rockwell with street photography, but i do like the processing on this.  the water bottle, though rather prevalent, doesn''t seem to have a useful place in the image', '2007-02-21 23:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3392086, 471505, 13688, '<td valign="top">i''ll give you that this photograph is more likely, more interesting than whatever these guys were trying to capture.</td>', 'i''ll give you that this photograph is more likely, more interesting than whatever these guys were trying to capture.', '2007-02-21 23:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3392108, 469759, 13688, '<td valign="top">like the composition.  like the processing.  from your title, i gather you had trouble as well moving this from more than just an interesting group of objects  to an image with that "aha" factor.  still good.</td>', 'like the composition.  like the processing.  from your title, i gather you had trouble as well moving this from more than just an interesting group of objects  to an image with that "aha" factor.  still good.', '2007-02-21 23:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3392124, 471517, 13688, '<td valign="top">interesting shapes. i like the stride you have caught as it mimics the pipe and railing, though i wish it was in the space between the window and the pipe.  i think extra saturation would help, as the whole scene feels lifeless to me.</td>', 'interesting shapes. i like the stride you have caught as it mimics the pipe and railing, though i wish it was in the space between the window and the pipe.  i think extra saturation would help, as the whole scene feels lifeless to me.', '2007-02-21 23:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3392129, 470265, 13688, '<td valign="top">the closeness of their hands is odd to me.  perhaps their sharing, but it makes me feel a bit funny inside, i suppose any reaction is a good reaction.  the processing and composition are pretty bizarre though.</td>', 'the closeness of their hands is odd to me.  perhaps their sharing, but it makes me feel a bit funny inside, i suppose any reaction is a good reaction.  the processing and composition are pretty bizarre though.', '2007-02-21 23:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3392130, 470722, 4767, '<td valign="top">Cartier-Bresson or Doisneau''s <i>Kiss at the Hotel de ville</i> or possibly Eisenstadt''s famous vj day image, <i>Sailor Kissing Nurse</i>?</td>', 'Cartier-Bresson or Doisneau''s Kiss at the Hotel de ville or possibly Eisenstadt''s famous vj day image, Sailor Kissing Nurse?', '2007-02-21 23:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3392184, 471487, 13688, '<td valign="top">interesting angle</td>', 'interesting angle', '2007-02-21 23:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3392189, 471483, 13688, '<td valign="top">odd.  compositionally, he blends in a bit with that pole.</td>', 'odd.  compositionally, he blends in a bit with that pole.', '2007-02-21 23:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3392193, 469787, 13688, '<td valign="top">interesting lighting.  i like how her face''s profile mimics the torn sticker on the magazine box.  the plastic bag continues the theme.</td>', 'interesting lighting.  i like how her face''s profile mimics the torn sticker on the magazine box.  the plastic bag continues the theme.', '2007-02-21 23:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3392238, 471259, 13688, '<td valign="top">strong image.  i''m torn by the tree and it''s possible use in the composition.  it does section off the 2 most interesting pieces the man and the sign, but it does pretty much overtake the photo.</td>', 'strong image.  i''m torn by the tree and it''s possible use in the composition.  it does section off the 2 most interesting pieces the man and the sign, but it does pretty much overtake the photo.', '2007-02-22 00:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3392339, 469787, 74542, '<td valign="top">Absolutely wonderful, lots of great things going on with light in this picture.<br/> <br/>Daniel.</td>', 'Absolutely wonderful, lots of great things going on with light in this picture. Daniel.', '2007-02-22 00:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3392343, 471509, 74542, '<td valign="top">Looks great, but looks like the camera shook a bit maybe? A tripod will make this picture an 8. Good job!</td>', 'Looks great, but looks like the camera shook a bit maybe? A tripod will make this picture an 8. Good job!', '2007-02-22 00:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3392347, 470584, 74542, '<td valign="top">You definitely captured a very lonely feeling emanating from this man. Very nice!<br/> <br/>Daniel.</td>', 'You definitely captured a very lonely feeling emanating from this man. Very nice! Daniel.', '2007-02-22 00:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3392351, 471324, 74542, '<td valign="top">I think in the future I would try to concentrate more on the street or the skyline. When you try to do both like this, it''s hard for the viewer to figure out which you subject is supposed to be.<br/> <br/>Daniel.</td>', 'I think in the future I would try to concentrate more on the street or the skyline. When you try to do both like this, it''s hard for the viewer to figure out which you subject is supposed to be. Daniel.', '2007-02-22 00:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3392360, 471062, 74542, '<td valign="top">Perfect, except the white look a little washed out, i.e. the crack between the doors disappears sometimes and you can''t tell the separation between the man''s hat and the door. Great shot though.<br/> <br/>Daniel.</td>', 'Perfect, except the white look a little washed out, i.e. the crack between the doors disappears sometimes and you can''t tell the separation between the man''s hat and the door. Great shot though. Daniel.', '2007-02-22 00:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3392364, 471155, 74542, '<td valign="top">The lines lead the eye wonderfully, but nothing really appears to be in focus as the subject, at least for me. I can see the person''s jacket is almost in focus, but still not quite. A cool shot though.<br/> <br/>Daniel.</td>', 'The lines lead the eye wonderfully, but nothing really appears to be in focus as the subject, at least for me. I can see the person''s jacket is almost in focus, but still not quite. A cool shot though. Daniel.', '2007-02-22 00:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3392365, 471381, 74542, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, but grainy. Good job capturing the subject''s expression though.<br/> <br/>Daniel.</td>', 'Cool shot, but grainy. Good job capturing the subject''s expression though. Daniel.', '2007-02-22 00:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3392371, 471207, 74542, '<td valign="top">The overhead and to the left angle you took this at is a bit troubling to my eye, but you did keep that column vertical, which saves it. Otherwise, very nice subjects. I personally don''t see many men in bowlers anymore, so it''s quite a find!<br/> <br/>Daniel.</td>', 'The overhead and to the left angle you took this at is a bit troubling to my eye, but you did keep that column vertical, which saves it. Otherwise, very nice subjects. I personally don''t see many men in bowlers anymore, so it''s quite a find! Daniel.', '2007-02-22 00:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3392386, 470539, 74542, '<td valign="top">Wow. Definitely my favorite I''ve seen so far. Great lights. Great subject expressions. It''s not letting me vote, but if I could, you''d have a 10 from me!<br/> <br/>Daniel.</td>', 'Wow. Definitely my favorite I''ve seen so far. Great lights. Great subject expressions. It''s not letting me vote, but if I could, you''d have a 10 from me! Daniel.', '2007-02-22 00:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3392387, 470722, 74542, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I like how you can tell they''re just average people. He doesn''t look comfortable. She doesn''t look comfortable. Her shirt''s pulling up to reveal a stomach that''s developing into a gut. It''s great to see average, everyday people in love. Wonderful. I dig it.<br/> <br/>Daniel.</td>', 'Great shot. I like how you can tell they''re just average people. He doesn''t look comfortable. She doesn''t look comfortable. Her shirt''s pulling up to reveal a stomach that''s developing into a gut. It''s great to see average, everyday people in love. Wonderful. I dig it. Daniel.', '2007-02-22 00:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
