(3392610, 471487, 26669, '<td valign="top">i just don''t think this works, I have been looking at this for a few minutes and as a street photography for me its just not right. <br/> <br/>There is too much empty space in the lower 3rd, the subject has been cropped from the right, missing the remainder of the coat and this also seems a little blown out. <br/> <br/>The overall feeling i get is that you were uncomfortable taking this shot, this due to the angle the shot was taken. <br/> <br/>For me this falls into "homeless people = street photography"  Keep trying and explore outside of this myth. <br/>Marking down one point.</td>', 'i just don''t think this works, I have been looking at this for a few minutes and as a street photography for me its just not right.  There is too much empty space in the lower 3rd, the subject has been cropped from the right, missing the remainder of the coat and this also seems a little blown out.  The overall feeling i get is that you were uncomfortable taking this shot, this due to the angle the shot was taken.  For me this falls into "homeless people = street photography"  Keep trying and explore outside of this myth. Marking down one point.', '2007-02-22 03:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3392620, 471451, 26669, '<td valign="top">sorry i am going to bump down for the following reason.<br/>I think other than this being a street there is little to connect this with "street photography"  I have mentioned on a few comments already that i think street photography should relate a story. This really has no story at all. also there is no point of interest, nothing to draw me into the scene. <br/> <br/>Please keep trying as street photography is great once you get what it is about.</td>', 'sorry i am going to bump down for the following reason.I think other than this being a street there is little to connect this with "street photography"  I have mentioned on a few comments already that i think street photography should relate a story. This really has no story at all. also there is no point of interest, nothing to draw me into the scene.  Please keep trying as street photography is great once you get what it is about.', '2007-02-22 03:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
