(3392627, 470429, 26669, '<td valign="top">ok, i am coming back to comment on as many as possible, i think the subject is not prominent enough in the shot. I got lost looking for her. also i don''t think there is enough of a crowed for the title. the girl with the baby on the left is also a distraction i feel.<br/> <br/>Nice effort but try getting a lot closer to the subject next time. If the old girl was stationary for a while with blurs of people around then this would have worked a lot better.</td>', 'ok, i am coming back to comment on as many as possible, i think the subject is not prominent enough in the shot. I got lost looking for her. also i don''t think there is enough of a crowed for the title. the girl with the baby on the left is also a distraction i feel. Nice effort but try getting a lot closer to the subject next time. If the old girl was stationary for a while with blurs of people around then this would have worked a lot better.', '2007-02-22 03:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
