(3393301, 471440, 26669, '<td valign="top">sorry but i don''t think this is a "Street " shot other than it was shot on a street somewhere, Again i come back to the story in a street shot, street has to have a story, some connection. Please have a look and people like Juan Buhler(SP?)  and try again. Dont take offense, i don''t want that but i think people take a photo on a street with someone in it and think "By George thats a street photo shot"</td>', 'sorry but i don''t think this is a "Street " shot other than it was shot on a street somewhere, Again i come back to the story in a street shot, street has to have a story, some connection. Please have a look and people like Juan Buhler(SP?)  and try again. Dont take offense, i don''t want that but i think people take a photo on a street with someone in it and think "By George thats a street photo shot"', '2007-02-22 10:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
