(3395575, 471407, 93, '<td valign="top">Focus definitely grabbed the wrong subject here.. hitting on the background. Also, just a little too much going on here, composition isn''t extremely strong, having no real point of interest.... etc. etc. etc.<br/> <br/>Make sure in the future that your camera''s focus selector is either on center, or if you can only use multi-point, that it is grabbing the correct subject.  Get in closer when you can, isolate your subject more, and give us.. the viewer.. something we can get interested in.<br/> <br/>A very minor point as well..  that title method is a little distracting.</td>', 'Focus definitely grabbed the wrong subject here.. hitting on the background. Also, just a little too much going on here, composition isn''t extremely strong, having no real point of interest.... etc. etc. etc. Make sure in the future that your camera''s focus selector is either on center, or if you can only use multi-point, that it is grabbing the correct subject.  Get in closer when you can, isolate your subject more, and give us.. the viewer.. something we can get interested in. A very minor point as well..  that title method is a little distracting.', '2007-02-22 22:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395579, 470899, 93, '<td valign="top">A little too much background here I think.</td>', 'A little too much background here I think.', '2007-02-22 22:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395584, 470538, 93, '<td valign="top">A touch over-sharpened. I don''t know if it was to try and make up for a bit of mis-focus or camera-shakiness, but the artifacting detracts.</td>', 'A touch over-sharpened. I don''t know if it was to try and make up for a bit of mis-focus or camera-shakiness, but the artifacting detracts.', '2007-02-22 22:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395589, 471468, 93, '<td valign="top">A nice old-time feel..  curse modern vehicles eh?  Especially the Dodge Turbo.. PETE I hate those ugly things.  2.<br/> <br/> <br/>(just kidding.. hehe) The background does hurt this shot, however.. even if there probably wasn''t that much you could do about it.</td>', 'A nice old-time feel..  curse modern vehicles eh?  Especially the Dodge Turbo.. PETE I hate those ugly things.  2.  (just kidding.. hehe) The background does hurt this shot, however.. even if there probably wasn''t that much you could do about it.', '2007-02-22 22:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395591, 471447, 93, '<td valign="top">A nice minimalistic work here.  Whatever you did to brighten up the human subject is a *mite* too strong, but works nonetheless... although there are some weird goings on in the background.. but that might just be the walls themselves.</td>', 'A nice minimalistic work here.  Whatever you did to brighten up the human subject is a *mite* too strong, but works nonetheless... although there are some weird goings on in the background.. but that might just be the walls themselves.', '2007-02-22 22:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395595, 471381, 93, '<td valign="top">Has potential, but a real lack of contrast and sharpness hurts this shot.  The crop is a little too close on the subject as well.. like he''s falling out of the frame.</td>', 'Has potential, but a real lack of contrast and sharpness hurts this shot.  The crop is a little too close on the subject as well.. like he''s falling out of the frame.', '2007-02-22 22:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
