(3397137, 470871, 68725, '<td valign="top">:)  looks like he''s begging for forgiveness</td>', ':)  looks like he''s begging for forgiveness', '2007-02-23 09:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397169, 470429, 66201, '<td valign="top">I really like this image. I just think your conversion to B+W is a bit dark...the skin on the people is generally rather greyish. I like the centrally focused character who is the main "character" in this little street drama.</td>', 'I really like this image. I just think your conversion to B+W is a bit dark...the skin on the people is generally rather greyish. I like the centrally focused character who is the main "character" in this little street drama.', '2007-02-23 09:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397181, 471106, 66201, '<td valign="top">Love the movement of this in terms of the almost "fish eye" effect (must be the curved building and the slightly angled camera). the partial desat is also intriguing (used it in my shot and it''s being met with a general disdain). Your use of the desat red on the central figure really brings him out as your main character and the eye wants to follow him up the road as if he were actually moving. I like  the way that as my eye moves off him up the road it is arrested by the old man and his walking stick and the mental wondering continues.</td>', 'Love the movement of this in terms of the almost "fish eye" effect (must be the curved building and the slightly angled camera). the partial desat is also intriguing (used it in my shot and it''s being met with a general disdain). Your use of the desat red on the central figure really brings him out as your main character and the eye wants to follow him up the road as if he were actually moving. I like  the way that as my eye moves off him up the road it is arrested by the old man and his walking stick and the mental wondering continues.', '2007-02-23 09:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397184, 468289, 66201, '<td valign="top">Just love this - great clarity and subjects. Really good conversion to B+W too.</td>', 'Just love this - great clarity and subjects. Really good conversion to B+W too.', '2007-02-23 09:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397188, 471067, 66201, '<td valign="top">Great patina, angle, location and all that. Nice conversion to B+W too. 8</td>', 'Great patina, angle, location and all that. Nice conversion to B+W too. 8', '2007-02-23 09:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397191, 470332, 66201, '<td valign="top">I would have really liked the guy on the pavement to be looking down this way... just for heightened interest level. Great conversion to B+W with nice contrasts.</td>', 'I would have really liked the guy on the pavement to be looking down this way... just for heightened interest level. Great conversion to B+W with nice contrasts.', '2007-02-23 09:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
