(3397796, 468315, 42495, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  The gaze on her face compared to the guy behind her adds so much.  One of the best jobs of selective desat I''ve seen on here.</td>', 'I really like this.  The gaze on her face compared to the guy behind her adds so much.  One of the best jobs of selective desat I''ve seen on here.', '2007-02-23 12:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
