(3397813, 470161, 42495, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting picture, with the way they''re surrounding the vehicle.    It makes me linger, trying to figure out what''s going on.  Good job on the B&amp;W.</td>', 'This is an interesting picture, with the way they''re surrounding the vehicle.    It makes me linger, trying to figure out what''s going on.  Good job on the B&W.', '2007-02-23 12:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397816, 471382, 42495, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, but a bit oversharpened.</td>', 'Nice capture, but a bit oversharpened.', '2007-02-23 12:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397963, 471463, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice portrait.  very good tones for b/w.  i could do without the other people and their car.  not really what i was looking for in a "cartier-bresson like" image.</td>', 'nice portrait.  very good tones for b/w.  i could do without the other people and their car.  not really what i was looking for in a "cartier-bresson like" image.', '2007-02-23 13:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397977, 471410, 13688, '<td valign="top">curious image.  fits in the challenge better than 90% of those I''ve seen so far.  wish it had more of a message than just lunch.  the areas i like are the bandaid on the pole, her expression, the umbrella, and the 2 cutouts...though it is interesting how the 2 girls mimic the cutouts, it feels too busy with them for me.  so anyway, this image with just those components would have blown me away....though i''m still not sure what it would have meant.</td>', 'curious image.  fits in the challenge better than 90% of those I''ve seen so far.  wish it had more of a message than just lunch.  the areas i like are the bandaid on the pole, her expression, the umbrella, and the 2 cutouts...though it is interesting how the 2 girls mimic the cutouts, it feels too busy with them for me.  so anyway, this image with just those components would have blown me away....though i''m still not sure what it would have meant.', '2007-02-23 13:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397991, 471260, 13688, '<td valign="top">good capture of emotion.  i just feel this images needs to have another counterpoint to the couple.  something to make me go...wow.  like if the restaurant was called "Break Point".  the conversion to b/w feels forced to me, like you did it because you thought you needed to submit in that format.</td>', 'good capture of emotion.  i just feel this images needs to have another counterpoint to the couple.  something to make me go...wow.  like if the restaurant was called "Break Point".  the conversion to b/w feels forced to me, like you did it because you thought you needed to submit in that format.', '2007-02-23 13:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397993, 470332, 13688, '<td valign="top">really like the processing on this.  wish the path ended in just bright light instead of the vehicle.</td>', 'really like the processing on this.  wish the path ended in just bright light instead of the vehicle.', '2007-02-23 13:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398006, 470967, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice exposure and focus.  as far as "street"...the woman looks confused as to what is going on which is a good start, but i don''t see how it fits into an overall story for the image.  compositionally the character on the left being cutoff feels awkward.  so if your point was to just photograph a rally you should have better framed the "join the fight", if your point is deeper, i''m sorry i don''t see it.</td>', 'nice exposure and focus.  as far as "street"...the woman looks confused as to what is going on which is a good start, but i don''t see how it fits into an overall story for the image.  compositionally the character on the left being cutoff feels awkward.  so if your point was to just photograph a rally you should have better framed the "join the fight", if your point is deeper, i''m sorry i don''t see it.', '2007-02-23 13:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398018, 470830, 13688, '<td valign="top">interesting image.  like the red balance and how the tree splits things while conforming to the man''s shape.  the 2 reds being pushed to the very edges of the composition makes things a bit uncomforable for me.  still, a good on-topic image.</td>', 'interesting image.  like the red balance and how the tree splits things while conforming to the man''s shape.  the 2 reds being pushed to the very edges of the composition makes things a bit uncomforable for me.  still, a good on-topic image.', '2007-02-23 13:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398024, 467690, 13688, '<td valign="top">interesting tones.  i''m saying this alot in my comments, but i wish your subject had a counterpoint that developed the story more.  the composition with the cut off man and over conspicuous bus seems a bit forced, and i might have waited for another few seconds or another subject if time didn''t permit that.</td>', 'interesting tones.  i''m saying this alot in my comments, but i wish your subject had a counterpoint that developed the story more.  the composition with the cut off man and over conspicuous bus seems a bit forced, and i might have waited for another few seconds or another subject if time didn''t permit that.', '2007-02-23 13:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398039, 471363, 13688, '<td valign="top">i understand the concept of photography of things "street-like", but i believe the challenge was looking for something a bit deeper.  your composition is interesting with the colors and shapes, but i feel it borders on stealing other''s art...of course you could probably say that about photographing anything man-made, so nice angle on the colors.</td>', 'i understand the concept of photography of things "street-like", but i believe the challenge was looking for something a bit deeper.  your composition is interesting with the colors and shapes, but i feel it borders on stealing other''s art...of course you could probably say that about photographing anything man-made, so nice angle on the colors.', '2007-02-23 13:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398044, 471439, 66193, '<td valign="top">very poignant.  I don''t like the border, as I find it distracting. but the photo itself is very well done.</td>', 'very poignant.  I don''t like the border, as I find it distracting. but the photo itself is very well done.', '2007-02-23 13:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398046, 467632, 13688, '<td valign="top">very interesting lighting and story.  i''m willing to bet voters aren''t taking any time to enjoy this image</td>', 'very interesting lighting and story.  i''m willing to bet voters aren''t taking any time to enjoy this image', '2007-02-23 13:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398048, 470888, 66193, '<td valign="top">a little heavy-handed on the dodge/burn for my taste.  I wish there had been more of the food visible.  would have helped with the context.  nice shot overall.</td>', 'a little heavy-handed on the dodge/burn for my taste.  I wish there had been more of the food visible.  would have helped with the context.  nice shot overall.', '2007-02-23 13:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398054, 471485, 66193, '<td valign="top">A different crop would have helped here.  The out of focus man facing the other way is less distracting that the in focus people to the left of the frame.</td>', 'A different crop would have helped here.  The out of focus man facing the other way is less distracting that the in focus people to the left of the frame.', '2007-02-23 13:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398056, 471378, 13688, '<td valign="top">is kind of funny how he''s sleeping.  the photo overall is a bit flat and lacks the punch to pull him out of the background (which doesn''t seem to be directly effecting him in a useful way), the way i would really like</td>', 'is kind of funny how he''s sleeping.  the photo overall is a bit flat and lacks the punch to pull him out of the background (which doesn''t seem to be directly effecting him in a useful way), the way i would really like', '2007-02-23 13:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398059, 470565, 66193, '<td valign="top">I don''t care too much for the selective color. seems forced and without purpose.</td>', 'I don''t care too much for the selective color. seems forced and without purpose.', '2007-02-23 13:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398065, 470940, 66193, '<td valign="top">technically, very well done.  as for street photography, it''s a little too close in (at least IMO).  Maybe if her expression was different (angry at your presence for an example) it would''ve worked.</td>', 'technically, very well done.  as for street photography, it''s a little too close in (at least IMO).  Maybe if her expression was different (angry at your presence for an example) it would''ve worked.', '2007-02-23 13:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398069, 470195, 66193, '<td valign="top">processing doesn''t fit the style IMO.</td>', 'processing doesn''t fit the style IMO.', '2007-02-23 13:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398072, 470943, 66193, '<td valign="top">I like the partial desat on this one.  even though I can''t see the boys'' faces, I can feel the emotion.</td>', 'I like the partial desat on this one.  even though I can''t see the boys'' faces, I can feel the emotion.', '2007-02-23 13:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398074, 470888, 13688, '<td valign="top">interesting lighting.  really like how the smoke is encircling him.  as far as street-like, his environment of just the grill doesn''t feel global enough to me to really fit the category.  still feels more like just a portrait.  still a nice image</td>', 'interesting lighting.  really like how the smoke is encircling him.  as far as street-like, his environment of just the grill doesn''t feel global enough to me to really fit the category.  still feels more like just a portrait.  still a nice image', '2007-02-23 13:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398080, 469759, 66193, '<td valign="top">like the irony that you captured.  would have been better if the cell-phone user were dressed in a business suit.  ultimate irony would have been the pay phone user in a business suit and the cell phone guy in dirty rags.  judicious use of dodge/burn here.  well done</td>', 'like the irony that you captured.  would have been better if the cell-phone user were dressed in a business suit.  ultimate irony would have been the pay phone user in a business suit and the cell phone guy in dirty rags.  judicious use of dodge/burn here.  well done', '2007-02-23 13:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398082, 471052, 66193, '<td valign="top">the burned-in lamp on the car is very subtle.  almost missed it.  well done.</td>', 'the burned-in lamp on the car is very subtle.  almost missed it.  well done.', '2007-02-23 13:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398086, 471101, 13688, '<td valign="top">i like how the 1 dog is staring at the camera, while he isn''t.  as i look through this challenge, i''m seeing tons of these images of people on the street, that still don''t convey "cartier-bresson" like imagery.  there''s just something more this image needs to take it to the next level.</td>', 'i like how the 1 dog is staring at the camera, while he isn''t.  as i look through this challenge, i''m seeing tons of these images of people on the street, that still don''t convey "cartier-bresson" like imagery.  there''s just something more this image needs to take it to the next level.', '2007-02-23 14:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398117, 471052, 13688, '<td valign="top">yes, this is the kind of image you try to describe when you try to convince other photographers in the challenge that they missed the boat.  "broken headlights"...now if only the right one was broken and the other was still intact ;)</td>', 'yes, this is the kind of image you try to describe when you try to convince other photographers in the challenge that they missed the boat.  "broken headlights"...now if only the right one was broken and the other was still intact ;)', '2007-02-23 14:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398145, 471481, 13688, '<td valign="top">i''m sorry but your''s just came after the guy with the patch, which for me so far, is the quintessential street photograph so far in this challenge.  yes you''ve photographed a street scene, and the lighting is interesting, but i need a story or some kind of interaction between parts.</td>', 'i''m sorry but your''s just came after the guy with the patch, which for me so far, is the quintessential street photograph so far in this challenge.  yes you''ve photographed a street scene, and the lighting is interesting, but i need a story or some kind of interaction between parts.', '2007-02-23 14:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398171, 468786, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice processing.  i''m not getting hopelessness from this, perhaps i''m misunderstanding your message.  actually with the new brick built around the old door way, i''m getting the feeling of a surviving while others try to stop you.</td>', 'nice processing.  i''m not getting hopelessness from this, perhaps i''m misunderstanding your message.  actually with the new brick built around the old door way, i''m getting the feeling of a surviving while others try to stop you.', '2007-02-23 14:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398173, 471477, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is a beautiful street photo.  I love it that there is a feeling of joy and festivity in this street photo.  And althought there is alot going on in the photo, it''s not the least bit distracting -- in fact, the contrasting lights and dark enhance the photo so much!  This is an awesome photo.</td>', 'Oh, this is a beautiful street photo.  I love it that there is a feeling of joy and festivity in this street photo.  And althought there is alot going on in the photo, it''s not the least bit distracting -- in fact, the contrasting lights and dark enhance the photo so much!  This is an awesome photo.', '2007-02-23 14:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398190, 470916, 13688, '<td valign="top">interesting angle, kind of hard to look at.  processing is completely flat, but perhaps that helps fuel the tipsy perception you''ve created.  not really what i would consider ''cartier-bresson'' like, but it does provide me with a rather unique feeling inside, so good job.</td>', 'interesting angle, kind of hard to look at.  processing is completely flat, but perhaps that helps fuel the tipsy perception you''ve created.  not really what i would consider ''cartier-bresson'' like, but it does provide me with a rather unique feeling inside, so good job.', '2007-02-23 14:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398199, 470747, 13688, '<td valign="top">great capture for a photojournalism challenge.</td>', 'great capture for a photojournalism challenge.', '2007-02-23 14:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398214, 470899, 69102, '<td valign="top">if you had crouched down a little lower, you might have gotten some interesting expressions from the people standing in the background.</td>', 'if you had crouched down a little lower, you might have gotten some interesting expressions from the people standing in the background.', '2007-02-23 14:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398215, 470405, 69102, '<td valign="top">i like the apparent interaction between the subjects.</td>', 'i like the apparent interaction between the subjects.', '2007-02-23 14:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398217, 471493, 66193, '<td valign="top">I love the privileged parking tag on the rearview mirror, too.  great irony here.</td>', 'I love the privileged parking tag on the rearview mirror, too.  great irony here.', '2007-02-23 14:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398219, 471523, 69102, '<td valign="top">nice capture on the expression and the snow is well handled. great mood.</td>', 'nice capture on the expression and the snow is well handled. great mood.', '2007-02-23 14:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398224, 471007, 66193, '<td valign="top">would have been better without the hydrant.  maybe could''ve burned it down a bit.  same with the hanging lights in the cafe. I love the way he''s the only patron lit up.</td>', 'would have been better without the hydrant.  maybe could''ve burned it down a bit.  same with the hanging lights in the cafe. I love the way he''s the only patron lit up.', '2007-02-23 14:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398225, 470394, 69102, '<td valign="top">interesting color contrast. closer so that the railing started off frame might have been better.</td>', 'interesting color contrast. closer so that the railing started off frame might have been better.', '2007-02-23 14:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398226, 471443, 13688, '<td valign="top">i wish i could describe how this photograph of "a guy sitting on a set of steps" says so much more to me than most of this site''s photographers interpretation of "a guy sitting on a set of steps". maybe it''s the fact that it''s well composed and the lighting is interesting, the black tie mimicing the shadow on the stairs. all makes me want search more deeply if there are even more reasons for studying this scene.</td>', 'i wish i could describe how this photograph of "a guy sitting on a set of steps" says so much more to me than most of this site''s photographers interpretation of "a guy sitting on a set of steps". maybe it''s the fact that it''s well composed and the lighting is interesting, the black tie mimicing the shadow on the stairs. all makes me want search more deeply if there are even more reasons for studying this scene.', '2007-02-23 14:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398228, 471516, 66193, '<td valign="top">love this one.</td>', 'love this one.', '2007-02-23 14:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398230, 471015, 69102, '<td valign="top">maybe, but the smiling cop in the background just next to your main subject sort of works against that interpretation. - 5</td>', 'maybe, but the smiling cop in the background just next to your main subject sort of works against that interpretation. - 5', '2007-02-23 14:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398236, 470641, 66193, '<td valign="top">like the use of negative space.  I would have cloned out the dark spots on the bottom of the wall on the right side of the frame.  maybe a more heavy hand on the vignetting, too.  but very nice image overall.  giving it an 8.</td>', 'like the use of negative space.  I would have cloned out the dark spots on the bottom of the wall on the right side of the frame.  maybe a more heavy hand on the vignetting, too.  but very nice image overall.  giving it an 8.', '2007-02-23 14:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398239, 470489, 66193, '<td valign="top">I don;t like the title, but I don''t score lower for it.  I like the contrast in the color of her shawl or sweater with the colors of the wall.</td>', 'I don;t like the title, but I don''t score lower for it.  I like the contrast in the color of her shawl or sweater with the colors of the wall.', '2007-02-23 14:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398245, 470632, 13688, '<td valign="top">your processing is interesting, though a bit over the top as you''re starting to loose quality all over the place where you''ve dodged.  segregating the 2 groups from the rest of the photo is also interesting, but i don''t feel a strong connection between them.  though the guy on the left does seem to have a vested interest in the police activities, i think his meaning needs to be a bit more overt to work.  your escaping the quotes, i assume to get them into your title, seems odd as well.</td>', 'your processing is interesting, though a bit over the top as you''re starting to loose quality all over the place where you''ve dodged.  segregating the 2 groups from the rest of the photo is also interesting, but i don''t feel a strong connection between them.  though the guy on the left does seem to have a vested interest in the police activities, i think his meaning needs to be a bit more overt to work.  your escaping the quotes, i assume to get them into your title, seems odd as well.', '2007-02-23 14:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398247, 470948, 66193, '<td valign="top">like this one a lot.  like the colors, the processing, the compo, the diagonal elements, especially the expression on that guy''s face.  even the title works well.  a little vignetting or burning of the outside edges of the image would have made it perfect. 9.</td>', 'like this one a lot.  like the colors, the processing, the compo, the diagonal elements, especially the expression on that guy''s face.  even the title works well.  a little vignetting or burning of the outside edges of the image would have made it perfect. 9.', '2007-02-23 14:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398252, 471443, 66193, '<td valign="top">like the composition here, with the shadows on a diagonal to the lines of the steps.  his placement in the frame is very good.  maybe a touch of burning on the column right above his head (it;s slightly distracting).  nice shot.</td>', 'like the composition here, with the shadows on a diagonal to the lines of the steps.  his placement in the frame is very good.  maybe a touch of burning on the column right above his head (it;s slightly distracting).  nice shot.', '2007-02-23 14:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398255, 471440, 69102, '<td valign="top">there is a lot of clutter in the frame that doesn''t add to the composition (can crop off the whole right third). subjects don''t look like they are bouncing, just that you didn''t use a fast enough shutter, and you''re not close enough to make the little bit of movement interesting.</td>', 'there is a lot of clutter in the frame that doesn''t add to the composition (can crop off the whole right third). subjects don''t look like they are bouncing, just that you didn''t use a fast enough shutter, and you''re not close enough to make the little bit of movement interesting.', '2007-02-23 14:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398258, 471324, 69102, '<td valign="top">nothing really interesting going on in the frame and the tones are very muddy and flat.</td>', 'nothing really interesting going on in the frame and the tones are very muddy and flat.', '2007-02-23 14:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398259, 471167, 69102, '<td valign="top">no much going on here.</td>', 'no much going on here.', '2007-02-23 14:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398260, 470834, 69102, '<td valign="top">you are way too far away. get closer.</td>', 'you are way too far away. get closer.', '2007-02-23 14:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398261, 470748, 69102, '<td valign="top">no central subject/action here.</td>', 'no central subject/action here.', '2007-02-23 14:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398263, 471446, 69102, '<td valign="top">like the toning, but there just isnt'' much interesting goin on here.</td>', 'like the toning, but there just isnt'' much interesting goin on here.', '2007-02-23 14:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398268, 471306, 13688, '<td valign="top">if you were looking for a strong reaction, i bet you got one.  To me you have managed to dehumanize fellow man. Not sure if that was your intent, but the title is brutal.  i believe most street photographers try to capture a scene without bias, you have failed if following the true letter of the challenge was your intent.</td>', 'if you were looking for a strong reaction, i bet you got one.  To me you have managed to dehumanize fellow man. Not sure if that was your intent, but the title is brutal.  i believe most street photographers try to capture a scene without bias, you have failed if following the true letter of the challenge was your intent.', '2007-02-23 14:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398272, 471407, 69102, '<td valign="top">way too much sky, but main problem is that the guy should be in focus with perhaps the stuff in the background slightly OOF so that he stands out. getting closer would have helped immensely as well.</td>', 'way too much sky, but main problem is that the guy should be in focus with perhaps the stuff in the background slightly OOF so that he stands out. getting closer would have helped immensely as well.', '2007-02-23 14:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398276, 471286, 69102, '<td valign="top">overexposed and very flat. i can see elements that might be points of interest, but they don''t interact with each other and so just get lost.</td>', 'overexposed and very flat. i can see elements that might be points of interest, but they don''t interact with each other and so just get lost.', '2007-02-23 14:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398277, 468316, 69102, '<td valign="top">not really anything of central interest going on here. looks like this was initially underexposed and then tried to fix in PS.</td>', 'not really anything of central interest going on here. looks like this was initially underexposed and then tried to fix in PS.', '2007-02-23 14:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398280, 470969, 69102, '<td valign="top">dog is too far away to provide a real point of interest and there really isn''t anything else going on to hold viewer''s attention. very cluttered compositionally.</td>', 'dog is too far away to provide a real point of interest and there really isn''t anything else going on to hold viewer''s attention. very cluttered compositionally.', '2007-02-23 14:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
