(3399194, 471493, 65025, '<td valign="top">wow...now that''s interesting...an old lady driving a hummer with a handicap sign.  It just seems...wierd.  cool capture.</td>', 'wow...now that''s interesting...an old lady driving a hummer with a handicap sign.  It just seems...wierd.  cool capture.', '2007-02-23 19:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399203, 471160, 65025, '<td valign="top">The first thing that comes to mind, is "how cute!" which probably isn''t what you want to hear!  But really, it''s a great photo.  I love the reactions on the faces, especially the man on the right looking at the pigeons.  It really brings a smile to my face.</td>', 'The first thing that comes to mind, is "how cute!" which probably isn''t what you want to hear!  But really, it''s a great photo.  I love the reactions on the faces, especially the man on the right looking at the pigeons.  It really brings a smile to my face.', '2007-02-23 19:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399262, 470531, 554, '<td valign="top">maybe they is takin picters</td>', 'maybe they is takin picters', '2007-02-23 20:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
