(3399538, 470963, 28029, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful photo. I usually hate these kind of borders (big and/or attention getting) but I find that it works well here. I almost get the feeling of a movie screen. Clarity, composition, DOF,tone all excellent. Love the expression. 10</td>', 'This is a wonderful photo. I usually hate these kind of borders (big and/or attention getting) but I find that it works well here. I almost get the feeling of a movie screen. Clarity, composition, DOF,tone all excellent. Love the expression. 10', '2007-02-23 21:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
