(3399592, 470869, 66597, '<td valign="top">Love this. The very essence of edgy, gritty street without resorting to a cliche.</td>', 'Love this. The very essence of edgy, gritty street without resorting to a cliche.', '2007-02-23 22:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399593, 471134, 66597, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. The expression on the woman''s face and sense of motion is wonderful.</td>', 'Beautiful. The expression on the woman''s face and sense of motion is wonderful.', '2007-02-23 22:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399596, 470948, 66597, '<td valign="top">Captures the quintessential essence of grunge street photography, yet is original. What makes this interesting is the expression on the closest guy''s face sitting on the step - despite his ''menacing'' appearance, he has an almost benevolent look, which provides a detour from the cliche. Great work.</td>', 'Captures the quintessential essence of grunge street photography, yet is original. What makes this interesting is the expression on the closest guy''s face sitting on the step - despite his ''menacing'' appearance, he has an almost benevolent look, which provides a detour from the cliche. Great work.', '2007-02-23 22:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399599, 471503, 66597, '<td valign="top">This tells a story, or at least makes the viewer very curious to know her story. There is something sinister about the surroundings, yet she looks happy. Incongruous, which is always interesting.</td>', 'This tells a story, or at least makes the viewer very curious to know her story. There is something sinister about the surroundings, yet she looks happy. Incongruous, which is always interesting.', '2007-02-23 22:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399600, 469974, 66597, '<td valign="top">Lovely post process and great job of making a street interesting sans people.</td>', 'Lovely post process and great job of making a street interesting sans people.', '2007-02-23 22:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399602, 471247, 66597, '<td valign="top">I love the size of the subject in contrast to his surroundings. One of the best entries. 8.</td>', 'I love the size of the subject in contrast to his surroundings. One of the best entries. 8.', '2007-02-23 22:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399603, 470871, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is pretty funny. In fact, it''s hilarious. I don''t know where you found a camel on the street, but you''re getting a high score just for the title alone.</td>', 'This is pretty funny. In fact, it''s hilarious. I don''t know where you found a camel on the street, but you''re getting a high score just for the title alone.', '2007-02-23 22:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
