(3399828, 470609, 13688, '<td valign="top">i''m almost afraid to comment on this photo.  i see a tremendous amount of wisdom in that youngest childs eyes.  as if  he''s already seen enough in his short life to fill a lifetime.  your focus is way off, perhaps that was intended</td>', 'i''m almost afraid to comment on this photo.  i see a tremendous amount of wisdom in that youngest childs eyes.  as if  he''s already seen enough in his short life to fill a lifetime.  your focus is way off, perhaps that was intended', '2007-02-23 23:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399833, 471350, 13688, '<td valign="top">i really like this concept.  my angle would have been further back to capture a bit more of the landscape.  that dog is really key and it''s great that it''s in the picture.  perhaps this was the perfect moment, but i see one coming that if the kids stayed by the mailbox, the dog would have gotten there and been looking up as the looked through the mail.</td>', 'i really like this concept.  my angle would have been further back to capture a bit more of the landscape.  that dog is really key and it''s great that it''s in the picture.  perhaps this was the perfect moment, but i see one coming that if the kids stayed by the mailbox, the dog would have gotten there and been looking up as the looked through the mail.', '2007-02-23 23:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399854, 471080, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice emotion captured.  i''m surprised you didn''t crop way down square to just get the couple and remove the end of the bench and the trashcan.  i don''t think you needed those objects to show "streetness"...this really isn''t a "street" type of shot anyway, because the environment seems to not be interacting with your subjects at all.</td>', 'nice emotion captured.  i''m surprised you didn''t crop way down square to just get the couple and remove the end of the bench and the trashcan.  i don''t think you needed those objects to show "streetness"...this really isn''t a "street" type of shot anyway, because the environment seems to not be interacting with your subjects at all.', '2007-02-24 00:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399872, 470831, 13688, '<td valign="top">wow that processing makes the city seem almost sterile...or else reyhjavik is just spotless ;)  very cool photo.  i wouldn''t call it street photography as suggested in the challenge description, but i''m guessing that doesn''t matter if know how to appeal to voters in a street photography challenge.</td>', 'wow that processing makes the city seem almost sterile...or else reyhjavik is just spotless ;)  very cool photo.  i wouldn''t call it street photography as suggested in the challenge description, but i''m guessing that doesn''t matter if know how to appeal to voters in a street photography challenge.', '2007-02-24 00:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399889, 469445, 13688, '<td valign="top">hmmm...i think i like "Hitting the High Notes" better.  great skin tones, unfortunately the trumpet paid the price by being blown out...pun intended ;)</td>', 'hmmm...i think i like "Hitting the High Notes" better.  great skin tones, unfortunately the trumpet paid the price by being blown out...pun intended ;)', '2007-02-24 00:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399902, 471391, 13688, '<td valign="top">damn your hip sure knows how to frame a shot, you should let him take the shots more often...just kidding :)  Actually, i would have thought walking around town using this technique might have yielded a bit more interesting angles.  this almost looks like you took it normally, perhaps that''s a good trait to have in your "hip shots"</td>', 'damn your hip sure knows how to frame a shot, you should let him take the shots more often...just kidding :)  Actually, i would have thought walking around town using this technique might have yielded a bit more interesting angles.  this almost looks like you took it normally, perhaps that''s a good trait to have in your "hip shots"', '2007-02-24 00:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399909, 471066, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice find.  they should have a show where they capture people like this,  they can say "you got just got juxxed".  Perhaps only photographers would enjoy it though, and perhaps only photographers who are scratching their heads with their photos in the 5''s right now.  No, I''m going out on a limb that everyone will enjoy this...</td>', 'nice find.  they should have a show where they capture people like this,  they can say "you got just got juxxed".  Perhaps only photographers would enjoy it though, and perhaps only photographers who are scratching their heads with their photos in the 5''s right now.  No, I''m going out on a limb that everyone will enjoy this...', '2007-02-24 00:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399916, 470594, 13688, '<td valign="top">i think this would have been funnier if i couldn''t tell so easily that it was a statue sitting 10 feet behind him.  it''s funny, but only kind of like knock,knock joke funny.</td>', 'i think this would have been funnier if i couldn''t tell so easily that it was a statue sitting 10 feet behind him.  it''s funny, but only kind of like knock,knock joke funny.', '2007-02-24 00:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
