(3402676, 471161, 66515, '<td valign="top">Interesting capture. Your border distracts from it however. A smaller border would compliment your submission better. You would also get a larger "canvas".<br/> <br/>Still worth a 6 from me however</td>', 'Interesting capture. Your border distracts from it however. A smaller border would compliment your submission better. You would also get a larger "canvas". Still worth a 6 from me however', '2007-02-25 01:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402677, 471467, 66515, '<td valign="top">Nice capture but its doesn''t say street to me. It actually says "inside a book store" to me.</td>', 'Nice capture but its doesn''t say street to me. It actually says "inside a book store" to me.', '2007-02-25 02:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402679, 471344, 66515, '<td valign="top">Interesting capture. It needs something else though. Its just not enough to stand on its own. It needs another element to support it. People maybe?</td>', 'Interesting capture. It needs something else though. Its just not enough to stand on its own. It needs another element to support it. People maybe?', '2007-02-25 02:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402681, 468000, 66515, '<td valign="top">Wow...I love the contrast here. Great looking clouds!</td>', 'Wow...I love the contrast here. Great looking clouds!', '2007-02-25 02:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402689, 471096, 66515, '<td valign="top">To be honest the title kinda kills this for me. This looks like it has an interesting story. A story that doesn''t involve the British Invasion.</td>', 'To be honest the title kinda kills this for me. This looks like it has an interesting story. A story that doesn''t involve the British Invasion.', '2007-02-25 02:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402694, 468872, 66515, '<td valign="top">Ouch...too small. Show us a PICTURE! Don''t be shy! Use the full size allowed. (640 px high in this case). Don''t rob your viewers by using a postage stamp. (Ironically stamps are often worth more than a postcard these days)<br/> <br/>Anyways... size aside. Nice capture with the frost and the snow. A larger picture would show more detail and really hammer your point home: Its friggin cold!</td>', 'Ouch...too small. Show us a PICTURE! Don''t be shy! Use the full size allowed. (640 px high in this case). Don''t rob your viewers by using a postage stamp. (Ironically stamps are often worth more than a postcard these days) Anyways... size aside. Nice capture with the frost and the snow. A larger picture would show more detail and really hammer your point home: Its friggin cold!', '2007-02-25 02:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402695, 471482, 66515, '<td valign="top">Needs a bit of straightening. Its also a bit dark in places. (Such as the dog''s face).  That asisde I like the simplicity of the shot.</td>', 'Needs a bit of straightening. Its also a bit dark in places. (Such as the dog''s face).  That asisde I like the simplicity of the shot.', '2007-02-25 02:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402699, 470751, 66515, '<td valign="top">Oog...way over processed.</td>', 'Oog...way over processed.', '2007-02-25 02:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402769, 471161, 26669, '<td valign="top">nice shot but i think a fisheye lens would work wonders here <b>Bumping up a point</b></td>', 'nice shot but i think a fisheye lens would work wonders here Bumping up a point', '2007-02-25 04:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402773, 470352, 26669, '<td valign="top">great shot, makes me really feel the cold and warming of the hands. <b>bumping up two point.</b> <br/> <br/>The only thing i would change would be the contrast of the shot. I would really push this up.</td>', 'great shot, makes me really feel the cold and warming of the hands. bumping up two point.  The only thing i would change would be the contrast of the shot. I would really push this up.', '2007-02-25 05:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402776, 470489, 26669, '<td valign="top">Good shot but i think the title is a little on the harsh side.  Nice effort</td>', 'Good shot but i think the title is a little on the harsh side.  Nice effort', '2007-02-25 05:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402787, 470869, 52439, '<td valign="top">I love it.<br/>very well positioned in the frame and the stark contrast of her bright colours against the bland background works really well.</td>', 'I love it.very well positioned in the frame and the stark contrast of her bright colours against the bland background works really well.', '2007-02-25 05:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402788, 471076, 52439, '<td valign="top">Fantastic use of available light, its perfect.<br/>Great textures on the wall, nice pose of the girl and even the wind blowing through her hair works so well. I also like the selective desaturation to focus you down the alley. The Cut off window helps balance the whole picture aswell.<br/>Well done, 9.</td>', 'Fantastic use of available light, its perfect.Great textures on the wall, nice pose of the girl and even the wind blowing through her hair works so well. I also like the selective desaturation to focus you down the alley. The Cut off window helps balance the whole picture aswell.Well done, 9.', '2007-02-25 05:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402789, 471403, 52439, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites of the challenge.<br/>I think the tight crop and the composition work extremely well.<br/>Nice dodging and burning except for round the figure, which is the main reason i''ve not given this a 10.<br/>Still gets a 9 mind.<br/>Well done, brilliant photo.</td>', 'One of my favourites of the challenge.I think the tight crop and the composition work extremely well.Nice dodging and burning except for round the figure, which is the main reason i''ve not given this a 10.Still gets a 9 mind.Well done, brilliant photo.', '2007-02-25 05:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402790, 470332, 52439, '<td valign="top">Great shot, nice contrast between the two figures.<br/>Nice perspective, just being able to see down the leading street.</td>', 'Great shot, nice contrast between the two figures.Nice perspective, just being able to see down the leading street.', '2007-02-25 05:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402794, 471143, 52439, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites of the challenge.<br/>I think while it may not be a city street, which some people may unfairly penalise you for, i think it fits very well with the challenge.<br/>the highlighting of the man is very nicely done, and the out of focus bird on his path, i really like it all.<br/>9</td>', 'One of my favourites of the challenge.I think while it may not be a city street, which some people may unfairly penalise you for, i think it fits very well with the challenge.the highlighting of the man is very nicely done, and the out of focus bird on his path, i really like it all.9', '2007-02-25 06:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402795, 471158, 52439, '<td valign="top">Simply brilliant.<br/>Get a 9 from me, almost a ten.<br/>It''s perfectly composed, with the sun flare just adding the real pure candid feeling of this shot.</td>', 'Simply brilliant.Get a 9 from me, almost a ten.It''s perfectly composed, with the sun flare just adding the real pure candid feeling of this shot.', '2007-02-25 06:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402796, 470963, 52439, '<td valign="top">Although it seems more like a set up, outdoor portrait, than a candid street shot, that can''t detract from just how good a photo it is, and it really is.<br/>The tones in this shot are perfect, really apt.</td>', 'Although it seems more like a set up, outdoor portrait, than a candid street shot, that can''t detract from just how good a photo it is, and it really is.The tones in this shot are perfect, really apt.', '2007-02-25 06:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402797, 471080, 52439, '<td valign="top">Brilliant, if the spirit of photography is all about capturing ''moments'' then this moment captures the spirit of photography.<br/>It get''s a high 9 from me, 9.5 maybe.</td>', 'Brilliant, if the spirit of photography is all about capturing ''moments'' then this moment captures the spirit of photography.It get''s a high 9 from me, 9.5 maybe.', '2007-02-25 06:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402798, 471520, 68778, '<td valign="top">The picture look a bit flat.  Maybe ou should have increasy the contrast.  Personally I would also have cropped the picture to be symetric.</td>', 'The picture look a bit flat.  Maybe ou should have increasy the contrast.  Personally I would also have cropped the picture to be symetric.', '2007-02-25 06:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402800, 471290, 52439, '<td valign="top">Brilliant shot, it''s a delicate moment caputured here, and the black and white conversion serves it well. The title gives a more sinister edge to it.<br/>9.</td>', 'Brilliant shot, it''s a delicate moment caputured here, and the black and white conversion serves it well. The title gives a more sinister edge to it.9.', '2007-02-25 06:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402805, 470317, 52439, '<td valign="top">Brilliant shot, a term i think i over use but here it''s certainly apt.<br/>You''ve managed to keep him sharp whilst panning the street, it''s worked so well.<br/>The strong contrast and deep blacks give it character, while the motion gives it spontenuity and a candid feel to which street photography is all about.<br/>9.</td>', 'Brilliant shot, a term i think i over use but here it''s certainly apt.You''ve managed to keep him sharp whilst panning the street, it''s worked so well.The strong contrast and deep blacks give it character, while the motion gives it spontenuity and a candid feel to which street photography is all about.9.', '2007-02-25 07:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402808, 468708, 52549, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot. The title is perfect and the colour enhances the feeling of lonliness and desolation.</td>', 'Fantastic shot. The title is perfect and the colour enhances the feeling of lonliness and desolation.', '2007-02-25 07:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402810, 471418, 52549, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. You had the perfect weather for an excellent b/w conversion.</td>', 'Cool shot. You had the perfect weather for an excellent b/w conversion.', '2007-02-25 07:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402813, 471007, 52549, '<td valign="top">From the outside looking in. Very good shot and I love the shadows created by the tables and chairs in front of the coffeehouse. That alone makes this good shot excellent.</td>', 'From the outside looking in. Very good shot and I love the shadows created by the tables and chairs in front of the coffeehouse. That alone makes this good shot excellent.', '2007-02-25 07:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402814, 470676, 52549, '<td valign="top">Wonderful clarity, wonderful colours...</td>', 'Wonderful clarity, wonderful colours...', '2007-02-25 07:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402816, 471505, 52549, '<td valign="top">WOW! This should do well for you.</td>', 'WOW! This should do well for you.', '2007-02-25 07:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402820, 471237, 55838, '<td valign="top">This is such a sweet and touching image.  A beautiful moment captured.  I''m not keen on some of the technicals of the shot but who cares - it''s not like you were in a studio where all was within your control!  Back to bump you up to 9 for making me FEEL the moment.</td>', 'This is such a sweet and touching image.  A beautiful moment captured.  I''m not keen on some of the technicals of the shot but who cares - it''s not like you were in a studio where all was within your control!  Back to bump you up to 9 for making me FEEL the moment.', '2007-02-25 07:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402821, 470869, 52549, '<td valign="top">Great splash of colour. Unusual shot.</td>', 'Great splash of colour. Unusual shot.', '2007-02-25 07:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402822, 470948, 52549, '<td valign="top">Love it, great shot.</td>', 'Love it, great shot.', '2007-02-25 07:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402823, 471247, 55838, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in a challenge with some great shots.  Love the colors and the contrast and of course the little angel with the bare feet!  One nit might be that a slightly different crop could have leveled the horizon a bit better but who cares!  Fantastic street shot!  Back to bump you up to 9.</td>', 'One of my favorites in a challenge with some great shots.  Love the colors and the contrast and of course the little angel with the bare feet!  One nit might be that a slightly different crop could have leveled the horizon a bit better but who cares!  Fantastic street shot!  Back to bump you up to 9.', '2007-02-25 07:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402827, 471204, 55838, '<td valign="top">Fantastic image.  I love the earthy muted colors and the moment you captured.  Awesome characters (and I especially love the eyebrows on Mr. Green!).  So very well done.  Back to bump you up to 10.  Ribbon contender IMO.</td>', 'Fantastic image.  I love the earthy muted colors and the moment you captured.  Awesome characters (and I especially love the eyebrows on Mr. Green!).  So very well done.  Back to bump you up to 10.  Ribbon contender IMO.', '2007-02-25 07:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402830, 468197, 55838, '<td valign="top">Such a fabulously colorful and fashionable image.  Great work.  Back to bump you up to 9.</td>', 'Such a fabulously colorful and fashionable image.  Great work.  Back to bump you up to 9.', '2007-02-25 07:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402866, 470700, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very nice candid shot. Nice contrast and great detail. I like the title also.</td>', 'Very nice candid shot. Nice contrast and great detail. I like the title also.', '2007-02-25 08:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402867, 471028, 23484, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. Very well composed. It has such an old-world feel to it.</td>', 'I really like this shot. Very well composed. It has such an old-world feel to it.', '2007-02-25 08:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402868, 470843, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  The expressions on both their faces are priceless. Nice contrast and perfect execution.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  The expressions on both their faces are priceless. Nice contrast and perfect execution.', '2007-02-25 08:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402880, 470869, 1054, '<td valign="top">Great color on this. Since this is Advanced I would have preferred to see the red spots on the wall desaturated, specifically the ones just to the left of her head. The blues are fine, but the reds seem to pull the eye away from your subject.</td>', 'Great color on this. Since this is Advanced I would have preferred to see the red spots on the wall desaturated, specifically the ones just to the left of her head. The blues are fine, but the reds seem to pull the eye away from your subject.', '2007-02-25 09:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402881, 471446, 1054, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of crop. I''m left wondering why you left just a little bit of the step or whatever showing at the very bottom left of the frame, and also one-half og the entrance to the parking garage. I also have to wonder what the point of interest is here. There''s nothing to hold the viewer''s eye.</td>', 'Interesting choice of crop. I''m left wondering why you left just a little bit of the step or whatever showing at the very bottom left of the frame, and also one-half og the entrance to the parking garage. I also have to wonder what the point of interest is here. There''s nothing to hold the viewer''s eye.', '2007-02-25 09:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402883, 471276, 1054, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but I wish we could see more of the man''s face. On the post-processing side, this probably needs to be rotated slightly clockwise. It also appears to be over-sharpened. Notice the halos around the man and where the dog''s back meets the sign.</td>', 'Nice photo, but I wish we could see more of the man''s face. On the post-processing side, this probably needs to be rotated slightly clockwise. It also appears to be over-sharpened. Notice the halos around the man and where the dog''s back meets the sign.', '2007-02-25 09:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402889, 471381, 1054, '<td valign="top">I good photograph, but it strikes me more as a posed model shot or portrait  than as street photography, when tends to be more distanced from the subject. This is still a very good photograph, and I can see it as a CD cover or liner note photo, but as a street photograph, I feel it needs more context.</td>', 'I good photograph, but it strikes me more as a posed model shot or portrait  than as street photography, when tends to be more distanced from the subject. This is still a very good photograph, and I can see it as a CD cover or liner note photo, but as a street photograph, I feel it needs more context.', '2007-02-25 09:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402890, 470632, 1054, '<td valign="top">This definitely needs to be rotated about a degree or two clockwise.  I also feel like the two men on the left, and the police on the right, are battling for the viewer''s attention. The men on the left are probably where your story is, if they were more in the frame.</td>', 'This definitely needs to be rotated about a degree or two clockwise.  I also feel like the two men on the left, and the police on the right, are battling for the viewer''s attention. The men on the left are probably where your story is, if they were more in the frame.', '2007-02-25 09:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402894, 471062, 1054, '<td valign="top">Excellent, excellent, excellent. Great composition, great framing, great tonal range. I love this.</td>', 'Excellent, excellent, excellent. Great composition, great framing, great tonal range. I love this.', '2007-02-25 09:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402896, 468490, 1054, '<td valign="top">Good photograph, the person provides a point of interest but I wish we could see more of him (or her).</td>', 'Good photograph, the person provides a point of interest but I wish we could see more of him (or her).', '2007-02-25 09:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402905, 471328, 66597, '<td valign="top">This has a lot of potential, and has good tonal range. Unfortunately, the mirror gives it the feelign of a snapshot taken from a car. Would also like to see the dog and drivers'' faces, or a little closer up.</td>', 'This has a lot of potential, and has good tonal range. Unfortunately, the mirror gives it the feelign of a snapshot taken from a car. Would also like to see the dog and drivers'' faces, or a little closer up.', '2007-02-25 09:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402908, 471391, 66597, '<td valign="top">I really like the expression on the faces. I think it would be even stronger if the faces were dodged a little so they stood out more.</td>', 'I really like the expression on the faces. I think it would be even stronger if the faces were dodged a little so they stood out more.', '2007-02-25 09:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402910, 470916, 58438, '<td valign="top">I would like to see more sharpness. Also, the subject seems a little difficult to pinpoint at first, perhaps if the shot was taken from a little further from the right placing the subject just to the left, since he is facing right and showing the onlookers more behind the subject.  But still a great capture.</td>', 'I would like to see more sharpness. Also, the subject seems a little difficult to pinpoint at first, perhaps if the shot was taken from a little further from the right placing the subject just to the left, since he is facing right and showing the onlookers more behind the subject.  But still a great capture.', '2007-02-25 09:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402912, 471476, 66597, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure and colors. Wishing there was something that either told a story or drew the viewer in a little more. I think the two cars may detract.</td>', 'Nice exposure and colors. Wishing there was something that either told a story or drew the viewer in a little more. I think the two cars may detract.', '2007-02-25 09:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402915, 468711, 66597, '<td valign="top">This gives a good sense of being cold and miserable, and a nice capture of ignoring the man in the middle. I wish he were a little sharper.</td>', 'This gives a good sense of being cold and miserable, and a nice capture of ignoring the man in the middle. I wish he were a little sharper.', '2007-02-25 09:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402916, 470573, 66597, '<td valign="top">I like the interaction between the people, but not sure about the sepia treatment. A little dodging on the faces would help make the people "pop" I think.</td>', 'I like the interaction between the people, but not sure about the sepia treatment. A little dodging on the faces would help make the people "pop" I think.', '2007-02-25 09:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402918, 471078, 66597, '<td valign="top">Although I really like the road and colors, this looks a little contrived to me, sorry!</td>', 'Although I really like the road and colors, this looks a little contrived to me, sorry!', '2007-02-25 09:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402920, 471502, 66597, '<td valign="top">Good expression, like how the nose ring is visible.</td>', 'Good expression, like how the nose ring is visible.', '2007-02-25 09:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402922, 471129, 66597, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective with the chains. Makes this a bit menacing for some reason.</td>', 'Interesting perspective with the chains. Makes this a bit menacing for some reason.', '2007-02-25 09:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402923, 470161, 58438, '<td valign="top">Would prefer a little more sharpness.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Would prefer a little more sharpness.  Nice shot.', '2007-02-25 09:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402924, 470531, 58438, '<td valign="top">What a romantic shot.</td>', 'What a romantic shot.', '2007-02-25 09:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402927, 471243, 58438, '<td valign="top">Great colors.  I am afraid that the bicycle blur takes away from the subject.</td>', 'Great colors.  I am afraid that the bicycle blur takes away from the subject.', '2007-02-25 09:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402937, 471100, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fantastic moment captured here, and such clear, effective tones! 9</td>', 'Fantastic moment captured here, and such clear, effective tones! 9', '2007-02-25 09:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402939, 471078, 6870, '<td valign="top">For some reason, she looks familiar. I love the leading lines here, and you even got some from the sky! Nice work.</td>', 'For some reason, she looks familiar. I love the leading lines here, and you even got some from the sky! Nice work.', '2007-02-25 09:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402940, 471103, 6870, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo! The way she''s framed by the windows, and then she''s holding a frame, too makes for a really wonderful contrast. Very nice geometry and meaning here. 9</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo! The way she''s framed by the windows, and then she''s holding a frame, too makes for a really wonderful contrast. Very nice geometry and meaning here. 9', '2007-02-25 09:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402943, 470317, 6870, '<td valign="top">Beautiful job panning here! Tones are rich and engaging. 9</td>', 'Beautiful job panning here! Tones are rich and engaging. 9', '2007-02-25 09:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402950, 471516, 58438, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot!!! I wish at least 1 of the firemen were sharper.  Really tells the story.  I love it.</td>', 'Fantastic shot!!! I wish at least 1 of the firemen were sharper.  Really tells the story.  I love it.', '2007-02-25 10:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402954, 471028, 54446, '<td valign="top">Wonderful scene. (10)</td>', 'Wonderful scene. (10)', '2007-02-25 10:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402955, 471066, 54446, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  Great eye trick. (10)</td>', 'I really like this.  Great eye trick. (10)', '2007-02-25 10:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402957, 470993, 54446, '<td valign="top">Superb lighting and composition. (10)</td>', 'Superb lighting and composition. (10)', '2007-02-25 10:07:33.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3402959, 470920, 54446, '<td valign="top">This is probably my favorite of this challenge.  Really says "romance" and fulfills the challenge very well.  Great job! (10)</td>', 'This is probably my favorite of this challenge.  Really says "romance" and fulfills the challenge very well.  Great job! (10)', '2007-02-25 10:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402962, 470546, 54446, '<td valign="top">Very good cropping.  This is a scene I would expect to see on the streets of many urban areas. (10)</td>', 'Very good cropping.  This is a scene I would expect to see on the streets of many urban areas. (10)', '2007-02-25 10:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402963, 471204, 54446, '<td valign="top">Great clarity and detail.  Wonderful capture of character.  A memorable image. (10)</td>', 'Great clarity and detail.  Wonderful capture of character.  A memorable image. (10)', '2007-02-25 10:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402964, 471160, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good capture of personality and presentation of some humor.  Meets the challenge well.  (10)</td>', 'Good capture of personality and presentation of some humor.  Meets the challenge well.  (10)', '2007-02-25 10:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402965, 471207, 54446, '<td valign="top">An enjoyable image to view.  Great composition allowing the men plenty of room to walk into the scene.  (10)</td>', 'An enjoyable image to view.  Great composition allowing the men plenty of room to walk into the scene.  (10)', '2007-02-25 10:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402966, 470700, 54446, '<td valign="top">Great black and white image.  Superb capture of character and detail.  (10)</td>', 'Great black and white image.  Superb capture of character and detail.  (10)', '2007-02-25 10:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402974, 470538, 52549, '<td valign="top">Great shot - love the hazy background and the subtle title.</td>', 'Great shot - love the hazy background and the subtle title.', '2007-02-25 10:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402978, 471439, 52549, '<td valign="top">You captured a poignant moment here...</td>', 'You captured a poignant moment here...', '2007-02-25 10:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402985, 471447, 52549, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, it should do fantastically well for you. The only tiny nit-pick I have is the tiny corner of blue sky at the top left corner. IMO it''s distracting.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, it should do fantastically well for you. The only tiny nit-pick I have is the tiny corner of blue sky at the top left corner. IMO it''s distracting.', '2007-02-25 10:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402987, 471385, 52549, '<td valign="top">Wonderful.</td>', 'Wonderful.', '2007-02-25 10:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402990, 471463, 52549, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if this is a "street" but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt ;-) It''s definitely one of the best b/w conversions I''ve ever seen. Good luck.</td>', 'I don''t know if this is a "street" but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt ;-) It''s definitely one of the best b/w conversions I''ve ever seen. Good luck.', '2007-02-25 10:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
