(3405035, 471505, 41337, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by agenkin:</b></div><hr/><i> What can be more cliche than photographing photographers?  What interesting have you done here?  You could have at least included the subject of their interest. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Perhaps I didn''t shoot this all that well and certainly not as well as you would have liked. However I don''t recall seeing another photo like this in the challenge so maybe it''s not as cliche as you thought? FWIW, I did try to be different, a lot that got me.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-02-26 02:11:52.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by agenkin: What can be more cliche than photographing photographers?  What interesting have you done here?  You could have at least included the subject of their interest.   Perhaps I didn''t shoot this all that well and certainly not as well as you would have liked. However I don''t recall seeing another photo like this in the challenge so maybe it''s not as cliche as you thought? FWIW, I did try to be different, a lot that got me.', '2007-02-26 02:09:52.000000', '2007-02-26 02:11:52.000000', 0),
