(3405198, 470940, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! I agree with noraneko in regards to the person in the background.</td>', 'Nice shot! I agree with noraneko in regards to the person in the background.', '2007-02-26 05:07:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(3405206, 470830, 65886, '<td valign="top">ah!</td>', 'ah!', '2007-02-26 05:10:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3405209, 471410, 65886, '<td valign="top">extremely well captured, excellent colors, the scene is funny and very interesting, it maks me think a lot about why they are sitting there and further, further. absolutely great composition!! those red lines on the both sides and the umbrella - excellent. and that "band-aid" on one of the red columns is perfect in my opinion, it adds depth to the columns. the moment is great:) : those two girls on the baclground are on both sides of the woman''s head!!<br/>very very underrated photo:(</td>', 'extremely well captured, excellent colors, the scene is funny and very interesting, it maks me think a lot about why they are sitting there and further, further. absolutely great composition!! those red lines on the both sides and the umbrella - excellent. and that "band-aid" on one of the red columns is perfect in my opinion, it adds depth to the columns. the moment is great:) : those two girls on the baclground are on both sides of the woman''s head!!very very underrated photo:(', '2007-02-26 05:13:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(3405216, 471462, 65886, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and I disagree with the comments. it''s easy to get lost in the cities like this one and it''s extremely easy to get lost in Hong Kong. I love the tiny people - it''s very close to life. it is indeed not very easy to see people and especially <b>individuals</b> in this atmosphere. I don''t understand why everyone wnats people to be closer to the viewer:)</td>', 'I love the colors and I disagree with the comments. it''s easy to get lost in the cities like this one and it''s extremely easy to get lost in Hong Kong. I love the tiny people - it''s very close to life. it is indeed not very easy to see people and especially individuals in this atmosphere. I don''t understand why everyone wnats people to be closer to the viewer:)', '2007-02-26 05:17:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3405218, 470416, 65886, '<td valign="top">excellent portrait, great expression she has, and I love the way you edited it!</td>', 'excellent portrait, great expression she has, and I love the way you edited it!', '2007-02-26 05:18:29.000000', NULL, 0),
