(3405361, 470625, 30982, '<td valign="top">Darn near a top twenty but better still, a great score on a great image!  Nothing wrong with this at all.  I do like the grain - works very well for this.  And I like the very tight crop next to the young child with that vast expanse of stairs next to and behind him - it creates a great tension in the photograph.  Well done!</td>', 'Darn near a top twenty but better still, a great score on a great image!  Nothing wrong with this at all.  I do like the grain - works very well for this.  And I like the very tight crop next to the young child with that vast expanse of stairs next to and behind him - it creates a great tension in the photograph.  Well done!', '2007-02-26 07:12:25.000000', NULL, 0),
