(3405590, 471160, 50695, '<td valign="top">This was one of my "silent sevens" and in a challenge with fewer brilliant entries it would have gotten a higher score AND a comment from me. Great capture. The connection between the one man and the pigeons is palpable. It kind of makes you wonder if the other two men are pigeons.</td>', 'This was one of my "silent sevens" and in a challenge with fewer brilliant entries it would have gotten a higher score AND a comment from me. Great capture. The connection between the one man and the pigeons is palpable. It kind of makes you wonder if the other two men are pigeons.', '2007-02-26 08:52:26.000000', NULL, 0),
