(3406216, 470584, 2240, '<td valign="top">Nice work Sandy. This is a wonderful picture for this challenge I thought that it would have made top 10.</td>', 'Nice work Sandy. This is a wonderful picture for this challenge I thought that it would have made top 10.', '2007-02-26 11:29:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(3406232, 469974, 67343, '<td valign="top">Congratulations really loved this image.  Glad to see it got a ribbon. :)</td>', 'Congratulations really loved this image.  Glad to see it got a ribbon. :)', '2007-02-26 11:38:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(3406240, 470725, 5112, '<td valign="top">Thank you all!<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by yanko:</b></div><hr/><i> I had this rated much higher than your finish but I''m curious about the trash you cloned out. The "perfectness" of this photo bothered me just a little so perhaps keeping the trash would have worked better? Just wondering. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The trash I cloned out was minimal, a cigarette butt in front of the girl.  If it would have been more trash, bigger, more noticeable, I would have left it, but it was so little that it showed more as a flaw than as trash IMO.  Soooo .... gotta get away from "perfectness", eh?</td>', 'Thank you all! Originally posted by yanko: I had this rated much higher than your finish but I''m curious about the trash you cloned out. The "perfectness" of this photo bothered me just a little so perhaps keeping the trash would have worked better? Just wondering.   The trash I cloned out was minimal, a cigarette butt in front of the girl.  If it would have been more trash, bigger, more noticeable, I would have left it, but it was so little that it showed more as a flaw than as trash IMO.  Soooo .... gotta get away from "perfectness", eh?', '2007-02-26 11:41:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(3406283, 471215, 11854, '<td valign="top">Wow! This is fantastic! You were robbed on the score for sure. I didn''t vote in the challenge (since my understanding of it differs from everyone else on the planet), but if I had I would have given this a 10.</td>', 'Wow! This is fantastic! You were robbed on the score for sure. I didn''t vote in the challenge (since my understanding of it differs from everyone else on the planet), but if I had I would have given this a 10.', '2007-02-26 11:54:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(3406315, 471066, 28532, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot - Congrats on the Blue Ribbon!!</td>', 'Awesome shot - Congrats on the Blue Ribbon!!', '2007-02-26 12:05:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(3406323, 469974, 28532, '<td valign="top">Sweet - I really wanted to see this on the front page!!  Congrats on the yellow ribbon!!</td>', 'Sweet - I really wanted to see this on the front page!!  Congrats on the yellow ribbon!!', '2007-02-26 12:08:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3406326, 470979, 28532, '<td valign="top">This is such a great shot!  Congrats on the 4th Place finish!</td>', 'This is such a great shot!  Congrats on the 4th Place finish!', '2007-02-26 12:09:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(3406329, 471337, 28532, '<td valign="top">Congrats on Top 10 -- amazing shot!!</td>', 'Congrats on Top 10 -- amazing shot!!', '2007-02-26 12:10:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3406356, 470837, 65886, '<td valign="top">yes, I also wanted to explain about the tiny people. it was the idea of course, Olso is all lines, stone and glass, it''s easy to get lost there and easy to loose someone. this photo is 100% candid, I was standing on that place 3 days trying to catch this - I knew I would, I had this in my head, I saw this, and then I finally saw them "live". I love this photo.</td>', 'yes, I also wanted to explain about the tiny people. it was the idea of course, Olso is all lines, stone and glass, it''s easy to get lost there and easy to loose someone. this photo is 100% candid, I was standing on that place 3 days trying to catch this - I knew I would, I had this in my head, I saw this, and then I finally saw them "live". I love this photo.', '2007-02-26 12:21:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(3406363, 470830, 58728, '<td valign="top">One of my faves from the challenge.  :)</td>', 'One of my faves from the challenge.  :)', '2007-02-26 12:25:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(3406371, 471237, 61795, '<td valign="top">Great capture. I love shots like this that have a story in there and makes me question certain things about everything around us.</td>', 'Great capture. I love shots like this that have a story in there and makes me question certain things about everything around us.', '2007-02-26 12:27:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(3406372, 470979, 15711, '<td valign="top">Fantastic.  So glad this did well.</td>', 'Fantastic.  So glad this did well.', '2007-02-26 12:28:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(3406378, 470496, 58728, '<td valign="top">underrated. I gave it a nine.  I expected it to score much higher.  Awesome shot.</td>', 'underrated. I gave it a nine.  I expected it to score much higher.  Awesome shot.', '2007-02-26 12:29:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3406385, 467728, 58728, '<td valign="top">I think this is a lovely shot.  I gave it an 8, and expected it to score higher.  Great composition.  ;)</td>', 'I think this is a lovely shot.  I gave it an 8, and expected it to score higher.  Great composition.  ;)', '2007-02-26 12:30:48.000000', NULL, 0);
