(3406421, 470161, 3569, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by silverfoxx:</b></div><hr/><i> what were they looking at? nice shot </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I was working as quality assurance person for a local forest restoration project and this group of workers were finalizing their work by tossing the last log into a chipper. Look closely and you can see the chips flying.  Thanks for the comments. Van</td>', 'Originally posted by silverfoxx: what were they looking at? nice shot   I was working as quality assurance person for a local forest restoration project and this group of workers were finalizing their work by tossing the last log into a chipper. Look closely and you can see the chips flying.  Thanks for the comments. Van', '2007-02-26 12:39:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(3406438, 469974, 29949, '<td valign="top">OH NO! NO MORE RIBBON PLEEEEEASE!!! ... i dont wanna be your slave anymore... lol <br/>Congrats darling! Today we have to do ribbon dinner untweeee!!!</td>', 'OH NO! NO MORE RIBBON PLEEEEEASE!!! ... i dont wanna be your slave anymore... lol Congrats darling! Today we have to do ribbon dinner untweeee!!!', '2007-02-26 12:43:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(3406454, 471160, 66597, '<td valign="top">Deb,<br/>Love this photo! Gave it a high score, as did a lot of other people, by the look of that finish :-) Not only is it a brilliant photo, but the title is marvelous. BTW, you beat the master himself, Henri. (Did you see that thread?)</td>', 'Deb,Love this photo! Gave it a high score, as did a lot of other people, by the look of that finish :-) Not only is it a brilliant photo, but the title is marvelous. BTW, you beat the master himself, Henri. (Did you see that thread?)', '2007-02-26 12:48:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(3406575, 470943, 57392, '<td valign="top">what a lovely sight,friendship on display,I love it .Very well done on your 10th place</td>', 'what a lovely sight,friendship on display,I love it .Very well done on your 10th place', '2007-02-26 13:23:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(3406600, 470786, 55621, '<td valign="top">After having the Fruits and Vegetable entry DQ''ed due to date violations I immediately went and check the date on this entry.  Same deal, the date was set to 06.  I contacted the Admin and told them to go ahead and pull this one too.  Talk about bad luck, two entries taken one day apart.  <br/> <br/><b>Lesson to be learned,</b> <b>CHECK THE TIME/DATE ON YOUR CAMERA EACH TIME YOU GO OUT TO SHOOT...</b></td>', 'After having the Fruits and Vegetable entry DQ''ed due to date violations I immediately went and check the date on this entry.  Same deal, the date was set to 06.  I contacted the Admin and told them to go ahead and pull this one too.  Talk about bad luck, two entries taken one day apart.   Lesson to be learned, CHECK THE TIME/DATE ON YOUR CAMERA EACH TIME YOU GO OUT TO SHOOT...', '2007-02-26 13:36:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(3406620, 471160, 63495, '<td valign="top">Deb this is awesome, i didnt have time to vote in this challenge. wish i had cause i would have voted high on this. Looks like timfy''s method worked great.</td>', 'Deb this is awesome, i didnt have time to vote in this challenge. wish i had cause i would have voted high on this. Looks like timfy''s method worked great.', '2007-02-26 13:42:37.000000', NULL, 0),
