(3406634, 469974, 29658, '<td valign="top">Hurrah! Go Nikon Go! Wonderful shot</td>', 'Hurrah! Go Nikon Go! Wonderful shot', '2007-02-26 13:47:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(3406721, 471151, 5792, '<td valign="top">This is a great photograph!</td>', 'This is a great photograph!', '2007-02-26 14:22:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3406772, 471066, 53964, '<td valign="top">What I like best is that the woman in the photo looks more real than the real one.  GREAT shot! :)</td>', 'What I like best is that the woman in the photo looks more real than the real one.  GREAT shot! :)', '2007-02-26 14:38:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(3406846, 470695, 40683, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...I''m surprised at the placing of this one.  I had scored this among the highest in my voting.  I guess it was just a bit too much blur for most people.  I really love the sense of movement. :)</td>', 'Hmmm...I''m surprised at the placing of this one.  I had scored this among the highest in my voting.  I guess it was just a bit too much blur for most people.  I really love the sense of movement. :)', '2007-02-26 14:56:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(3406868, 471080, 62637, '<td valign="top">posthumous, I agree 100% about your take on the garbage can.  This photo isn''t complete without it.  I tried alot of different crops here, and the photo seemed to "need" both the bin and the bench.  I wouldn''t do it any other way...</td>', 'posthumous, I agree 100% about your take on the garbage can.  This photo isn''t complete without it.  I tried alot of different crops here, and the photo seemed to "need" both the bin and the bench.  I wouldn''t do it any other way...', '2007-02-26 15:01:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(3406901, 471158, 45475, '<td valign="top">Ha! You do it to me again! I find your work completely fascinating and I come back to discover you''ve been robbed...</td>', 'Ha! You do it to me again! I find your work completely fascinating and I come back to discover you''ve been robbed...', '2007-02-26 15:09:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3406912, 471407, 65886, '<td valign="top">I agree with Catherine, I like the title. I also like that he is looking away from the frame, at something we can''t see - it gives the photo some history and much interest. I also wonder how it would look like in colors? all those colorful stripes on his clothes and those balloons would probably have made the "messy", busy composition even more busy - and it''s nice. there is something interesting and fascinating about the composition and so many things there at the same time. his expression and pose make that messy look even stronger - that''s great!</td>', 'I agree with Catherine, I like the title. I also like that he is looking away from the frame, at something we can''t see - it gives the photo some history and much interest. I also wonder how it would look like in colors? all those colorful stripes on his clothes and those balloons would probably have made the "messy", busy composition even more busy - and it''s nice. there is something interesting and fascinating about the composition and so many things there at the same time. his expression and pose make that messy look even stronger - that''s great!', '2007-02-26 15:11:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(3406942, 471447, 30982, '<td valign="top">For someone who did a lot of moaning about not having anywhere to shoot, I''d say you did just fine!  Lovely location.</td>', 'For someone who did a lot of moaning about not having anywhere to shoot, I''d say you did just fine!  Lovely location.', '2007-02-26 15:17:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(3406962, 469369, 60505, '<td valign="top">Congrats. Great photo. Love the reflections and the contrasts all over the place. Very interesting, simple and elegant, great use of DOF. But I couldn''t figure what the building was in the background, despite living there for 15 years.</td>', 'Congrats. Great photo. Love the reflections and the contrasts all over the place. Very interesting, simple and elegant, great use of DOF. But I couldn''t figure what the building was in the background, despite living there for 15 years.', '2007-02-26 15:21:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(3406977, 470833, 30982, '<td valign="top">I REALLY like this one, but all of the shots of this guy are very good!  Hard to say if the others would have done better, but I''d say this one did just fine.  What a great subject!</td>', 'I REALLY like this one, but all of the shots of this guy are very good!  Hard to say if the others would have done better, but I''d say this one did just fine.  What a great subject!', '2007-02-26 15:25:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(3406984, 470719, 45475, '<td valign="top">Maybe not technically "street" but very clever. No signs necessary. Would be an interesting experience to get a look inside. Great find!</td>', 'Maybe not technically "street" but very clever. No signs necessary. Would be an interesting experience to get a look inside. Great find!', '2007-02-26 15:26:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(3407023, 471447, 50231, '<td valign="top">I still like the other one better. :-P</td>', 'I still like the other one better. :-P', '2007-02-26 15:35:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3407025, 471151, 42826, '<td valign="top">This is one heck of a great shot!  And way to tip....I don''t know if very many people actually tip....but see twice a learning experience!!!!</td>', 'This is one heck of a great shot!  And way to tip....I don''t know if very many people actually tip....but see twice a learning experience!!!!', '2007-02-26 15:36:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(3407028, 471066, 64929, '<td valign="top">Definitely one of my top picks of the challenge and well deserving of a ribbon!  Bravo to you for a fine capture!</td>', 'Definitely one of my top picks of the challenge and well deserving of a ribbon!  Bravo to you for a fine capture!', '2007-02-26 15:36:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(3407041, 469369, 26669, '<td valign="top">taken at the customs house Shrink</td>', 'taken at the customs house Shrink', '2007-02-26 15:41:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(3407129, 469757, 30982, '<td valign="top">And a good choice for an entry it was, too.  He does look like he''s enjoying it, despite the snow.  I gotta imagine that the snow kinda makes for a bit different sound, too.  Nice capture.</td>', 'And a good choice for an entry it was, too.  He does look like he''s enjoying it, despite the snow.  I gotta imagine that the snow kinda makes for a bit different sound, too.  Nice capture.', '2007-02-26 16:11:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(3407162, 470843, 60495, '<td valign="top">I really liked this one when I saw it, I might have gone with the title "Guess" like the print right behind the aaaa person because I still need to guess...... Great job!</td>', 'I really liked this one when I saw it, I might have gone with the title "Guess" like the print right behind the aaaa person because I still need to guess...... Great job!', '2007-02-26 16:22:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(3407245, 471403, 62318, '<td valign="top">Wonderful mood and lighting. Not sure how "natural" the lighting was moving up the sidewalk but it is very nicely done nonetheless. I like the imposing sides coming in. With the highlighted street, the man, the bridge, and then the far clouds shows great movement in the frame. Not too much to complain about the photo, maybe some dodging/burning issues around the figure, but overall an exceptional photo. It''s not something I personally equate with "Street Photography" hence I gave it a lower rating, but just as a beautifully rendered photo and idea it garners HIGH marks in my book.</td>', 'Wonderful mood and lighting. Not sure how "natural" the lighting was moving up the sidewalk but it is very nicely done nonetheless. I like the imposing sides coming in. With the highlighted street, the man, the bridge, and then the far clouds shows great movement in the frame. Not too much to complain about the photo, maybe some dodging/burning issues around the figure, but overall an exceptional photo. It''s not something I personally equate with "Street Photography" hence I gave it a lower rating, but just as a beautifully rendered photo and idea it garners HIGH marks in my book.', '2007-02-26 16:41:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(3407273, 470429, 62318, '<td valign="top">This was a terrific idea, just missing the mark for full impact. I think the biggest issue is with the composition. It is just a bit too cluttered/busy for me. No given that, there is a ton to love about this photo. The expression of the girl and the mother on the left, the elderly woman coming towards you engaging the viewer, and the passerbys just shuffling along. The exposure is pretty good, consider it looks like it was midday in harsh light? It is a fun scene in a market place. Maybe a little different angle or on a lower plane to really make this one shine. Still a nice shot and a good fit for the challenge.</td>', 'This was a terrific idea, just missing the mark for full impact. I think the biggest issue is with the composition. It is just a bit too cluttered/busy for me. No given that, there is a ton to love about this photo. The expression of the girl and the mother on the left, the elderly woman coming towards you engaging the viewer, and the passerbys just shuffling along. The exposure is pretty good, consider it looks like it was midday in harsh light? It is a fun scene in a market place. Maybe a little different angle or on a lower plane to really make this one shine. Still a nice shot and a good fit for the challenge.', '2007-02-26 16:48:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(3407280, 471403, 51538, '<td valign="top">Congratulations.  Very glad you achieved such a good grade!  Those clouds are in just the right place.  And the 3 - hydrant, person, truck - make for a nice odd number.  Head backwards up that street towards the Navy Yard and there are some other nice locations too.  The ConEd plant with its tall industrial chimney adjacent to the old Vinegar Hill houses offers and interesting juxtaposition.</td>', 'Congratulations.  Very glad you achieved such a good grade!  Those clouds are in just the right place.  And the 3 - hydrant, person, truck - make for a nice odd number.  Head backwards up that street towards the Navy Yard and there are some other nice locations too.  The ConEd plant with its tall industrial chimney adjacent to the old Vinegar Hill houses offers and interesting juxtaposition.', '2007-02-26 16:51:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3407289, 470317, 4493, '<td valign="top">Well captured and truely a great photo.<br/> <br/>-danny</td>', 'Well captured and truely a great photo. -danny', '2007-02-26 16:52:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(3407295, 470411, 52115, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your score, I think it is similar to metatate''s photo.</td>', 'Congratulations on your score, I think it is similar to metatate''s photo.', '2007-02-26 16:53:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(3407320, 470966, 67373, '<td valign="top">Should have made the top 10 (in my book). Congratulations.</td>', 'Should have made the top 10 (in my book). Congratulations.', '2007-02-26 17:01:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(3407322, 471152, 17990, '<td valign="top">Great work Jim!!!!!! this is a great image (I didn`t vote on this challenge but it would have been one of my top scores)--- Go team!!!</td>', 'Great work Jim!!!!!! this is a great image (I didn`t vote on this challenge but it would have been one of my top scores)--- Go team!!!', '2007-02-26 17:02:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(3407323, 471337, 42567, '<td valign="top">Awesome job!  Congratulations on the top 10!  Well done.</td>', 'Awesome job!  Congratulations on the top 10!  Well done.', '2007-02-26 17:02:43.000000', NULL, 0),
