(3407519, 470531, 62318, '<td valign="top">I like the angle and an interesting idea. What would have made the shot for me would have been one single person coming up the stair looking at the camera. It''s just too many backs for me, I know that was part of the idea. :) Exposure is nice. This is more of the traditional black and white than the high contrast stuff you usually see which I like. A well taken shot. Congrats!</td>', 'I like the angle and an interesting idea. What would have made the shot for me would have been one single person coming up the stair looking at the camera. It''s just too many backs for me, I know that was part of the idea. :) Exposure is nice. This is more of the traditional black and white than the high contrast stuff you usually see which I like. A well taken shot. Congrats!', '2007-02-26 18:37:28.000000', NULL, 0),
