(3407628, 471487, 50695, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by agenkin:</b></div><hr/><i> <a href="//theonlinephotographer.blogspot.com/2006/03/photographing-homeless-banned.html" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//theonlinephotographer.blogspot.com/2006/03/photographing-homeless-banned.html</a> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>This is precisely the cliche that you have transcended with this photo. Your processing and putting the camera on the ground with the man have gone a long way towards that.</td>', 'Originally posted by agenkin: //theonlinephotographer.blogspot.com/2006/03/photographing-homeless-banned.html   This is precisely the cliche that you have transcended with this photo. Your processing and putting the camera on the ground with the man have gone a long way towards that.', '2007-02-26 19:23:49.000000', NULL, 0),
