(3408392, 471426, 47541, '<td valign="top">It''s funny, when I saw in the forums you had an entry I thought I''d play "spot the Auckland street scene" but this entry didn''t even make my candidate list.  It has a European feel to it and the title threw me a little I guess :)<br/> <br/>The image is cool but in a lot of ways I like the outtake more as the expression on his face is priceless!<br/></td>', 'It''s funny, when I saw in the forums you had an entry I thought I''d play "spot the Auckland street scene" but this entry didn''t even make my candidate list.  It has a European feel to it and the title threw me a little I guess :) The image is cool but in a lot of ways I like the outtake more as the expression on his face is priceless!', '2007-02-27 00:53:32.000000', NULL, 0),
