(3408760, 471129, 63101, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Bosborne:</b></div><hr/><i> Street? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yeah, I had this alot in the comments..... this picture was taken in London, in the Westminster Underground (metro or subway) station.<br/> <br/>There is a lot to look at, I wanted to have the chains as the obvious-in-focus subject, but have the background pull your eyes away and grab some of your interest, but at the same time always returning to the chains...... a bit of an experiment, from the comments, I can see one that didn''t work!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Bosborne: Street?   Yeah, I had this alot in the comments..... this picture was taken in London, in the Westminster Underground (metro or subway) station. There is a lot to look at, I wanted to have the chains as the obvious-in-focus subject, but have the background pull your eyes away and grab some of your interest, but at the same time always returning to the chains...... a bit of an experiment, from the comments, I can see one that didn''t work! ', '2007-02-27 06:50:26.000000', NULL, 0),
