(3408817, 470868, 6349, '<td valign="top">Just wanted to drop you a comment saying that I gave you your one 9 and the highest score I gave in the challenge was a 9.  I gave out 6 of them of which yours is by far the lowest rated (which I think, in many ways, is a bigger accomplishment than an average score).  I appreciate those who submit to the challenge knowing that their work will not score well.  Your street stuff is outstanding and I always enjoy browsing your portfolio from time to time.  Keep up the great work.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-02-27 07:29:50.</i></td>', 'Just wanted to drop you a comment saying that I gave you your one 9 and the highest score I gave in the challenge was a 9.  I gave out 6 of them of which yours is by far the lowest rated (which I think, in many ways, is a bigger accomplishment than an average score).  I appreciate those who submit to the challenge knowing that their work will not score well.  Your street stuff is outstanding and I always enjoy browsing your portfolio from time to time.  Keep up the great work.', '2007-02-27 07:28:24.000000', '2007-02-27 07:29:50.000000', 0),
