(3424880, 470254, 6388, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> What''s wrong with me?? I gave my street photography heroes, e301 and agenkin, SIXES in this challenge...<br/> <br/>I''m still learning, sensei! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>it ain''t you...<br/> <br/>*edited to add for clarification*<br/> <br/>...if seems to me that both Ed and Arcady departed from their traditional styles a bit for this challenge, which I respect.  Going the safe way would likely have yielded better scores, but then nothing is learned.  Sometimes straying from the norm works, sometimes it doesn''t - in this case I don''t think it did, but I can still appreciate the attempt.  So, Posthumous - it ain''t you this time...trust your eye. :)<br/> <br/>P<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-03-03 11:30:58.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: What''s wrong with me?? I gave my street photography heroes, e301 and agenkin, SIXES in this challenge... I''m still learning, sensei!   it ain''t you... *edited to add for clarification* ...if seems to me that both Ed and Arcady departed from their traditional styles a bit for this challenge, which I respect.  Going the safe way would likely have yielded better scores, but then nothing is learned.  Sometimes straying from the norm works, sometimes it doesn''t - in this case I don''t think it did, but I can still appreciate the attempt.  So, Posthumous - it ain''t you this time...trust your eye. :) P', '2007-03-03 03:38:48.000000', '2007-03-03 11:30:58.000000', 0),
(3424952, 470940, 48954, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. I must admit that pictures of people terrify me. I always scared that they are going to come up to me and ask me to delete the shots because I violated their "image" space or something of the sort. I will have to work on that in the future. I''m glad you were able to pull this challenge off. I was to intimidated by it :)</td>', 'Cool shot. I must admit that pictures of people terrify me. I always scared that they are going to come up to me and ask me to delete the shots because I violated their "image" space or something of the sort. I will have to work on that in the future. I''m glad you were able to pull this challenge off. I was to intimidated by it :)', '2007-03-03 05:31:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(3425220, 470625, 66384, '<td valign="top">I love shooting children this age. It''s like shooting wildlife -- you just wait, and they will do something charming or awful. I like the composition of this shot, and I don''t mind the grain at all -- it seems appropriate for this image, which looks vintage. Congratulation on a score to be envied by all Team Suck members.</td>', 'I love shooting children this age. It''s like shooting wildlife -- you just wait, and they will do something charming or awful. I like the composition of this shot, and I don''t mind the grain at all -- it seems appropriate for this image, which looks vintage. Congratulation on a score to be envied by all Team Suck members.', '2007-03-03 10:14:00.000000', NULL, 0),
