(3461450, 471406, 47906, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective of the shot, and the completeness added by the shadows to complete the square in the perspective. I feel as there is a slight counter clockwise tilt to the photo, could be just me.<br/> <br/>The only thing I would change is have my model closer to the front as there is already plenty of ojects in this photo to support the depth. I do like the contrasts and the tonality of the overall photo.<br/> <br/>Hope this helps,<br/>Rich</td>', 'I like the perspective of the shot, and the completeness added by the shadows to complete the square in the perspective. I feel as there is a slight counter clockwise tilt to the photo, could be just me. The only thing I would change is have my model closer to the front as there is already plenty of ojects in this photo to support the depth. I do like the contrasts and the tonality of the overall photo. Hope this helps,Rich', '2007-03-14 16:03:14.000000', NULL, 0),
