(3507082, 471447, 27763, '<td valign="top">I''m very impressed that you waited for four hours to get this shot.  I like to see that level of dedication.<br/> <br/>About the shot:  I like that the boy doesn''t look like a stereotype of someone you would expect to see in a photo like this (i.e. wrinkled old man/woman dressed quaintly).  Not that there''s anything wrong with photos of wrinkled old men/women dressed quaintly, but it''s refreshing to see a photo of someone a little less stereotypical for this type of shot.  <br/> <br/>Your title is perfect.  And the lighting is nice, too.</td>', 'I''m very impressed that you waited for four hours to get this shot.  I like to see that level of dedication. About the shot:  I like that the boy doesn''t look like a stereotype of someone you would expect to see in a photo like this (i.e. wrinkled old man/woman dressed quaintly).  Not that there''s anything wrong with photos of wrinkled old men/women dressed quaintly, but it''s refreshing to see a photo of someone a little less stereotypical for this type of shot.   Your title is perfect.  And the lighting is nice, too.', '2007-04-01 20:22:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(3517245, 470725, 48560, '<td valign="top">i have to say, the image size puts this photo in a disadvantage, because clearly this shot would have been MUCH better in larger sizes. i reckon that''s how it could have been, because then the coke bottle would stood out even more, with enough details on it to please folks. that huge bag is stealing all the attention here, but there''s nothing to see on it.<br/> <br/>crayon</td>', 'i have to say, the image size puts this photo in a disadvantage, because clearly this shot would have been MUCH better in larger sizes. i reckon that''s how it could have been, because then the coke bottle would stood out even more, with enough details on it to please folks. that huge bag is stealing all the attention here, but there''s nothing to see on it. crayon', '2007-04-04 02:58:12.000000', NULL, 0),
